(1504100, 199545, 29154, '<td valign="top">Great macro, funny title !</td>', 'Great macro, funny title !', '2005-07-04 09:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504101, 198669, 34192, '<td valign="top">its very difficult to look at food in black and white with any desire (to eat) what so ever  Looking at this as an image of an object rather than food, you did a good job capturing the tonal difference between the contents of the glass and the salt and the ice.  The drip is a nice touch.  I think you should have taken the seed out before photgraphing.  The blur of the background/piece of fruit detracts from the image but I like the composition.</td>', 'its very difficult to look at food in black and white with any desire (to eat) what so ever  Looking at this as an image of an object rather than food, you did a good job capturing the tonal difference between the contents of the glass and the salt and the ice.  The drip is a nice touch.  I think you should have taken the seed out before photgraphing.  The blur of the background/piece of fruit detracts from the image but I like the composition.', '2005-07-04 09:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504103, 199039, 5354, '<td valign="top">Quite a dark image, possibly needs a little better lighting in order to gain some DOF</td>', 'Quite a dark image, possibly needs a little better lighting in order to gain some DOF', '2005-07-04 09:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504105, 197624, 5354, '<td valign="top">Don''t understand the title, but the closeup is perfectly executed</td>', 'Don''t understand the title, but the closeup is perfectly executed', '2005-07-04 09:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504106, 199500, 34192, '<td valign="top">This could be a great image if the lighting were a little better.  As is the yellow cast is unappetizing.</td>', 'This could be a great image if the lighting were a little better.  As is the yellow cast is unappetizing.', '2005-07-04 09:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504107, 199595, 29154, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors ! Great composition ! Wow !</td>', 'Gorgeous colors ! Great composition ! Wow !', '2005-07-04 09:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504111, 199519, 5354, '<td valign="top">OH !!  what an unusual subject. Not something I expected. Difficult to know how to mark this. Certainly ''out of the box''.</td>', 'OH !!  what an unusual subject. Not something I expected. Difficult to know how to mark this. Certainly ''out of the box''.', '2005-07-04 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504112, 199543, 5354, '<td valign="top">That bright patch to the left relly drags my eye over there and almost makes the rose the secondary subject. Otherwise I like it</td>', 'That bright patch to the left relly drags my eye over there and almost makes the rose the secondary subject. Otherwise I like it', '2005-07-04 09:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504113, 198284, 37719, '<td valign="top">Hmm...they look more like ''tubes'' to me.  Where did youget valves from?  Nice shot.  Very clear.</td>', 'Hmm...they look more like ''tubes'' to me.  Where did youget valves from?  Nice shot.  Very clear.', '2005-07-04 09:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504114, 199069, 34192, '<td valign="top">Please tell me he is on skin!  I don''t want to hear you have a hairy sidewalk!  Excellent detail for such a close image.  DOF excellent, POV great.  Composition good.  Outside the challenge, it might be good to include a little more of the arm/leg/belly whatever to give a better sense of place so people aren''t left wondering...  7 Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Please tell me he is on skin!  I don''t want to hear you have a hairy sidewalk!  Excellent detail for such a close image.  DOF excellent, POV great.  Composition good.  Outside the challenge, it might be good to include a little more of the arm/leg/belly whatever to give a better sense of place so people aren''t left wondering...  7 Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-07-04 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504115, 199080, 5354, '<td valign="top">I had several shots where my bug just managed to predict the shutter ;-)</td>', 'I had several shots where my bug just managed to predict the shutter ;-)', '2005-07-04 09:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504118, 199048, 23478, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and perspective... 10.</td>', 'I love the colors and perspective... 10.', '2005-07-04 09:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504119, 197909, 29154, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro, but I don''t know about the hair ....</td>', 'Wonderful macro, but I don''t know about the hair ....', '2005-07-04 09:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504120, 199612, 5354, '<td valign="top">Because of the softness of the glass the image doesn''t feel sharp. I guess some people will misinterpret that and mark it down. Also because of the colour scheme it doesn''t have any WOW, which is one of the main things voters look for.</td>', 'Because of the softness of the glass the image doesn''t feel sharp. I guess some people will misinterpret that and mark it down. Also because of the colour scheme it doesn''t have any WOW, which is one of the main things voters look for.', '2005-07-04 09:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
