(1504537, 198338, 24454, '<td valign="top">Nice job.   The reflection almost makes him look like a wiry butterfly  :)    It gives it more interest.</td>', 'Nice job.   The reflection almost makes him look like a wiry butterfly  :)    It gives it more interest.', '2005-07-04 11:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
