(1504553, 197756, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro shot!    Just for compositional interest, I might have cropped it so he wasn''t quite so centered, but it''s a really good photo anyway.  I like the color contrast.  8</td>', 'Very nice macro shot!    Just for compositional interest, I might have cropped it so he wasn''t quite so centered, but it''s a really good photo anyway.  I like the color contrast.  8', '2005-07-04 11:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
