(1504565, 199677, 14671, '<td valign="top">I''m not particular fond of the angle of the subject.  It does however draw your eye into the photo and the photo has nice tones to it.  excellent colors and good choice in DoF.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.&lt;7&gt;</td>', 'I''m not particular fond of the angle of the subject.  It does however draw your eye into the photo and the photo has nice tones to it.  excellent colors and good choice in DoF.  Well done and good luck in this challenge.<7>', '2005-07-04 11:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
