(1504594, 199345, 15711, '<td valign="top">I missed this the first time I was perusing the challenge.  I like this alot.  I remember hanging clothes on the line! The sepia is a perfect filter. Nice use of shadow and focus on the main clothespin.  I wish it were a larger picture though.</td>', 'I missed this the first time I was perusing the challenge.  I like this alot.  I remember hanging clothes on the line! The sepia is a perfect filter. Nice use of shadow and focus on the main clothespin.  I wish it were a larger picture though.', '2005-07-04 12:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504597, 199406, 24454, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see something besides a flower or a bug.   I like the composition of ths a lot with the black background and the vibrant red.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s nice to see something besides a flower or a bug.   I like the composition of ths a lot with the black background and the vibrant red.  Good luck.', '2005-07-04 12:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504599, 198700, 33672, '<td valign="top">Exquisite color! Very crisp!</td>', 'Exquisite color! Very crisp!', '2005-07-04 12:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504600, 198175, 15711, '<td valign="top">Beatiful colors. Nice shadowing and not harsh lighting, but the overall effect doesn''t have the crisp detail I''m lookiung for in a macro.  Maybe work on the sharpness a bit.</td>', 'Beatiful colors. Nice shadowing and not harsh lighting, but the overall effect doesn''t have the crisp detail I''m lookiung for in a macro.  Maybe work on the sharpness a bit.', '2005-07-04 12:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504602, 198622, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!    Excellent job.  THAT is up close and personal -- and the colors are so pretty.</td>', 'Wow!    Excellent job.  THAT is up close and personal -- and the colors are so pretty.', '2005-07-04 12:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504603, 198288, 15811, '<td valign="top">It''s a decent shot, but compositionally, there''s just nothing strong to hold attention.  Even when dealing with ''macros'' or ''close shots'' -- you can still pay good bit of attention to composition and rule of thirds or leading lines -- just have to get a bit more creative.  Anyway...6...good job, but could be better if you spent more time thinking about it.</td>', 'It''s a decent shot, but compositionally, there''s just nothing strong to hold attention.  Even when dealing with ''macros'' or ''close shots'' -- you can still pay good bit of attention to composition and rule of thirds or leading lines -- just have to get a bit more creative.  Anyway...6...good job, but could be better if you spent more time thinking about it.', '2005-07-04 12:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504604, 199419, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very linear and simple. The shades of gold on the feather due to the lighting is quite convincing. I see it in a contemporary setting with a simple frame.</td>', 'Very linear and simple. The shades of gold on the feather due to the lighting is quite convincing. I see it in a contemporary setting with a simple frame.', '2005-07-04 12:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504605, 199466, 33672, '<td valign="top">If the whole frog were crisp, I''d ten it.</td>', 'If the whole frog were crisp, I''d ten it.', '2005-07-04 12:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504606, 197427, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes it is!   Pretty in pink that is.   I love the soft muted colors.  The lighting is wonderful, and you have good detail in the flower.  Great shot!</td>', 'Yes it is!   Pretty in pink that is.   I love the soft muted colors.  The lighting is wonderful, and you have good detail in the flower.  Great shot!', '2005-07-04 12:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504607, 197784, 15711, '<td valign="top">. It''s glowing effect seems a tad overdone to me. I wish it had better sharpness.</td>', '. It''s glowing effect seems a tad overdone to me. I wish it had better sharpness.', '2005-07-04 12:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504608, 199385, 15711, '<td valign="top">Close ups of technical items don''t hold alot of interest for me. I think if you could zoom in tighter on one component, it might have more WOW factor. But maybe your camera doesn''t have that capability. I certainly understand that.</td>', 'Close ups of technical items don''t hold alot of interest for me. I think if you could zoom in tighter on one component, it might have more WOW factor. But maybe your camera doesn''t have that capability. I certainly understand that.', '2005-07-04 12:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504610, 196724, 14671, '<td valign="top">wow great shot.  I''m not fond of the levelness of the photo but at the same time it provides a certain unique characteristic.  As distrcting as the reflections are in the bubbles I can''t help but wonder what it is which gives that much more interest to this shot.  Excellent color and clarity.  Well done and good luck in this challenge. &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'wow great shot.  I''m not fond of the levelness of the photo but at the same time it provides a certain unique characteristic.  As distrcting as the reflections are in the bubbles I can''t help but wonder what it is which gives that much more interest to this shot.  Excellent color and clarity.  Well done and good luck in this challenge. <10>', '2005-07-04 12:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504611, 198339, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would be really well done if the colors were vibrant and it was in focus.  The prism effect off the left is a nice touch, but overall... sharpness would be the key.</td>', 'This would be really well done if the colors were vibrant and it was in focus.  The prism effect off the left is a nice touch, but overall... sharpness would be the key.', '2005-07-04 12:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504612, 197205, 15811, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I can''t imagine why you cut the top of the flower off.  The DOF is probably just a tad low in this one to bring out the flower to its fullest.  Try bumping up a notch in aperture...certainly the background would still be out of focus.  Like I said, great colors, 6</td>', 'Great colors.  I can''t imagine why you cut the top of the flower off.  The DOF is probably just a tad low in this one to bring out the flower to its fullest.  Try bumping up a notch in aperture...certainly the background would still be out of focus.  Like I said, great colors, 6', '2005-07-04 12:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504613, 199639, 33672, '<td valign="top">Needs a bit more light. Great comp.</td>', 'Needs a bit more light. Great comp.', '2005-07-04 12:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504615, 199497, 19095, '<td valign="top">The best one!!</td>', 'The best one!!', '2005-07-04 12:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504616, 198866, 15711, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s waving doesn''t it. This is a nice tight shot with a good bit of contrast. If it were me, I''d alleviate part of the white above and to the right.</td>', 'Looks like he''s waving doesn''t it. This is a nice tight shot with a good bit of contrast. If it were me, I''d alleviate part of the white above and to the right.', '2005-07-04 12:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504617, 199385, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh. . .what a frightening photo  :)   But an EXCELLENT macros hot.   The sharpness and detail are amazing.  And it''s pretty refreshing after so many flowers and bugs.  10</td>', 'Oh. . .what a frightening photo  :)   But an EXCELLENT macros hot.   The sharpness and detail are amazing.  And it''s pretty refreshing after so many flowers and bugs.  10', '2005-07-04 12:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504619, 199581, 15811, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty good..haha.  I like the title.  That blade of grass that he is peaking around though, detracts from the subject and is super distracting.  Great idea though...6</td>', 'That''s pretty good..haha.  I like the title.  That blade of grass that he is peaking around though, detracts from the subject and is super distracting.  Great idea though...6', '2005-07-04 12:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504620, 197576, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very pretty!</td>', 'Very pretty!', '2005-07-04 12:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504621, 198962, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is almost like a sparkler of water droplets! I like the muted golden tone in the background.  To my eye, it needs a tad more sharpness but I like the simplicity of it very much. The red at the bottom adds a nice touch of contrast to the otherwise monochromatic theme.</td>', 'This is almost like a sparkler of water droplets! I like the muted golden tone in the background.  To my eye, it needs a tad more sharpness but I like the simplicity of it very much. The red at the bottom adds a nice touch of contrast to the otherwise monochromatic theme.', '2005-07-04 12:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504623, 197169, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is really pretty.   I had no idea a dandelion could look like that.</td>', 'That is really pretty.   I had no idea a dandelion could look like that.', '2005-07-04 12:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504626, 198071, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think this is so abstract that the eye has a hard time figuring out what it is. The focus and lighting are fine, but maybe if it were shot from a different angle, it might be more effective.</td>', 'I think this is so abstract that the eye has a hard time figuring out what it is. The focus and lighting are fine, but maybe if it were shot from a different angle, it might be more effective.', '2005-07-04 12:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504629, 199310, 15711, '<td valign="top">This would be a perfect time to use single color saturation on one of the flowers.  As it is now, it seems a bit busy to me. Maybe crop out some of the foliage and zoom in on the center blossom. You could up the contrast a little as well. Hope this helps.</td>', 'This would be a perfect time to use single color saturation on one of the flowers.  As it is now, it seems a bit busy to me. Maybe crop out some of the foliage and zoom in on the center blossom. You could up the contrast a little as well. Hope this helps.', '2005-07-04 12:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504630, 199247, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.   I love how this one has enough depth of field to keep the entire flower  &amp; bugs in sharp, crisp focus.    The contrast of the soft greens and that beautiful purple make this so pretty to look at.  And even tho I hate bugs -- and pictures of them -- I have to admit, this is about as close as you can get to the perfect macro shot.  Good luck. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot.   I love how this one has enough depth of field to keep the entire flower  & bugs in sharp, crisp focus.    The contrast of the soft greens and that beautiful purple make this so pretty to look at.  And even tho I hate bugs -- and pictures of them -- I have to admit, this is about as close as you can get to the perfect macro shot.  Good luck. 10', '2005-07-04 12:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504635, 198356, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has good composition but the saturation seems a bit brash to me. Maybe it''s the bright sunlight and it''s the exposure? I''d crop out most of the green in the background to eliminate a bit of distraction. I like the gold of his wing against the pink of the flower - that creates a nice bit of contrast.</td>', 'This has good composition but the saturation seems a bit brash to me. Maybe it''s the bright sunlight and it''s the exposure? I''d crop out most of the green in the background to eliminate a bit of distraction. I like the gold of his wing against the pink of the flower - that creates a nice bit of contrast.', '2005-07-04 12:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504636, 197333, 15832, '<td valign="top">very well done! good capture of the colorsþþþ   9</td>', 'very well done! good capture of the colorsþþþ   9', '2005-07-04 12:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504638, 199363, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is BEAUTIFUL!   I love the depth that the fern leaves have.   They look 3-dimensional.  You can see every little vein in them, and just to add the perfect macro touch, a not-too-disgusting-looking little bug.   One of my favorites in this challenge so far.   Good luck!  10</td>', 'Oh this is BEAUTIFUL!   I love the depth that the fern leaves have.   They look 3-dimensional.  You can see every little vein in them, and just to add the perfect macro touch, a not-too-disgusting-looking little bug.   One of my favorites in this challenge so far.   Good luck!  10', '2005-07-04 12:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504639, 199351, 3569, '<td valign="top">focus is on front of flower so subject fly is off a bit to me</td>', 'focus is on front of flower so subject fly is off a bit to me', '2005-07-04 12:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504640, 198806, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the rich warm colors.  THe lighting is nice but overall, it doesn''t have a focal point. My eye just wanders around, trying to find something to land on.  Maybe it would be more effective for me if you had zoomed in on one or two of them, so we could see the details. Maybe your camera isn''t equipped for that. In that case, I understand.</td>', 'I love the rich warm colors.  THe lighting is nice but overall, it doesn''t have a focal point. My eye just wanders around, trying to find something to land on.  Maybe it would be more effective for me if you had zoomed in on one or two of them, so we could see the details. Maybe your camera isn''t equipped for that. In that case, I understand.', '2005-07-04 12:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504641, 196941, 15711, '<td valign="top">Don''t be sorry.  This is a fine fellow. I like that you concentrated on his upper body. As ugly as he is, he is almost architectural in his composition. The lighting skimming over his body is well done.  I''d like a bit of sparkle in his eye though.</td>', 'Don''t be sorry.  This is a fine fellow. I like that you concentrated on his upper body. As ugly as he is, he is almost architectural in his composition. The lighting skimming over his body is well done.  I''d like a bit of sparkle in his eye though.', '2005-07-04 12:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1504643, 198055, 28070, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, except for that white portion at the bottom could have been cropped out. Looks kinda dirty and dull for eye popping color.  Good shot though.</td>', 'Pretty cool, except for that white portion at the bottom could have been cropped out. Looks kinda dirty and dull for eye popping color.  Good shot though.', '2005-07-04 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
