(1504712, 198478, 15711, '<td valign="top">Blue and yellow - makes a nice contrast. His shadow on the petal is a nice effect. I''d crop out alot of the area on the right, but still leave him off center.</td>', 'Blue and yellow - makes a nice contrast. His shadow on the petal is a nice effect. I''d crop out alot of the area on the right, but still leave him off center.', '2005-07-04 12:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
