(1506072, 199447, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This belongs in a science book!  I have never seen an insect in such detail before...just amazing.  Good colors and lighting.  The detail and clarity of the shot are superb!</td>', 'Wow!  This belongs in a science book!  I have never seen an insect in such detail before...just amazing.  Good colors and lighting.  The detail and clarity of the shot are superb!', '2005-07-04 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506074, 197179, 19982, '<td valign="top">This shot has potential.  I think the main thing that could be improved is the focus.  If you look at the wing on the right, or the bee''s abdomen, those appear to be more in focus than the torso or head of the bee.  I would also try a lower angle (less straight on at the flower) and to the front of the bee.  It would add a little 3D effect to it.  Plus, if you keep the shallow DOF, the head would be sharp while the abdomen would be slightly blurred, thus adding more to the 3D effect.</td>', 'This shot has potential.  I think the main thing that could be improved is the focus.  If you look at the wing on the right, or the bee''s abdomen, those appear to be more in focus than the torso or head of the bee.  I would also try a lower angle (less straight on at the flower) and to the front of the bee.  It would add a little 3D effect to it.  Plus, if you keep the shallow DOF, the head would be sharp while the abdomen would be slightly blurred, thus adding more to the 3D effect.', '2005-07-04 19:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506075, 199354, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good composition!  Lots of nice crisp detail in the photo, especially on the bee.  Just marvelous.  Beautiful colors and the exposure looks great as well.</td>', 'Good composition!  Lots of nice crisp detail in the photo, especially on the bee.  Just marvelous.  Beautiful colors and the exposure looks great as well.', '2005-07-04 19:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506077, 196888, 35513, '<td valign="top">Amazing detail on this shot!  Just incredible.  It''s amazing to see a bee up this close and personal.</td>', 'Amazing detail on this shot!  Just incredible.  It''s amazing to see a bee up this close and personal.', '2005-07-04 19:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506078, 199011, 19982, '<td valign="top">The bee itself is too blurry.  It may be that you didn''t get a good focus lock on it, or that the bee is too close for your lens to focus.  Try backing up ever so slightly and see if that helps.</td>', 'The bee itself is too blurry.  It may be that you didn''t get a good focus lock on it, or that the bee is too close for your lens to focus.  Try backing up ever so slightly and see if that helps.', '2005-07-04 19:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506081, 199103, 35513, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing clarity on such a small subject!  Definitely fits the macro theme!!  Really good colors on the dragonfly, and I''m glad that you put the finger/thumb in the shot so that we can see how small this critter is in real life.  Very nicely done.  Good composition as well.</td>', 'Wow, amazing clarity on such a small subject!  Definitely fits the macro theme!!  Really good colors on the dragonfly, and I''m glad that you put the finger/thumb in the shot so that we can see how small this critter is in real life.  Very nicely done.  Good composition as well.', '2005-07-04 19:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506082, 198798, 16241, '<td valign="top">good shot</td>', 'good shot', '2005-07-04 19:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
