(1506106, 198724, 35513, '<td valign="top">Incredible detail on this shot!  Very well done!!  I like the two flies on his claws as well...that''s just stunning.  Really nice shot.  Good composition and nice colors as well.</td>', 'Incredible detail on this shot!  Very well done!!  I like the two flies on his claws as well...that''s just stunning.  Really nice shot.  Good composition and nice colors as well.', '2005-07-04 19:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
