(1506111, 197846, 35513, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  Clarity and detail of the shot look great.  Lighting is good and composition is good as well.  I feel like this little guy is staring at me!</td>', 'Great colors!  Clarity and detail of the shot look great.  Lighting is good and composition is good as well.  I feel like this little guy is staring at me!', '2005-07-04 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
