(1506118, 198175, 30822, '<td valign="top">IMHO the lighting  is flat, needs more contrast. Also focus is a little to soft for my taste.</td>', 'IMHO the lighting  is flat, needs more contrast. Also focus is a little to soft for my taste.', '2005-07-04 19:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
