(1506480, 196659, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Wow.  Are those antennae real?  This creature is beautiful and you have captured it very well.  Looks like a costume from an extravagant opera.  Colors are so vivid and rich, the gold is ''unreal''.  Against the ''earth/pebble background''?,  I don''t know, perhaps it adds a texture contrast.  For me, given the ''fabric'' of the subject, something equally as luxurious as a background, or else plain, would be better.  Is it dead, or just ''resting'' ?</td>', '9 - Wow.  Are those antennae real?  This creature is beautiful and you have captured it very well.  Looks like a costume from an extravagant opera.  Colors are so vivid and rich, the gold is ''unreal''.  Against the ''earth/pebble background''?,  I don''t know, perhaps it adds a texture contrast.  For me, given the ''fabric'' of the subject, something equally as luxurious as a background, or else plain, would be better.  Is it dead, or just ''resting'' ?', '2005-07-04 22:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
