(1506556, 199447, 33672, '<td valign="top">I''ve always wanted to compete against the best. The fact that I entered this challenge and I''m competing against this photo assures me of this.  I''d be surprised to not see this with the blue. Nice, nice job! The comp and clarity are spectacular the DOF is perfect.</td>', 'I''ve always wanted to compete against the best. The fact that I entered this challenge and I''m competing against this photo assures me of this.  I''d be surprised to not see this with the blue. Nice, nice job! The comp and clarity are spectacular the DOF is perfect.', '2005-07-04 23:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
