(1506562, 198113, 33672, '<td valign="top">Pretty cat. I usually believe that in order to be considered a macro it should be larger than life. This doesn''t qualify.  I apologize if this is some type of miniture cat that I don''t know about.</td>', 'Pretty cat. I usually believe that in order to be considered a macro it should be larger than life. This doesn''t qualify.  I apologize if this is some type of miniture cat that I don''t know about.', '2005-07-04 23:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506567, 199417, 33672, '<td valign="top">Now in a true macro, I''d be able to see if they''re practicing safe sex or not.... (joking) great comp and clarity and one of my hightest scorers.</td>', 'Now in a true macro, I''d be able to see if they''re practicing safe sex or not.... (joking) great comp and clarity and one of my hightest scorers.', '2005-07-04 23:39:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506570, 196891, 33672, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the B/W adds to this. there needs to be more contrast for the subject to really pop out at me. Perhaps in color it would''ve... Still, its a great capture.</td>', 'I don''t know if the B/W adds to this. there needs to be more contrast for the subject to really pop out at me. Perhaps in color it would''ve... Still, its a great capture.', '2005-07-04 23:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506572, 199291, 33672, '<td valign="top">I really, really like the shadows and texture you''ve provided in this shot.</td>', 'I really, really like the shadows and texture you''ve provided in this shot.', '2005-07-04 23:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506576, 198927, 33672, '<td valign="top">The soft focus and lighting seem out of place in a macro challenge.</td>', 'The soft focus and lighting seem out of place in a macro challenge.', '2005-07-04 23:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506579, 199218, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great use of DOF to draw my attention to the main subject.</td>', 'Great use of DOF to draw my attention to the main subject.', '2005-07-04 23:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506605, 199292, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  More detail on the lemon segments would have been nice.  A little too much yellow for me, or perhaps it is just too dominant in the background.</td>', '7 - Nice.  More detail on the lemon segments would have been nice.  A little too much yellow for me, or perhaps it is just too dominant in the background.', '2005-07-04 23:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506611, 199472, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - The concept is good, just need detail or a close up.</td>', '5 - The concept is good, just need detail or a close up.', '2005-07-04 23:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506623, 199412, 30822, '<td valign="top">Very clear, The relection in the eye really bothers me though. (I know, just getting a cat to let you get a pic like this is impossible).</td>', 'Very clear, The relection in the eye really bothers me though. (I know, just getting a cat to let you get a pic like this is impossible).', '2005-07-04 23:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506624, 198926, 30822, '<td valign="top">Nice Conch shell. Better balance light and losing the shadows would have made this POP for me. IMHO.</td>', 'Nice Conch shell. Better balance light and losing the shadows would have made this POP for me. IMHO.', '2005-07-04 23:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506625, 198236, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Yeah.  I like this, but would just love to see more detail on the eyes, even the body (with that grid and gold?) and even the ''crossed over legs''.  Great with that background.  A little ''out of this world''.  I will be back to ''learn'' how you did this.</td>', '8 - Yeah.  I like this, but would just love to see more detail on the eyes, even the body (with that grid and gold?) and even the ''crossed over legs''.  Great with that background.  A little ''out of this world''.  I will be back to ''learn'' how you did this.', '2005-07-04 23:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506631, 198787, 30822, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is ok, but the ends of the pineconeare blown out and the shadows are a bit dark for my taste. Also the grass makes the backdround to busy a composition.</td>', 'The lighting on this is ok, but the ends of the pineconeare blown out and the shadows are a bit dark for my taste. Also the grass makes the backdround to busy a composition.', '2005-07-05 00:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506636, 198181, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good angle.  Great shot, just a little blurred around the ''front end''.  Guess it is because it moved, rather than a focus issue.  Good detail on the wings.</td>', '7 - Very good angle.  Great shot, just a little blurred around the ''front end''.  Guess it is because it moved, rather than a focus issue.  Good detail on the wings.', '2005-07-05 00:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506641, 199579, 30822, '<td valign="top">Good capture. Didn''t get real high marks because the focus is on the wing, so its face is soft focused. (I understand i t''s hard to focus on a moving insect). Also a tad bit grainy for my taste.</td>', 'Good capture. Didn''t get real high marks because the focus is on the wing, so its face is soft focused. (I understand i t''s hard to focus on a moving insect). Also a tad bit grainy for my taste.', '2005-07-05 00:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506642, 198506, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - I like the concept, but I think it may have been better in color?  More detail on the ''powder'' too would be good.</td>', '4 - I like the concept, but I think it may have been better in color?  More detail on the ''powder'' too would be good.', '2005-07-05 00:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506643, 199120, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Wow.  Very nice.  Nice color.  Nice and clean.  Perhaps a fraction different angle or cropping, not sure.</td>', '8 - Wow.  Very nice.  Nice color.  Nice and clean.  Perhaps a fraction different angle or cropping, not sure.', '2005-07-05 00:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506650, 198283, 30822, '<td valign="top">This picture looks overshaprened to me. Also a darker background would have made this POP better for me.</td>', 'This picture looks overshaprened to me. Also a darker background would have made this POP better for me.', '2005-07-05 00:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506654, 198665, 30822, '<td valign="top">Gave you a 9. Really like the composition and color!</td>', 'Gave you a 9. Really like the composition and color!', '2005-07-05 00:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506656, 198610, 30822, '<td valign="top">gave you an 8. Beautiful composition and detail. I just am not a fan of selective desat.</td>', 'gave you an 8. Beautiful composition and detail. I just am not a fan of selective desat.', '2005-07-05 00:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506658, 198505, 30822, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful and well exposed.</td>', 'Very beautiful and well exposed.', '2005-07-05 00:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506660, 199528, 30822, '<td valign="top">Love the detail and the soft color.</td>', 'Love the detail and the soft color.', '2005-07-05 00:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506661, 196659, 30822, '<td valign="top">Good composition and excellent detail.</td>', 'Good composition and excellent detail.', '2005-07-05 00:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506662, 199279, 30822, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail and composition.</td>', 'Excellent detail and composition.', '2005-07-05 00:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506663, 196941, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good macro, but is missing something.  It needs something to bring it ''to life'' more.  Perhaps a different background, perhaps more emphasis on the greens/browns/coppers, not sure.  My first thought on seeing it was that it is a good ''matt'' image, so yes, perhaps less ''shine'', more emphasis on the textures, would make it near perfect.</td>', '8 - Good macro, but is missing something.  It needs something to bring it ''to life'' more.  Perhaps a different background, perhaps more emphasis on the greens/browns/coppers, not sure.  My first thought on seeing it was that it is a good ''matt'' image, so yes, perhaps less ''shine'', more emphasis on the textures, would make it near perfect.', '2005-07-05 00:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506665, 199342, 30822, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed. Very good detail.</td>', 'Nicely executed. Very good detail.', '2005-07-05 00:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506666, 198412, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Would like to have seen it more natural.</td>', '4 - Would like to have seen it more natural.', '2005-07-05 00:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506668, 198765, 30822, '<td valign="top">Nice pose by your cat. Iknow they don''t sit still very long. Mine always runs when it sees me with my camera.</td>', 'Nice pose by your cat. Iknow they don''t sit still very long. Mine always runs when it sees me with my camera.', '2005-07-05 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506672, 198644, 30822, '<td valign="top">outstanding detail and composition.<br/></td>', 'outstanding detail and composition.', '2005-07-05 00:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506684, 199497, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - This creature is amazing, like a body made of pipe cleaners.  For me, if you had cropped the bottom instead of the top (the wings) it would be much better.  Also ''fore focus'' too.  Would just love to see that abdomen in detail.  Those antennae are, amazing.</td>', '7 - This creature is amazing, like a body made of pipe cleaners.  For me, if you had cropped the bottom instead of the top (the wings) it would be much better.  Also ''fore focus'' too.  Would just love to see that abdomen in detail.  Those antennae are, amazing.', '2005-07-05 00:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506687, 197886, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Perhaps more light on the tips.</td>', '7 - Good.  Perhaps more light on the tips.', '2005-07-05 00:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506688, 199519, 31742, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2005-07-05 00:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
