(1506959, 198841, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - This is a little different, the focus (for me) is fairly good, perhaps the left antenna could be in more, but it is the black and white that I am not sure about.  I wonder if this didn''t look better in color.  I understand the b/w concept though.  Just not sure if it works (for me).  The cropping/centering could do with a nudge to the left too.</td>', '6 - This is a little different, the focus (for me) is fairly good, perhaps the left antenna could be in more, but it is the black and white that I am not sure about.  I wonder if this didn''t look better in color.  I understand the b/w concept though.  Just not sure if it works (for me).  The cropping/centering could do with a nudge to the left too.', '2005-07-05 01:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1506967, 199213, 39850, '<td valign="top">4 - Great concept and ''stage''.  Good shadow of the bee even .  As I am sure you know, it just needs that ''focus''.  A slightly tighter zoom might have helped, not sure.</td>', '4 - Great concept and ''stage''.  Good shadow of the bee even .  As I am sure you know, it just needs that ''focus''.  A slightly tighter zoom might have helped, not sure.', '2005-07-05 01:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
