(1507057, 199447, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Yeah.  This is why I had to vote (even via comments) on the Macro Challenge.  There is nothing like a macro perspective.  This photo is very near perfect.  Okay, perhaps a little straightening, the two ahh antennae? in focus more, a more uniform background, a touch less shine on the ''snout'', I don''t know.  Very good macro.  Great perspective.  Good colors.</td>', '9 - Yeah.  This is why I had to vote (even via comments) on the Macro Challenge.  There is nothing like a macro perspective.  This photo is very near perfect.  Okay, perhaps a little straightening, the two ahh antennae? in focus more, a more uniform background, a touch less shine on the ''snout'', I don''t know.  Very good macro.  Great perspective.  Good colors.', '2005-07-05 02:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507066, 199672, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice concept.  Just needs focus.</td>', '5 - Nice concept.  Just needs focus.', '2005-07-05 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507070, 199453, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Again, another photo good enough that it doesn''t matter if it has a title or not.  For me though, a slightly different angle (to the left where the focal point is sharpest) would make this a much better photograph.  More detail on those drops on the stamen would be nice.  The stigma is out of focus, so perhaps crop that out, as the ''mushroom'' like ''anthers'' do look good.  A fraction more focus on those main points perhaps.  The shadow of the stamens is nice and again, if the picture were ''nudged'' to the right a fraction, they would be the ''stars'' of this picture.  Very nice though and good colors.</td>', '8 - Again, another photo good enough that it doesn''t matter if it has a title or not.  For me though, a slightly different angle (to the left where the focal point is sharpest) would make this a much better photograph.  More detail on those drops on the stamen would be nice.  The stigma is out of focus, so perhaps crop that out, as the ''mushroom'' like ''anthers'' do look good.  A fraction more focus on those main points perhaps.  The shadow of the stamens is nice and again, if the picture were ''nudged'' to the right a fraction, they would be the ''stars'' of this picture.  Very nice though and good colors.', '2005-07-05 02:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507073, 199301, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Good concept, would like to see a lot more detail and maybe even some type of depth.  I have to wonder about color v b/w though, especially with all those translucent reflective wings about.</td>', '5 - Good concept, would like to see a lot more detail and maybe even some type of depth.  I have to wonder about color v b/w though, especially with all those translucent reflective wings about.', '2005-07-05 02:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507079, 199401, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Potential.  For me, too dirty.  Needs finer focus.  Maybe a brighter background, or more of that which is there.  Not sure if it is dead or not but, doesn''t look too good.</td>', '6 - Potential.  For me, too dirty.  Needs finer focus.  Maybe a brighter background, or more of that which is there.  Not sure if it is dead or not but, doesn''t look too good.', '2005-07-05 02:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507088, 198055, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - I reloaded this page because I thought part did not load down the bottom, but it seems it is the photo.  This IS a good shot, ''if only'' it were closer and more detail.  Very good ''capture'' though.  Perhaps a different cropping, a little ''color adjustment'', not sure.</td>', '6 - I reloaded this page because I thought part did not load down the bottom, but it seems it is the photo.  This IS a good shot, ''if only'' it were closer and more detail.  Very good ''capture'' though.  Perhaps a different cropping, a little ''color adjustment'', not sure.', '2005-07-05 02:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507095, 198356, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice.  Flower entirely in the frame and the right wing in focus, would make this a much better picture for me.</td>', '6 - Nice.  Flower entirely in the frame and the right wing in focus, would make this a much better picture for me.', '2005-07-05 02:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507098, 199511, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Nice and clean, though for me, it would be better cropped differently.</td>', '5 - Nice and clean, though for me, it would be better cropped differently.', '2005-07-05 02:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507102, 199671, 6804, '<td valign="top">I just love the simplicity here.  The shallow depth is so perfect.</td>', 'I just love the simplicity here.  The shallow depth is so perfect.', '2005-07-05 02:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507103, 199515, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Wow.   This is very nice.  The color combination is beautiful.  The ''golden'' anthers stand out, and for me, would be perfect with a touch more detail/focus.  A very warm photograph, good focal points.  A slight distraction down the very base of the stamens, the ''darkness'', otherwise just about perfect.  Very nice.</td>', '9 - Wow.   This is very nice.  The color combination is beautiful.  The ''golden'' anthers stand out, and for me, would be perfect with a touch more detail/focus.  A very warm photograph, good focal points.  A slight distraction down the very base of the stamens, the ''darkness'', otherwise just about perfect.  Very nice.', '2005-07-05 02:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507110, 199597, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Jumps out this one.  I do not know if it is naturally green, or pp, but the texture, like satin, is very nice.  The centre is captured well, I like the colors.  I am not sure about the black background.  I will wait and see how you did it.</td>', '7 - Jumps out this one.  I do not know if it is naturally green, or pp, but the texture, like satin, is very nice.  The centre is captured well, I like the colors.  I am not sure about the black background.  I will wait and see how you did it.', '2005-07-05 03:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507114, 199590, 34985, '<td valign="top">MMMM looks good!!</td>', 'MMMM looks good!!', '2005-07-05 03:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507115, 199635, 34985, '<td valign="top">Wow. Awesome macro.</td>', 'Wow. Awesome macro.', '2005-07-05 03:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507116, 198558, 35775, '<td valign="top">I think this is a fantastic photo great detail of the feather &amp; i love how the water droplet has magified the feather even more, great job well done.</td>', 'I think this is a fantastic photo great detail of the feather & i love how the water droplet has magified the feather even more, great job well done.', '2005-07-05 03:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507118, 199520, 34985, '<td valign="top">This is absolutly beautiful.  Great work</td>', 'This is absolutly beautiful.  Great work', '2005-07-05 03:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507119, 198448, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the "negative" effect.  Go ahead and make your picture size as large as DPC will allow.  This will let voters/commenters see the detail of your photo and appreciate it for it''s full value.</td>', 'Interesting use of the "negative" effect.  Go ahead and make your picture size as large as DPC will allow.  This will let voters/commenters see the detail of your photo and appreciate it for it''s full value.', '2005-07-05 03:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507120, 198175, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors on this shot.  It almost appears as some kind of artistic filter has been used on this photo, which loses some of the detail.  Good composition and subject choice.</td>', 'Very nice colors on this shot.  It almost appears as some kind of artistic filter has been used on this photo, which loses some of the detail.  Good composition and subject choice.', '2005-07-05 03:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507121, 198558, 34985, '<td valign="top">FEATHER.</td>', 'FEATHER.', '2005-07-05 03:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507122, 198339, 35513, '<td valign="top">Creative choice of subject!  Composition is ok.  Lighting is perhaps a bit of an issue, as we''re getting a glare at the top left.  Detail on the photo could be just a little more crisp.</td>', 'Creative choice of subject!  Composition is ok.  Lighting is perhaps a bit of an issue, as we''re getting a glare at the top left.  Detail on the photo could be just a little more crisp.', '2005-07-05 03:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507123, 198857, 35513, '<td valign="top">The detail on the flower is very clear and the color is lovely.  I find the blurred portrait in the background a little distracting because it overshadows the smaller subject.  Perhaps if more of the flower were shown, or from a different angle, the background wouldn''t be so overpowering.  I like the idea though, and it was nice to see something new in this challenge!</td>', 'The detail on the flower is very clear and the color is lovely.  I find the blurred portrait in the background a little distracting because it overshadows the smaller subject.  Perhaps if more of the flower were shown, or from a different angle, the background wouldn''t be so overpowering.  I like the idea though, and it was nice to see something new in this challenge!', '2005-07-05 03:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507125, 199669, 31443, '<td valign="top">Unsightly halo all around the flowerand leaves, would probably have been better to crop this tighter not leaving so much negative space.</td>', 'Unsightly halo all around the flowerand leaves, would probably have been better to crop this tighter not leaving so much negative space.', '2005-07-05 03:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507126, 199314, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but my eye doesn''t feel like it has anything with detail to focus on.  The lighting looks good and I like the suggestion of colors in the background.</td>', 'Interesting composition, but my eye doesn''t feel like it has anything with detail to focus on.  The lighting looks good and I like the suggestion of colors in the background.', '2005-07-05 03:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507127, 199536, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very good.  Very good detail, good angle, good colors (converted to b/w?), like a lumpy rug with eyes.  Maybe just the very foreground needs cropping or focus.  Otherwise yes, very good macro and the perspective?, well, unique (understatement) and ''intimate'' (can''t look at it too long).</td>', '9 - Very good.  Very good detail, good angle, good colors (converted to b/w?), like a lumpy rug with eyes.  Maybe just the very foreground needs cropping or focus.  Otherwise yes, very good macro and the perspective?, well, unique (understatement) and ''intimate'' (can''t look at it too long).', '2005-07-05 03:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507128, 199672, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good detail and clarity on the grasshopper.  I think that grass or some other texture might have made a more interesting background for this little critter, making him stand out more.  I like the angle of this shot quite a bit--gets us down on his level.</td>', 'Good detail and clarity on the grasshopper.  I think that grass or some other texture might have made a more interesting background for this little critter, making him stand out more.  I like the angle of this shot quite a bit--gets us down on his level.', '2005-07-05 03:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507129, 199595, 31443, '<td valign="top">I kind of like the intense color but not the blur...</td>', 'I kind of like the intense color but not the blur...', '2005-07-05 03:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507131, 198278, 31443, '<td valign="top">Out of the box is good..</td>', 'Out of the box is good..', '2005-07-05 03:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507134, 199213, 35513, '<td valign="top">Colors in this photo are good.  I like seeing the bee in motion.  I think that the harsh sun causes us to lose some of the detail on the insect, especially in the wings.  Perhaps underexposing the photo would help a little with that.  Good composition!</td>', 'Colors in this photo are good.  I like seeing the bee in motion.  I think that the harsh sun causes us to lose some of the detail on the insect, especially in the wings.  Perhaps underexposing the photo would help a little with that.  Good composition!', '2005-07-05 03:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507135, 198525, 31443, '<td valign="top">I like the old look of the faucet gives the image a warm glow..</td>', 'I like the old look of the faucet gives the image a warm glow..', '2005-07-05 03:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507136, 198358, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - This is excellent.  Color is excellent.  Perhaps the only things (for me) would be more detail/focus on the eye pattern, no shine around the end of the ''snout'', *possibly* a different color background, don''t know.  This is so close to perfect, an excellent shot.</td>', '9 - This is excellent.  Color is excellent.  Perhaps the only things (for me) would be more detail/focus on the eye pattern, no shine around the end of the ''snout'', *possibly* a different color background, don''t know.  This is so close to perfect, an excellent shot.', '2005-07-05 03:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507137, 199521, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good detail on this shot, and definitely nice and close.  I feel like the colors in the shot are a little bit flat.  Not sure if that''s due to lighting or what.  But I feel like if the blue on the wrapper was brighter and the color of the chocolate stood out a bit more, this photo would really pop.  I like the composition a lot, with the chocolate over to the side.</td>', 'Good detail on this shot, and definitely nice and close.  I feel like the colors in the shot are a little bit flat.  Not sure if that''s due to lighting or what.  But I feel like if the blue on the wrapper was brighter and the color of the chocolate stood out a bit more, this photo would really pop.  I like the composition a lot, with the chocolate over to the side.', '2005-07-05 03:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507138, 199484, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and detail.  Nice colors on this shot as well.</td>', 'Good clarity and detail.  Nice colors on this shot as well.', '2005-07-05 03:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507139, 199292, 34985, '<td valign="top">I like the yellow background. This is a very nice summer time shot as well.</td>', 'I like the yellow background. This is a very nice summer time shot as well.', '2005-07-05 03:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507141, 196987, 34985, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Im giving you a high mark. very nice</td>', 'Very well done. Im giving you a high mark. very nice', '2005-07-05 03:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507142, 199354, 31443, '<td valign="top">Incredible texture, that creature looks cuddly and cute....almost</td>', 'Incredible texture, that creature looks cuddly and cute....almost', '2005-07-05 03:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507143, 199074, 34985, '<td valign="top">Cool!</td>', 'Cool!', '2005-07-05 03:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507144, 199492, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good photograph.  Good capture of the texture on the ahh, stigma?  and patterns on the ahh, petal?  For me, a close up macro of these two combinations would be superb, but for this shot, for me, no cropping the tip of the petal (?), perhaps a different angle, to incorporate/lose the brown ''stick'', not sure.  Just more ''simplicity'' for me would be better.</td>', '8 - Good photograph.  Good capture of the texture on the ahh, stigma?  and patterns on the ahh, petal?  For me, a close up macro of these two combinations would be superb, but for this shot, for me, no cropping the tip of the petal (?), perhaps a different angle, to incorporate/lose the brown ''stick'', not sure.  Just more ''simplicity'' for me would be better.', '2005-07-05 03:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507146, 199404, 34985, '<td valign="top">I really can''t tell what it is. I think I see a lime or a green apple. I think a better focus would have improved this shot.</td>', 'I really can''t tell what it is. I think I see a lime or a green apple. I think a better focus would have improved this shot.', '2005-07-05 03:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507150, 199131, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Yes, very good.  For me, better if the face and front ''feet'' were in finer detail/focus.  I do like the blue textured background, the red around the eyes looks good, I like the shine on the eyes.</td>', '7 - Yes, very good.  For me, better if the face and front ''feet'' were in finer detail/focus.  I do like the blue textured background, the red around the eyes looks good, I like the shine on the eyes.', '2005-07-05 03:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
