(1507159, 199654, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - This is a great photo.  Even a zoom/crop in more would be great, if possible.  For me, better if the front leg and antenna were in focus too.  The white ''hair'' against the green ''metal'' body looks very good.  Would like to have seen it up closer.</td>', '8 - This is a great photo.  Even a zoom/crop in more would be great, if possible.  For me, better if the front leg and antenna were in focus too.  The white ''hair'' against the green ''metal'' body looks very good.  Would like to have seen it up closer.', '2005-07-05 03:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507161, 199543, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice.  A little dark down the bottom for me, but nice and simple and the offset by the ''green'' left background is also nice.  Perhaps more focus on the petal edges would make it better for me, but the ''teeth'' on the edge of the sepals look good with the pink behind them and you might lose that focus, not sure.</td>', '7 - Nice.  A little dark down the bottom for me, but nice and simple and the offset by the ''green'' left background is also nice.  Perhaps more focus on the petal edges would make it better for me, but the ''teeth'' on the edge of the sepals look good with the pink behind them and you might lose that focus, not sure.', '2005-07-05 03:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507163, 199037, 31443, '<td valign="top">It''s always fun and interesting to see a closeup like this, a lot of life and action that we normally don''t notice..</td>', 'It''s always fun and interesting to see a closeup like this, a lot of life and action that we normally don''t notice..', '2005-07-05 03:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
