(1507235, 198421, 24330, '<td valign="top">lower angle = more col, less white</td>', 'lower angle = more col, less white', '2005-07-05 05:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507239, 199499, 24330, '<td valign="top">2 subjects competing, blank on left</td>', '2 subjects competing, blank on left', '2005-07-05 05:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507242, 199380, 24330, '<td valign="top">no balance, crop closer<br/></td>', 'no balance, crop closer', '2005-07-05 05:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507243, 196968, 24330, '<td valign="top">2 dark</td>', '2 dark', '2005-07-05 05:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507244, 198767, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Nice soft colors, with very sharp detail. &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Nice image. Nice soft colors, with very sharp detail. <7>', '2005-07-05 05:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507246, 199471, 30018, '<td valign="top">I must say, you have taken a most dreaded weed and made it look incredibly beautiful.  If it looked that nice in my yard, I might just leave it there.  Extemely interesting angle of a less than popular subject.  Great lighting, and detail is nice and sharp.  I like this shot a lot!  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'I must say, you have taken a most dreaded weed and made it look incredibly beautiful.  If it looked that nice in my yard, I might just leave it there.  Extemely interesting angle of a less than popular subject.  Great lighting, and detail is nice and sharp.  I like this shot a lot!  <10>', '2005-07-05 05:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507249, 198150, 30018, '<td valign="top">An extreme angle for macro, with it''s very shallow DOF.  This image is actually very dream-like to me, with soft colors and soft edges.  Very different.  But I like it a lot.  Very well done.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'An extreme angle for macro, with it''s very shallow DOF.  This image is actually very dream-like to me, with soft colors and soft edges.  Very different.  But I like it a lot.  Very well done.  <8>', '2005-07-05 05:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507250, 198506, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, but extremely dark, and grey, and very flat.  Lacking contrast and depth. Appears to be a light metering problem.  &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Interesting composition, but extremely dark, and grey, and very flat.  Lacking contrast and depth. Appears to be a light metering problem.  <5>', '2005-07-05 05:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507251, 196814, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice maco with wonderful details of one of my favorite subjects!  I never realized there were so many little fibers.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Nice maco with wonderful details of one of my favorite subjects!  I never realized there were so many little fibers.  <6>', '2005-07-05 05:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507252, 199657, 30018, '<td valign="top">A+  Nice image.  Original idea, and well done.  Good colors and tones.  Interesting composition.  Leaves me wondering what the ''A'' stands for.  Nicely done!  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'A+  Nice image.  Original idea, and well done.  Good colors and tones.  Interesting composition.  Leaves me wondering what the ''A'' stands for.  Nicely done!  <8>', '2005-07-05 05:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507253, 198116, 30018, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  Wonderful detail.  Nice composition; rainbow-like.  I like the highlights and shadows in this image as they break each color into hundreds of seperate colors.  Well done!  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  Wonderful detail.  Nice composition; rainbow-like.  I like the highlights and shadows in this image as they break each color into hundreds of seperate colors.  Well done!  <9>', '2005-07-05 05:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507255, 198857, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept for this picture.  I like the background in this image.  I wonder if having the background just slightly  blurrier, would have been good, because as it is now, it detracts slightly from the forground.  My eye seems to want to bounce around on this image.  Having the face just a little less noticable would have made this a better image, in my opinin.  But still a great shot!  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Interesting concept for this picture.  I like the background in this image.  I wonder if having the background just slightly  blurrier, would have been good, because as it is now, it detracts slightly from the forground.  My eye seems to want to bounce around on this image.  Having the face just a little less noticable would have made this a better image, in my opinin.  But still a great shot!  <9>', '2005-07-05 05:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507257, 199590, 24330, '<td valign="top">moldy minus 5</td>', 'moldy minus 5', '2005-07-05 05:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507259, 199466, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Even without the ''snout'' in focus, I still think this is good, however for me, probably with it in focus, it would be ''better''.</td>', '7 - Good.  Even without the ''snout'' in focus, I still think this is good, however for me, probably with it in focus, it would be ''better''.', '2005-07-05 06:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507261, 197911, 30018, '<td valign="top">Action in a macro.  Very uncommon, but very nice.  extremely sharp image, with great tones, and interesting shades of white.  The silver in the spoon jumps out at me as being amazingly sharp and full of color.  I would not be surprised to see this image wearing a blue ribbon when the voting is all finished.  Very nicely done.  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Action in a macro.  Very uncommon, but very nice.  extremely sharp image, with great tones, and interesting shades of white.  The silver in the spoon jumps out at me as being amazingly sharp and full of color.  I would not be surprised to see this image wearing a blue ribbon when the voting is all finished.  Very nicely done.  <10>', '2005-07-05 06:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507262, 196784, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail, and beautiful colors.  The pitting in the metal is most interesting.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very nice detail, and beautiful colors.  The pitting in the metal is most interesting.  <7>', '2005-07-05 06:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507263, 199519, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very different, and yummy idea.  Interesting colors throughout the image.  Nice tones, and contrast.  Very nicely done! &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Very different, and yummy idea.  Interesting colors throughout the image.  Nice tones, and contrast.  Very nicely done! <8>', '2005-07-05 06:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507265, 199352, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Nice aspect, more detail would be better for me.</td>', '6 - Nice aspect, more detail would be better for me.', '2005-07-05 06:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507266, 199333, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  For me, a slightly different angle, possibly giving some depth/context with the flames more discernible in the background - if possible, would make it a better photo.</td>', '7 - Good.  For me, a slightly different angle, possibly giving some depth/context with the flames more discernible in the background - if possible, would make it a better photo.', '2005-07-05 06:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507273, 197846, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Very good.  Great capture and angle/''pose''.  Almost perfect to me; the tips of antennae, those three legs in the foreground, if they were all fine focused and perhaps the mouth, more detail and even shine on the eyes, just might get there ''for me''.  That ''helmet'' close up would be superb.  Really good shot.</td>', '9 - Very good.  Great capture and angle/''pose''.  Almost perfect to me; the tips of antennae, those three legs in the foreground, if they were all fine focused and perhaps the mouth, more detail and even shine on the eyes, just might get there ''for me''.  That ''helmet'' close up would be superb.  Really good shot.', '2005-07-05 06:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507283, 197970, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Not just ''another dragonfly''.  I for one have never seen this angle before.  That transparency on what part of the wing is in focus is - exquisite.  Even the ''blurred transparency'' is ''unique''.  Same with the ''flutter'' of it on the other side.  For me, ''if only'' the eyes and those ''fore'' legs were in ''fine focus'', and a touch more on the body, this would be very near perfect for me.  I do not know what that is ''up there'' in the left background but it detracts, especially from the beauty of those wings.  The color in them, well they look just like stained glass windows or vice versa.  Great capture.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Not just ''another dragonfly''.  I for one have never seen this angle before.  That transparency on what part of the wing is in focus is - exquisite.  Even the ''blurred transparency'' is ''unique''.  Same with the ''flutter'' of it on the other side.  For me, ''if only'' the eyes and those ''fore'' legs were in ''fine focus'', and a touch more on the body, this would be very near perfect for me.  I do not know what that is ''up there'' in the left background but it detracts, especially from the beauty of those wings.  The color in them, well they look just like stained glass windows or vice versa.  Great capture.', '2005-07-05 06:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507286, 199451, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Nice texture on the rose.  Tighter cropping / framing would have made this a better picture for me.  Good colors.</td>', '7 - Nice texture on the rose.  Tighter cropping / framing would have made this a better picture for me.  Good colors.', '2005-07-05 06:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507290, 199247, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Nice lighting.  For me, even just the top bug would have been a better picture, maybe even just for the perspective it would have given.   Nice color, background and ''stem hair''.</td>', '7 - Good.  Nice lighting.  For me, even just the top bug would have been a better picture, maybe even just for the perspective it would have given.   Nice color, background and ''stem hair''.', '2005-07-05 06:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507293, 199164, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - Would have liked to see this flower with it''s detail, especially given those colors if they are natural.  For me, too much ''blur''.</td>', '5 - Would have liked to see this flower with it''s detail, especially given those colors if they are natural.  For me, too much ''blur''.', '2005-07-05 06:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507294, 197030, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good concept.  More detail, closer cropping, lighter color, perhaps some context, would have made this a better picture for me.</td>', '6 - Good concept.  More detail, closer cropping, lighter color, perhaps some context, would have made this a better picture for me.', '2005-07-05 06:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507296, 198503, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Nice lash ''capture''.  For me, closer cropping/framing to really get just the lashes and iris in, would have made this better.</td>', '7 - Good.  Nice lash ''capture''.  For me, closer cropping/framing to really get just the lashes and iris in, would have made this better.', '2005-07-05 06:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507299, 199349, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Simplicity.  Good capture and ''character''.  For me, closer would have been better, else a tighter crop.  Nice color.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Simplicity.  Good capture and ''character''.  For me, closer would have been better, else a tighter crop.  Nice color.', '2005-07-05 06:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507300, 199039, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  Even though this is not as focused as I prefer, the shape of the snail is near perfect.  Maybe a touch more ''contrast'' in the colors would also be good, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good.  Even though this is not as focused as I prefer, the shape of the snail is near perfect.  Maybe a touch more ''contrast'' in the colors would also be good, in my opinion.', '2005-07-05 06:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507303, 199430, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  Glad this was one of my outtakes.  I hand an image almost exactly like this, and desided against it, cus I thought my other idea was better.  Not sure if it is, but at least there were not duplicate images.    This is very nicely done.  Great detail in the threads, the seam, and even the shadows inside the holes.  The vibrant red jumps off the page with the white and black backgrounds (My background was green).  Good luck.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Nice job.  Glad this was one of my outtakes.  I hand an image almost exactly like this, and desided against it, cus I thought my other idea was better.  Not sure if it is, but at least there were not duplicate images.    This is very nicely done.  Great detail in the threads, the seam, and even the shadows inside the holes.  The vibrant red jumps off the page with the white and black backgrounds (My background was green).  Good luck.  <8>', '2005-07-05 07:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507304, 198382, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - I like the concept and the angle, but for me, more focus/centering would make this a better picture.  Nice colors.</td>', '7 - I like the concept and the angle, but for me, more focus/centering would make this a better picture.  Nice colors.', '2005-07-05 07:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507305, 199398, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  &lt;7&gt;</td>', 'Very cool.  <7>', '2005-07-05 07:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507306, 199656, 30018, '<td valign="top">The ultimate sacrifice for an image!!!!  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'The ultimate sacrifice for an image!!!!  <8>', '2005-07-05 07:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507307, 199539, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  These colors are very nice.  I really like the left background, as well as the bit of anthers/stamen on the right, more of both would be good, but then the bugs would get a little lost.  For me, more detail on the bugs would have been good, but ''see above''.  Nice capture, and good texture on the petal too.</td>', '8 - Very good.  These colors are very nice.  I really like the left background, as well as the bit of anthers/stamen on the right, more of both would be good, but then the bugs would get a little lost.  For me, more detail on the bugs would have been good, but ''see above''.  Nice capture, and good texture on the petal too.', '2005-07-05 07:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507308, 199048, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture.  Lovely warm colors.  Another great example of taking something very ordinary, and photographing it from a slightly differnet angle to make it extraordinary.  This is a very nice shot.  Well done.  Good Luck.  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Very pretty picture.  Lovely warm colors.  Another great example of taking something very ordinary, and photographing it from a slightly differnet angle to make it extraordinary.  This is a very nice shot.  Well done.  Good Luck.  <10>', '2005-07-05 07:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507309, 199500, 32767, '<td valign="top">I have a deep, up close and personal relationship with mayonnaise,  myself.<br/>Nice image and perfect dof for a food shot. Color looks a little off.</td>', 'I have a deep, up close and personal relationship with mayonnaise,  myself.Nice image and perfect dof for a food shot. Color looks a little off.', '2005-07-05 07:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507312, 199039, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice image and an interesting crop.</td>', 'Nice image and an interesting crop.', '2005-07-05 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507314, 199345, 30018, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Ordinary item made extraordinary with this interesting angle.  The lost detail in the wood around the spring is sad.  I would have loved to see this in color which would have allowed those details to be more easily seen.  I love B&amp;W, but sometimes, color is important, and this might be one of those times. Still a great image.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'Great shot.  Ordinary item made extraordinary with this interesting angle.  The lost detail in the wood around the spring is sad.  I would have loved to see this in color which would have allowed those details to be more easily seen.  I love B&W, but sometimes, color is important, and this might be one of those times. Still a great image.  <8>', '2005-07-05 07:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507315, 199164, 32767, '<td valign="top">Very cool. The dof does wonders with those lines and rich blues. Good luck. 8</td>', 'Very cool. The dof does wonders with those lines and rich blues. Good luck. 8', '2005-07-05 07:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507316, 196767, 30018, '<td valign="top">a Macro''s Macro!  Very nice.  how very interesting.  Beautiful colors that would have otherwise gone unseen.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'a Macro''s Macro!  Very nice.  how very interesting.  Beautiful colors that would have otherwise gone unseen.  <8>', '2005-07-05 07:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507318, 199582, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Very good.  For me, ''if only'' the dragonfly''s body was in finer focus, this would be getting close to perfect.  The wing detail is good, but again, for me, if possible, more focus on at least the foreground wing.  Nice capture.</td>', '7 - Very good.  For me, ''if only'' the dragonfly''s body was in finer focus, this would be getting close to perfect.  The wing detail is good, but again, for me, if possible, more focus on at least the foreground wing.  Nice capture.', '2005-07-05 07:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507320, 198786, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I really like borders, the funkier the better IMHO  but this might be a little excessive. Not sure if it adds to the shot. Nice colors and I like the tight crop.</td>', 'Nice image. I really like borders, the funkier the better IMHO  but this might be a little excessive. Not sure if it adds to the shot. Nice colors and I like the tight crop.', '2005-07-05 07:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507321, 199513, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice effort!  Honestly, in my opinion, I''m not sure this will make it.  So many great shots out there in this challenge.  This is a very clever idea, and presented very well.  I don''t like the border, however.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Very nice effort!  Honestly, in my opinion, I''m not sure this will make it.  So many great shots out there in this challenge.  This is a very clever idea, and presented very well.  I don''t like the border, however.  <6>', '2005-07-05 07:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507323, 199647, 32767, '<td valign="top">Nice image but it makes me want to see more of the carving. Perfect exposure.</td>', 'Nice image but it makes me want to see more of the carving. Perfect exposure.', '2005-07-05 07:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507326, 198806, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Yes.  Very good.  Looks like a stack of pumpkins.  Nice colors, but for me, perhaps a touch more - yellow?  Good concept.  Good detail.  Good macro.</td>', '8 - Yes.  Very good.  Looks like a stack of pumpkins.  Nice colors, but for me, perhaps a touch more - yellow?  Good concept.  Good detail.  Good macro.', '2005-07-05 07:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507327, 197649, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good.  Not sure how you did it, but good detail and color.  For me, perhaps a little less shine/tinge.  Texture is good.</td>', '8 - Very good.  Not sure how you did it, but good detail and color.  For me, perhaps a little less shine/tinge.  Texture is good.', '2005-07-05 07:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507329, 198288, 32767, '<td valign="top">My entry would not like your entry at all. Funny.</td>', 'My entry would not like your entry at all. Funny.', '2005-07-05 07:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507332, 198724, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Yes.  Very good photo, even the flies add something different.  The crab alone would be good too.  For me, more of a ''ground level'' angle would have added better perspective.  Good color.  Hmm, is it dead?</td>', '8 - Yes.  Very good photo, even the flies add something different.  The crab alone would be good too.  For me, more of a ''ground level'' angle would have added better perspective.  Good color.  Hmm, is it dead?', '2005-07-05 07:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507334, 199471, 16241, '<td valign="top">yes</td>', 'yes', '2005-07-05 07:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507336, 199412, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good.  For me, a ''quick clean'' and finer detail of the iris, perhaps even a tighter crop/framing, would have made this photo even better.  Perhaps even choosing the reflection, if possible.</td>', '7 - Good.  For me, a ''quick clean'' and finer detail of the iris, perhaps even a tighter crop/framing, would have made this photo even better.  Perhaps even choosing the reflection, if possible.', '2005-07-05 07:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507338, 198846, 16241, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2005-07-05 07:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507340, 199210, 16241, '<td valign="top">pretty</td>', 'pretty', '2005-07-05 07:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507342, 199594, 16241, '<td valign="top">you sure?</td>', 'you sure?', '2005-07-05 07:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507344, 198857, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Unusual.  Nice detail on the flower.  For me, perhaps a little more flower and a softer face in the distance.  Too - contrasted?  Nice concept though.</td>', '7 - Unusual.  Nice detail on the flower.  For me, perhaps a little more flower and a softer face in the distance.  Too - contrasted?  Nice concept though.', '2005-07-05 07:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507346, 198644, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Wow.  This is a great photo.  Very good perspective.  For me, would have been better with more focus on the right side as well.  The ''tongue'' finer focus too.  The background maybe lighter?, not sure.  I really like the colours and texture, like silk fur and fine sand.  Very good.</td>', '9 - Wow.  This is a great photo.  Very good perspective.  For me, would have been better with more focus on the right side as well.  The ''tongue'' finer focus too.  The background maybe lighter?, not sure.  I really like the colours and texture, like silk fur and fine sand.  Very good.', '2005-07-05 07:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507348, 199311, 39347, '<td valign="top">Not very clear. All I can see is 4 leaves? Maybe should have been more to this picture.</td>', 'Not very clear. All I can see is 4 leaves? Maybe should have been more to this picture.', '2005-07-05 07:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507349, 198048, 39347, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2005-07-05 07:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
