(1507402, 197917, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Good concept.  I would give it more but I know what a magnificent flower this is and a macro of the centre would have been great.  An amazing flower.  Wonderful perfume too.  I like the cactus stems in the background too, though for me, more color or contrast of them, ''using them'' as a background more (or even closer and the contrast of textures), would have made this better.</td>', '6 - Good concept.  I would give it more but I know what a magnificent flower this is and a macro of the centre would have been great.  An amazing flower.  Wonderful perfume too.  I like the cactus stems in the background too, though for me, more color or contrast of them, ''using them'' as a background more (or even closer and the contrast of textures), would have made this better.', '2005-07-05 08:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
