(1507965, 199142, 23614, '<td valign="top">Too bad you have some shadow on the petal, otherwise, its a pretty good flower shot.</td>', 'Too bad you have some shadow on the petal, otherwise, its a pretty good flower shot.', '2005-07-05 13:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507970, 199311, 37608, '<td valign="top">what is the subject here it would help to isolate somthing i see what you were trying but even that isnt in focus this would work if there was alot more color ir the backgroud turing it into a abstact color art</td>', 'what is the subject here it would help to isolate somthing i see what you were trying but even that isnt in focus this would work if there was alot more color ir the backgroud turing it into a abstact color art', '2005-07-05 14:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507971, 199126, 29904, '<td valign="top">Your center is just beautiful, fullly in focus, great color and depth.  THe two bottom central petals are over exposed tho. - too bright and no detail.  Nice cropping and dof.</td>', 'Your center is just beautiful, fullly in focus, great color and depth.  THe two bottom central petals are over exposed tho. - too bright and no detail.  Nice cropping and dof.', '2005-07-05 14:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507972, 199314, 37608, '<td valign="top">needs either more color or somthing to be in focus either one would help</td>', 'needs either more color or somthing to be in focus either one would help', '2005-07-05 14:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507973, 199456, 19982, '<td valign="top">The images that always suffer from a lack of comments are the ones that are right in the middle ground.  Everyone comments on the awesome shots.  Some comment on the bad shots. But the middle ones, very few people say anything.  So here I am to explain why I voted a 5:<br/> <br/>This image has pretty good sharpness and I''m leaning towards a 6.   You caught the bug at a good angle and all.  I would like to have seen a little more less clutter to the background (perhaps crop out some of the unimportant stuff) and perhaps a little more detail in the bug''s head.<br/> <br/>Hope the comments help.</td>', 'The images that always suffer from a lack of comments are the ones that are right in the middle ground.  Everyone comments on the awesome shots.  Some comment on the bad shots. But the middle ones, very few people say anything.  So here I am to explain why I voted a 5: This image has pretty good sharpness and I''m leaning towards a 6.   You caught the bug at a good angle and all.  I would like to have seen a little more less clutter to the background (perhaps crop out some of the unimportant stuff) and perhaps a little more detail in the bug''s head. Hope the comments help.', '2005-07-05 14:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507974, 199218, 10867, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful.  The focus (on the face of the creature) and the composaition are just perfect!  I''m giving it an 8.</td>', 'Just beautiful.  The focus (on the face of the creature) and the composaition are just perfect!  I''m giving it an 8.', '2005-07-05 14:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1507976, 198803, 37608, '<td valign="top">love what youve done cant wait to see if you set it up or just a greaat moment of serendipity great photo 10</td>', 'love what youve done cant wait to see if you set it up or just a greaat moment of serendipity great photo 10', '2005-07-05 14:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
