(1508201, 199408, 24951, '<td valign="top">I''ve taken many similar photos so gauge my vote on how it fares compared to my own. The focus is a bit soft but fortunately it gives the photo a sense of serenity and it goes well with the colour tone. I''m giving it a 9 especially if taken with a something other than a dSLR - if taken with a dSLR it really deserves a tad less IMO, but still giving it a 9.</td>', 'I''ve taken many similar photos so gauge my vote on how it fares compared to my own. The focus is a bit soft but fortunately it gives the photo a sense of serenity and it goes well with the colour tone. I''m giving it a 9 especially if taken with a something other than a dSLR - if taken with a dSLR it really deserves a tad less IMO, but still giving it a 9.', '2005-07-05 15:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
