(1508217, 198236, 33560, '<td valign="top">Talk about Bug-Eyed!   It''s technically as good as I can imagine it might be. It''s crisp, sharp and even the placement/framing of the flying insect is good.  Somehow it strikes me as empty and uncompelling... not sure why.</td>', 'Talk about Bug-Eyed!   It''s technically as good as I can imagine it might be. It''s crisp, sharp and even the placement/framing of the flying insect is good.  Somehow it strikes me as empty and uncompelling... not sure why.', '2005-07-05 15:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
