(1508227, 199126, 20809, '<td valign="top">Looks like a good stock photo... could use a bit of cloning for distracting pollen and specs - 6</td>', 'Looks like a good stock photo... could use a bit of cloning for distracting pollen and specs - 6', '2005-07-05 16:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508231, 199500, 33560, '<td valign="top">IMO, it''s tough to get creamy, chunky white fluids to look attractive - they too frequently evoke nausea.    In the future when shooting under these liighting conditions you may want to think about white point balance.  The color in this is very visibly balanced toward the yellow as it would be if it were shot under incandescent lighting.  I find the fact that the bowl is out of focus to bother me more than I might have expected.  Finally, I find salads will frequently look more lively if they have some strong greens such as spinach, and some dark colors such as black olives. .. For what it''s worth.</td>', 'IMO, it''s tough to get creamy, chunky white fluids to look attractive - they too frequently evoke nausea.    In the future when shooting under these liighting conditions you may want to think about white point balance.  The color in this is very visibly balanced toward the yellow as it would be if it were shot under incandescent lighting.  I find the fact that the bowl is out of focus to bother me more than I might have expected.  Finally, I find salads will frequently look more lively if they have some strong greens such as spinach, and some dark colors such as black olives. .. For what it''s worth.', '2005-07-05 16:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508235, 199401, 33560, '<td valign="top">Super!</td>', 'Super!', '2005-07-05 16:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
