(1508319, 197960, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2005-07-05 16:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508326, 197427, 33560, '<td valign="top">The ''guard petal'' on Bishop Darlington and roses of that ilk have always bothered me for the difficulties they present photographically;  this is a nice treatment.  The back-lighting works especially well.  Mostly, I like the soft look of the photo, but I wonder whether a little sharpening would have improved the look of the stamens.</td>', 'The ''guard petal'' on Bishop Darlington and roses of that ilk have always bothered me for the difficulties they present photographically;  this is a nice treatment.  The back-lighting works especially well.  Mostly, I like the soft look of the photo, but I wonder whether a little sharpening would have improved the look of the stamens.', '2005-07-05 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508330, 198756, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very clear, great focus and nice contrasting colors.  My only disappointment is the light.  Looks like it''s the on-camera flash and it isn''t too flattering to the pic.  Otherwise nice effort.</td>', 'Very clear, great focus and nice contrasting colors.  My only disappointment is the light.  Looks like it''s the on-camera flash and it isn''t too flattering to the pic.  Otherwise nice effort.', '2005-07-05 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508336, 199472, 29904, '<td valign="top">I have seen these caterpillars before, in my area.  Do you know what they are?<br/>As for the pic, I wish I could see him better, closer, if possible.  Also the background, being darker and blured would bring out the details in his light and dark fur.</td>', 'I have seen these caterpillars before, in my area.  Do you know what they are?As for the pic, I wish I could see him better, closer, if possible.  Also the background, being darker and blured would bring out the details in his light and dark fur.', '2005-07-05 16:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508337, 197960, 26756, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture.  Love how the light catches the edges of the leaves and especially the dof you chose.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice picture.  Love how the light catches the edges of the leaves and especially the dof you chose.  Good luck!', '2005-07-05 16:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
