(1508350, 199546, 23478, '<td valign="top">This is great composition... the only drawback is that the image seems slightly OOF.</td>', 'This is great composition... the only drawback is that the image seems slightly OOF.', '2005-07-05 16:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508351, 198421, 33560, '<td valign="top">The paint on the brushes is very interesting and attractive. The parallelism of shape between the brushes and bars is interesting.  And the lighting is beautiful.  <br/> <br/>There are a few quibbles one might have.  The paint colors do not seem to match tha colors of the bars - for whatever reason. In fact, the bars don''t seem to match - there apears to be a slightly greenish azure blue and a less saturated but more primal blue.  Somehow, the way the brushes are  so tightly aligned seems gratuitously static, especially because the materials in the brushes are the only sources of life in the photo - and the globs of paint obscure them.  It is so artistically done that I am sure the photographer has a thousand times or perhaps a million times the training in the graphical arts as the commentator; still I feel strongly about these niggling little details...</td>', 'The paint on the brushes is very interesting and attractive. The parallelism of shape between the brushes and bars is interesting.  And the lighting is beautiful.   There are a few quibbles one might have.  The paint colors do not seem to match tha colors of the bars - for whatever reason. In fact, the bars don''t seem to match - there apears to be a slightly greenish azure blue and a less saturated but more primal blue.  Somehow, the way the brushes are  so tightly aligned seems gratuitously static, especially because the materials in the brushes are the only sources of life in the photo - and the globs of paint obscure them.  It is so artistically done that I am sure the photographer has a thousand times or perhaps a million times the training in the graphical arts as the commentator; still I feel strongly about these niggling little details...', '2005-07-05 16:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508352, 199292, 23478, '<td valign="top">Yellow on yellow, very nice</td>', 'Yellow on yellow, very nice', '2005-07-05 16:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508355, 199582, 26756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, nice lookign subject and those buds are a great compliment to the pic.  Smaller aperture really would have helped a bit though, as I think the focal point being mostly on the tops of the wings is in the wrong spot.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, nice lookign subject and those buds are a great compliment to the pic.  Smaller aperture really would have helped a bit though, as I think the focal point being mostly on the tops of the wings is in the wrong spot.', '2005-07-05 16:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508357, 199456, 23478, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of colors.</td>', 'Nice combination of colors.', '2005-07-05 16:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508360, 199329, 23478, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, I like the composition.</td>', 'Interesting image, I like the composition.', '2005-07-05 16:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508365, 198525, 26756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Nice, original idea.  Nice colors in the water and love the rust.  Maybe even a closer shot if possible would have been more effective.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Nice, original idea.  Nice colors in the water and love the rust.  Maybe even a closer shot if possible would have been more effective.', '2005-07-05 16:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508371, 197938, 26756, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary color and I love the subject you chose.  Good composition.  Would have loved to have seen this whole thing in crisp focus.</td>', 'Extraordinary color and I love the subject you chose.  Good composition.  Would have loved to have seen this whole thing in crisp focus.', '2005-07-05 16:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508372, 197963, 33560, '<td valign="top">The focus is astonishingly sharp.  Both clover and bee are superbly lit and rendered.  One wonders whether the composition might be strengthened by cropping a bit of the right side off the image.  <br/> <br/>And if you will allow a bit of an absurdist comment: the bee or the clover is the wrong color.  This commentator just doesn''t like black and gold with this bright cerise, chartreuse green (BG) , red, and white.</td>', 'The focus is astonishingly sharp.  Both clover and bee are superbly lit and rendered.  One wonders whether the composition might be strengthened by cropping a bit of the right side off the image.   And if you will allow a bit of an absurdist comment: the bee or the clover is the wrong color.  This commentator just doesn''t like black and gold with this bright cerise, chartreuse green (BG) , red, and white.', '2005-07-05 16:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508373, 199531, 33560, '<td valign="top">Nicely observed. Well Lit.  The white point correction seems a little yellow.  Don''t know why, but that seems to matter.</td>', 'Nicely observed. Well Lit.  The white point correction seems a little yellow.  Don''t know why, but that seems to matter.', '2005-07-05 17:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508375, 199285, 31742, '<td valign="top">10 ... i feel like i can reach out and pet  him / her... s0o0o cute !</td>', '10 ... i feel like i can reach out and pet  him / her... s0o0o cute !', '2005-07-05 17:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508376, 199586, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very nicely created - little lenses of water in a nylon net. Not convinced I want to see the world full of photos like this - but it''s the first time I''ve seen the technique so it''s worth an extra point or so for novelty.</td>', 'Very nicely created - little lenses of water in a nylon net. Not convinced I want to see the world full of photos like this - but it''s the first time I''ve seen the technique so it''s worth an extra point or so for novelty.', '2005-07-05 17:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508377, 199052, 40222, '<td valign="top">Excellent depth of field.  Saturations perfect.  I really like this one.</td>', 'Excellent depth of field.  Saturations perfect.  I really like this one.', '2005-07-05 17:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508378, 198762, 31742, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2005-07-05 17:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508380, 198633, 40222, '<td valign="top">I wish that I could see the back of the spoon just a little more.</td>', 'I wish that I could see the back of the spoon just a little more.', '2005-07-05 17:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508381, 199149, 40222, '<td valign="top">The colors in the background, though blurred, are too distracting.</td>', 'The colors in the background, though blurred, are too distracting.', '2005-07-05 17:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508382, 199521, 19311, '<td valign="top">The background has a slight yellow hue to it.  Perhaps a little bump in brightness  would do the trick</td>', 'The background has a slight yellow hue to it.  Perhaps a little bump in brightness  would do the trick', '2005-07-05 17:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508383, 197848, 33560, '<td valign="top">Lighting is just a little harsh - almost as if done with a flash.  Not clear that this is a macro shot .</td>', 'Lighting is just a little harsh - almost as if done with a flash.  Not clear that this is a macro shot .', '2005-07-05 17:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508387, 199399, 31742, '<td valign="top">Wow 10  good luck !</td>', 'Wow 10  good luck !', '2005-07-05 17:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508388, 199197, 31742, '<td valign="top">10 Amazing</td>', '10 Amazing', '2005-07-05 17:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508389, 198765, 40222, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous contrast, depth of field, and composition.  I really like this picture!!!</td>', 'Gorgeous contrast, depth of field, and composition.  I really like this picture!!!', '2005-07-05 17:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508391, 198358, 31742, '<td valign="top">WOW 10</td>', 'WOW 10', '2005-07-05 17:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508392, 199344, 33560, '<td valign="top">The long lens shot wide open certainly creates the macro effect.  Macro or not, it''s a well composed, lit, focused, and shot photo.</td>', 'The long lens shot wide open certainly creates the macro effect.  Macro or not, it''s a well composed, lit, focused, and shot photo.', '2005-07-05 17:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508393, 199412, 40222, '<td valign="top">The reflections are too distracting from the subject.</td>', 'The reflections are too distracting from the subject.', '2005-07-05 17:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508394, 199333, 19311, '<td valign="top">Cool shot but the focus is a little far forward</td>', 'Cool shot but the focus is a little far forward', '2005-07-05 17:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508395, 199541, 31742, '<td valign="top">Love the colors 10</td>', 'Love the colors 10', '2005-07-05 17:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508397, 198488, 19311, '<td valign="top">NIce setup but the darkness around the sides is a little distracting</td>', 'NIce setup but the darkness around the sides is a little distracting', '2005-07-05 17:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508403, 199320, 19311, '<td valign="top">Eeewwww thats close.  Cool shot.</td>', 'Eeewwww thats close.  Cool shot.', '2005-07-05 17:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508406, 199545, 33560, '<td valign="top">How did you get her to tilt here head so coyly?  I love the colors and the frizzy lines.  Nice</td>', 'How did you get her to tilt here head so coyly?  I love the colors and the frizzy lines.  Nice', '2005-07-05 17:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508407, 199527, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and the colors look good on this one.  Might be interesting to have an off white background behind the arm.  Detail looks pretty clear, and I like the composition going diagonally across the screen.</td>', 'Interesting subject and the colors look good on this one.  Might be interesting to have an off white background behind the arm.  Detail looks pretty clear, and I like the composition going diagonally across the screen.', '2005-07-05 17:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508408, 196659, 19311, '<td valign="top">Very pretty</td>', 'Very pretty', '2005-07-05 17:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508410, 198506, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good composition!  And you''ve definitely chosen small objects and gotten close up with them.  I think I would like this a little better if the background were a brighter color (perhaps blue or red?).  I think it might help the metallic hues show up a bit better.  Lighting looks pretty good, in that there are no giant glares, but it looks a little bit dark to me.  Really like the detail on this..nice and clear.</td>', 'Good composition!  And you''ve definitely chosen small objects and gotten close up with them.  I think I would like this a little better if the background were a brighter color (perhaps blue or red?).  I think it might help the metallic hues show up a bit better.  Lighting looks pretty good, in that there are no giant glares, but it looks a little bit dark to me.  Really like the detail on this..nice and clear.', '2005-07-05 17:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508412, 199398, 35513, '<td valign="top">I would suggest making the photo as large as DPC will allow, that way the voters can see all the detail in your shot!  Especially this one, which has some really nice stuff to it.  I like the composition a lot.  You really get the sense of dripping.  Good lighting, colors, and clarity on this shot.</td>', 'I would suggest making the photo as large as DPC will allow, that way the voters can see all the detail in your shot!  Especially this one, which has some really nice stuff to it.  I like the composition a lot.  You really get the sense of dripping.  Good lighting, colors, and clarity on this shot.', '2005-07-05 17:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508413, 197052, 33560, '<td valign="top">The lighting, color, and texture are exquisite.</td>', 'The lighting, color, and texture are exquisite.', '2005-07-05 17:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508414, 199582, 19311, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a little soft.</td>', 'Focus seems a little soft.', '2005-07-05 17:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508415, 197895, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good clarity and detail on this shot.  I think I would like to see it in color though.  I feel that some of the lines of the flower get lost in the B&amp;W.  I like the composition, that looks good!</td>', 'Good clarity and detail on this shot.  I think I would like to see it in color though.  I feel that some of the lines of the flower get lost in the B&W.  I like the composition, that looks good!', '2005-07-05 17:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508417, 199048, 40222, '<td valign="top">I love this.  It''s rich in color and at a very interesting angle.  It took me a couple seconds to realize the swirls were cinnamon sticks.</td>', 'I love this.  It''s rich in color and at a very interesting angle.  It took me a couple seconds to realize the swirls were cinnamon sticks.', '2005-07-05 17:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508418, 199294, 35513, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject!  Good choice of background color and the lighting looks good.</td>', 'Interesting subject!  Good choice of background color and the lighting looks good.', '2005-07-05 17:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508419, 199106, 19311, '<td valign="top">Very interesting,  I can''t decide whether the negative space helps or not(which means it probably dosen''t).  The beans and lighting are very nice.</td>', 'Very interesting,  I can''t decide whether the negative space helps or not(which means it probably dosen''t).  The beans and lighting are very nice.', '2005-07-05 17:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508421, 197784, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good colors on this photo!  Looks really neat.  It''s a bit hard to really see some of the detail of the pepper though.  I like the composition overall.</td>', 'Good colors on this photo!  Looks really neat.  It''s a bit hard to really see some of the detail of the pepper though.  I like the composition overall.', '2005-07-05 17:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508422, 199399, 19311, '<td valign="top">Seems a little too red for me.</td>', 'Seems a little too red for me.', '2005-07-05 17:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508423, 199349, 19311, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF</td>', 'Very nice DOF', '2005-07-05 17:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508424, 199380, 35513, '<td valign="top">Nice colors!  Composition is pretty good....the lower part of a bottom leaf is cut off a tad, but I wouldn''t worry about that too much :-)  Detail looks good and exposure looks good as well.</td>', 'Nice colors!  Composition is pretty good....the lower part of a bottom leaf is cut off a tad, but I wouldn''t worry about that too much :-)  Detail looks good and exposure looks good as well.', '2005-07-05 17:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508425, 198150, 19311, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  Looks like a serious macro with a reversed 50mm</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  Looks like a serious macro with a reversed 50mm', '2005-07-05 17:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508426, 199668, 35513, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors on this shot!  And definitely a good macro subject.  It seems as if the lighting is perhaps a bit harsh, or as if there''s some kind of reflection...but around the edges it seems a little blown out.  I like the composition, with the line of the feather going diagonally across the screen.</td>', 'Very nice colors on this shot!  And definitely a good macro subject.  It seems as if the lighting is perhaps a bit harsh, or as if there''s some kind of reflection...but around the edges it seems a little blown out.  I like the composition, with the line of the feather going diagonally across the screen.', '2005-07-05 17:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508428, 199447, 31742, '<td valign="top">OMG thats what i call a macro Congrats on your  Ribbon !!!.....10</td>', 'OMG thats what i call a macro Congrats on your  Ribbon !!!.....10', '2005-07-05 17:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508430, 197648, 35513, '<td valign="top">Good capture of a drop of water!  Hard to do (at least for me!).  Clarity and lighting look good on this photo, but I think that a different colored background might make the water stand out a bit more.  Good composition as well.</td>', 'Good capture of a drop of water!  Hard to do (at least for me!).  Clarity and lighting look good on this photo, but I think that a different colored background might make the water stand out a bit more.  Good composition as well.', '2005-07-05 17:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508431, 198423, 19311, '<td valign="top">Very nice the foucs is near spot on and much more than your typical flower picture.  Colors are awesome too. 8</td>', 'Very nice the foucs is near spot on and much more than your typical flower picture.  Colors are awesome too. 8', '2005-07-05 17:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508434, 196888, 31742, '<td valign="top">yuck ....well done     8</td>', 'yuck ....well done     8', '2005-07-05 17:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508435, 199114, 19311, '<td valign="top">A little too much out of focuse here.  My eyes wander around the picture trying to find a spot to rest</td>', 'A little too much out of focuse here.  My eyes wander around the picture trying to find a spot to rest', '2005-07-05 17:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508436, 198762, 19311, '<td valign="top">Looks a little to set up</td>', 'Looks a little to set up', '2005-07-05 17:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508437, 197756, 35513, '<td valign="top">I like the background of this shot a lot...is it metal?  Looks really cool, especially with the rain drops.  It looks as though the camera might have focused a little more on the background rather than the fly, and we''ve lost a smidge of detail on the insect.  Composition is pretty good, and I love the texture the water adds.</td>', 'I like the background of this shot a lot...is it metal?  Looks really cool, especially with the rain drops.  It looks as though the camera might have focused a little more on the background rather than the fly, and we''ve lost a smidge of detail on the insect.  Composition is pretty good, and I love the texture the water adds.', '2005-07-05 17:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508438, 199289, 31742, '<td valign="top">wow very nice ....9</td>', 'wow very nice ....9', '2005-07-05 17:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508441, 199447, 19311, '<td valign="top">I knew it was a matter of time before I ran across one of these.  This is just so cool and the focus is perfect.</td>', 'I knew it was a matter of time before I ran across one of these.  This is just so cool and the focus is perfect.', '2005-07-05 17:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508442, 196941, 31742, '<td valign="top">Omg what is it !!!  Amazing macro .....10</td>', 'Omg what is it !!!  Amazing macro .....10', '2005-07-05 17:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508444, 199607, 19311, '<td valign="top">Could use a little bump in sharpness.  Man those are some big eyes.</td>', 'Could use a little bump in sharpness.  Man those are some big eyes.', '2005-07-05 17:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508447, 198655, 19311, '<td valign="top">WOW!!  my first 10, this is awesome.  Composition colors and focus are all perfect.  Congrats on the cool shot.</td>', 'WOW!!  my first 10, this is awesome.  Composition colors and focus are all perfect.  Congrats on the cool shot.', '2005-07-05 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508448, 198181, 31742, '<td valign="top">Very nice .....8</td>', 'Very nice .....8', '2005-07-05 17:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508449, 198103, 19311, '<td valign="top">Don''t think this qualifies as macro.</td>', 'Don''t think this qualifies as macro.', '2005-07-05 17:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508450, 199647, 31742, '<td valign="top">Very nice different ...9</td>', 'Very nice different ...9', '2005-07-05 17:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508451, 198332, 19311, '<td valign="top">A tad dark on my screen.  The green background works well.</td>', 'A tad dark on my screen.  The green background works well.', '2005-07-05 17:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508454, 198756, 31742, '<td valign="top">Very nice ...10 Love the border</td>', 'Very nice ...10 Love the border', '2005-07-05 17:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508456, 199597, 22537, '<td valign="top">This has to be one of the most pleasing flower shots I''ve seen. Colors, focus and so on are exceptional.  Good luck!</td>', 'This has to be one of the most pleasing flower shots I''ve seen. Colors, focus and so on are exceptional.  Good luck!', '2005-07-05 17:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508457, 197764, 31742, '<td valign="top">Ewww what is it !!! .......8</td>', 'Ewww what is it !!! .......8', '2005-07-05 17:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508459, 199074, 19311, '<td valign="top">Very unique. Contrast and sharpness are great.   Could stand to burn in the top right(left of the bulls nose).  9</td>', 'Very unique. Contrast and sharpness are great.   Could stand to burn in the top right(left of the bulls nose).  9', '2005-07-05 17:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508461, 199279, 22537, '<td valign="top">It does not get much better than this.  Excellent work!  Good luck.</td>', 'It does not get much better than this.  Excellent work!  Good luck.', '2005-07-05 17:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508462, 199131, 19311, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a little soft</td>', 'Focus seems a little soft', '2005-07-05 17:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508463, 198480, 22537, '<td valign="top">Greta capture of this Damsel.  The focus is great and the subject fits well into the composition.</td>', 'Greta capture of this Damsel.  The focus is great and the subject fits well into the composition.', '2005-07-05 17:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508464, 198700, 31742, '<td valign="top">very nice ...8</td>', 'very nice ...8', '2005-07-05 17:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508466, 199314, 19311, '<td valign="top">This dosen''t work to well for me but a bonus point for trying something different..  The branch has little interest and gets lost in the out of focus background.</td>', 'This dosen''t work to well for me but a bonus point for trying something different..  The branch has little interest and gets lost in the out of focus background.', '2005-07-05 17:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508467, 197886, 19311, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, the shallow dof works well.</td>', 'Pretty cool, the shallow dof works well.', '2005-07-05 17:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508469, 199430, 31742, '<td valign="top">WOw very nice ...10</td>', 'WOw very nice ...10', '2005-07-05 17:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508470, 198026, 22537, '<td valign="top">Great perspective on a widely used subject.  I think the focus and composition are terrific.  Had you left a bit more room around the wings a ribbon would have been for the taking.  Good luck!</td>', 'Great perspective on a widely used subject.  I think the focus and composition are terrific.  Had you left a bit more room around the wings a ribbon would have been for the taking.  Good luck!', '2005-07-05 17:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508474, 199417, 22537, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject matter, characters and composition.  Good luck!</td>', 'Excellent subject matter, characters and composition.  Good luck!', '2005-07-05 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508475, 199305, 19311, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a little out of focus in bottom right.</td>', 'Seems to be a little out of focus in bottom right.', '2005-07-05 17:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508476, 197846, 31742, '<td valign="top">wow very nice ...10</td>', 'wow very nice ...10', '2005-07-05 17:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508477, 199497, 25678, '<td valign="top">Absulutely wonderful.  I just wish the very top if its wing could have not been cropped</td>', 'Absulutely wonderful.  I just wish the very top if its wing could have not been cropped', '2005-07-05 17:34:09.000000', NULL, 1);
