(1508585, 199586, 36563, '<td valign="top">As soon as I saw the Macro challenge appear I knew there would be so many flowers and bugs, and with the absence of shock, it came true. Good though they may be, there''s no creativity. A flower is beautiful- so converting it to a photo really isn''t that thrilling. Your picture, however, is so creative and I love it! Amazing use of the mind and wonderful capture in Macro!</td>', 'As soon as I saw the Macro challenge appear I knew there would be so many flowers and bugs, and with the absence of shock, it came true. Good though they may be, there''s no creativity. A flower is beautiful- so converting it to a photo really isn''t that thrilling. Your picture, however, is so creative and I love it! Amazing use of the mind and wonderful capture in Macro!', '2005-07-05 17:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
