(1508867, 199026, 4793, '<td valign="top">Colorful</td>', 'Colorful', '2005-07-05 20:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1508881, 199410, 3669, '<td valign="top">Might I add that it is good to see some originality in a challenge full of hundreds of bug and flower photos, however a fly might have been appropriate for this picture.  While not necessarily a macro, this close up, I believe still meets the criteria for a close-up although the background which contains more pleasent subjects and colors is rather distracting.  Since I have dogs, I have seen more interesting poop.  This picture seems rather flat, lacking focus, depth and texture.  Maybe a better angle, lighting and composition (and perhaps a different diet for the dog) would provide better color and texture to a good poop.  As it stands, it is only a pile of sh**.  LOL  Good luck in the challenge.  :-)</td>', 'Might I add that it is good to see some originality in a challenge full of hundreds of bug and flower photos, however a fly might have been appropriate for this picture.  While not necessarily a macro, this close up, I believe still meets the criteria for a close-up although the background which contains more pleasent subjects and colors is rather distracting.  Since I have dogs, I have seen more interesting poop.  This picture seems rather flat, lacking focus, depth and texture.  Maybe a better angle, lighting and composition (and perhaps a different diet for the dog) would provide better color and texture to a good poop.  As it stands, it is only a pile of sh**.  LOL  Good luck in the challenge.  :-)', '2005-07-05 20:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
