(1508988, 199419, 26756, '<td valign="top">This was a nice idea, maybe not executed to it''s fullest potential.   The water drops and feathre go nicely together and the light is warm but a bit hot in places and maybe the shutter speed a bit too slow.  I think that threw off your focus a bit and added some noise.  I like that fact that you tried something other than the obvious choices though.</td>', 'This was a nice idea, maybe not executed to it''s fullest potential.   The water drops and feathre go nicely together and the light is warm but a bit hot in places and maybe the shutter speed a bit too slow.  I think that threw off your focus a bit and added some noise.  I like that fact that you tried something other than the obvious choices though.', '2005-07-05 21:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
