(1509914, 198656, 2170, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  seen a million of these, but this is very sharp.  i would like to see your setup when the challenge is over.</td>', 'nicely done.  seen a million of these, but this is very sharp.  i would like to see your setup when the challenge is over.', '2005-07-06 01:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1509921, 196987, 2170, '<td valign="top">i like the abstractness of this shot.</td>', 'i like the abstractness of this shot.', '2005-07-06 01:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1509930, 198284, 2170, '<td valign="top">great color and subject.  thank god it''s not a flower or a bug.</td>', 'great color and subject.  thank god it''s not a flower or a bug.', '2005-07-06 01:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510017, 199279, 39483, '<td valign="top">Amazing macro! I love the texture and the details. The contrast is great.<br/>It almost seems like it should be pulsating with life!<br/>Very well done!!!</td>', 'Amazing macro! I love the texture and the details. The contrast is great.It almost seems like it should be pulsating with life!Very well done!!!', '2005-07-06 01:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510037, 199472, 39483, '<td valign="top">I love the offbeat photo and the fact that the insect is barely hanging on. I really like the all white background. It seems so ''milky'' somehow and perfectly harmonizes with the ''soft'' white flower! Nice composition!!!</td>', 'I love the offbeat photo and the fact that the insect is barely hanging on. I really like the all white background. It seems so ''milky'' somehow and perfectly harmonizes with the ''soft'' white flower! Nice composition!!!', '2005-07-06 01:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510064, 197970, 39483, '<td valign="top">WOW! What a close up! It almost seems hard to believe that you can get that close! Nice sharpness and details on the legs and body. Great ''soft'' background although there is a tiny tiny amount of glare near the leaves(?)  that distracts just a tad...But truly amazing macro! very well done</td>', 'WOW! What a close up! It almost seems hard to believe that you can get that close! Nice sharpness and details on the legs and body. Great ''soft'' background although there is a tiny tiny amount of glare near the leaves(?)  that distracts just a tad...But truly amazing macro! very well done', '2005-07-06 01:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510077, 199103, 39483, '<td valign="top">I love how the entire bug and the finger are in focus! The fragility of the insect really comes through and it even seems to be looking at the ''viewer''! The light spot in the background does seem a bit distracting to me though... <br/>Great composition. Very well done!</td>', 'I love how the entire bug and the finger are in focus! The fragility of the insect really comes through and it even seems to be looking at the ''viewer''! The light spot in the background does seem a bit distracting to me though... Great composition. Very well done!', '2005-07-06 02:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510080, 198150, 39483, '<td valign="top">I  really like the soft feel of this photo. It nicely contrasts all the sharp images in this contest. The colors are also well blended and I like the composition and the ''cut off'' crop! Well done!!!</td>', 'I  really like the soft feel of this photo. It nicely contrasts all the sharp images in this contest. The colors are also well blended and I like the composition and the ''cut off'' crop! Well done!!!', '2005-07-06 02:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510105, 198866, 39483, '<td valign="top">I like the ''posture'' of the insect and the focus is very sharp throughout. The contrast with the white background works well with the set up. I like how the flower is all in focus although the water or reflection at the bottom of the flower is distracting to me. Gret composition, pose, and focus! Patience pays off...<br/>Very well done!</td>', 'I like the ''posture'' of the insect and the focus is very sharp throughout. The contrast with the white background works well with the set up. I like how the flower is all in focus although the water or reflection at the bottom of the flower is distracting to me. Gret composition, pose, and focus! Patience pays off...Very well done!', '2005-07-06 02:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510109, 199502, 39483, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity (and originality) of this photo and the cropping. The depth of field works well with the image,especially the way it highlights one of the eyes, as if he''s watching us... Very well done</td>', 'I like the simplicity (and originality) of this photo and the cropping. The depth of field works well with the image,especially the way it highlights one of the eyes, as if he''s watching us... Very well done', '2005-07-06 02:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510113, 199291, 39483, '<td valign="top">The details on the blueberry are amazing!!!  Great colors and nice depth of field. The background where they are resting on though is a bit distracting to me? too grainy or not enough of a contrast? not sure what it is about it. <br/>Very well done!!!</td>', 'The details on the blueberry are amazing!!!  Great colors and nice depth of field. The background where they are resting on though is a bit distracting to me? too grainy or not enough of a contrast? not sure what it is about it. Very well done!!!', '2005-07-06 02:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510115, 199579, 39483, '<td valign="top">The composition is beautiful, the background is nicely out of focus, and the dragonfly has a lot of details especially on the wings. But the details around the head are a bit overprocessed... Very well done!</td>', 'The composition is beautiful, the background is nicely out of focus, and the dragonfly has a lot of details especially on the wings. But the details around the head are a bit overprocessed... Very well done!', '2005-07-06 02:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510116, 199170, 39755, '<td valign="top">amazing capture!</td>', 'amazing capture!', '2005-07-06 02:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510124, 199069, 39483, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the face! What an expression. I also like the hair in the foreground, it really anchors the insect and you can imagine it moving about. Nice depth of field and the blue background complements well the green color although it does seem a tad artificial. very well done!</td>', 'Great shot of the face! What an expression. I also like the hair in the foreground, it really anchors the insect and you can imagine it moving about. Nice depth of field and the blue background complements well the green color although it does seem a tad artificial. very well done!', '2005-07-06 02:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510150, 197894, 40308, '<td valign="top">Sorry I got rid of your frog baby!</td>', 'Sorry I got rid of your frog baby!', '2005-07-06 02:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510162, 199523, 33439, '<td valign="top">i took a fish head out to see a movie, didn''t have to pay to get it in!   I love They Might be Giants!  Gross but funny title</td>', 'i took a fish head out to see a movie, didn''t have to pay to get it in!   I love They Might be Giants!  Gross but funny title', '2005-07-06 02:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510189, 199674, 33439, '<td valign="top">I would have to say this is my favorite in this challenge.  I love bug shots, it is amazing what we do not see with the naked eye.  Your Mr. is so hairy &amp; cute.  He has so much attude, I love it!  10</td>', 'I would have to say this is my favorite in this challenge.  I love bug shots, it is amazing what we do not see with the naked eye.  Your Mr. is so hairy & cute.  He has so much attude, I love it!  10', '2005-07-06 02:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510195, 199170, 33439, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture!  This is a great photo.  He looks like he has chrome round his eyes.</td>', 'Wonderful capture!  This is a great photo.  He looks like he has chrome round his eyes.', '2005-07-06 02:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510216, 198236, 33439, '<td valign="top">Just like the fly in Out Of the Dark this is also a great capture.  (I saw it first)  This is such a wonderful photo!</td>', 'Just like the fly in Out Of the Dark this is also a great capture.  (I saw it first)  This is such a wonderful photo!', '2005-07-06 02:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510330, 198421, 29269, '<td valign="top">Red looks orange on my screen, and I just checked the monitor before writing this comment. But that''s besides the point, as this is not the primary colours challenge. Like the brushes and esp. how the middle one is bent.</td>', 'Red looks orange on my screen, and I just checked the monitor before writing this comment. But that''s besides the point, as this is not the primary colours challenge. Like the brushes and esp. how the middle one is bent.', '2005-07-06 03:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
