(1510705, 197058, 37529, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Excellent focus and the swan is shown in a different perspective than usual.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Excellent focus and the swan is shown in a different perspective than usual.', '2005-07-06 06:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510707, 199140, 37529, '<td valign="top">Very patriotic strawberry.  Good photo.</td>', 'Very patriotic strawberry.  Good photo.', '2005-07-06 06:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1510708, 199399, 19746, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little "hot" for my liking.  There''re a lot of hotspots created by the direct lighting.  To fix this you might want to diffuse the light onto the coffee more.  <br/> <br/>The lighting aside, I like the rhythm and texture in this shot, I would have perhaps chosen a more extreme angle and got a slightly shallower DOF to put the focus on a particular coffee bean and imply said rhythm and texture as opposed to making it more of a focal point like you have here.  <br/> <br/>A nice idea, but some technical points let you down a little.  Hope my comment helps :)<br/> <br/>Alex (6)</td>', 'The lighting is a little "hot" for my liking.  There''re a lot of hotspots created by the direct lighting.  To fix this you might want to diffuse the light onto the coffee more.   The lighting aside, I like the rhythm and texture in this shot, I would have perhaps chosen a more extreme angle and got a slightly shallower DOF to put the focus on a particular coffee bean and imply said rhythm and texture as opposed to making it more of a focal point like you have here.   A nice idea, but some technical points let you down a little.  Hope my comment helps :) Alex (6)', '2005-07-06 06:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
