(1512263, 199608, 35804, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite flower/bug image ...beautiful lush reds and velvety blacks... I also love the grain, soft lovely lighting...there is something very intimate about this image..I think it''s the combination of all the elements working together...personally I  don''t care for the border...but that''s just my personal preference...still very well done.</td>', 'This is my favorite flower/bug image ...beautiful lush reds and velvety blacks... I also love the grain, soft lovely lighting...there is something very intimate about this image..I think it''s the combination of all the elements working together...personally I  don''t care for the border...but that''s just my personal preference...still very well done.', '2005-07-06 13:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
