(1512269, 199334, 23278, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Something is missing, can''t quite put my finger on it. Will try and comment more later.</td>', 'Great colors. Something is missing, can''t quite put my finger on it. Will try and comment more later.', '2005-07-06 13:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512270, 199447, 33947, '<td valign="top">Outstanding sharpness. Fabulous, really. But, to get full points, more care needs to given to composition, line, and artistry. This is just an in your face bug face. The white background on the right is distracting.</td>', 'Outstanding sharpness. Fabulous, really. But, to get full points, more care needs to given to composition, line, and artistry. This is just an in your face bug face. The white background on the right is distracting.', '2005-07-06 13:38:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512277, 199472, 23278, '<td valign="top">Pretty whites. A little soft on focus.</td>', 'Pretty whites. A little soft on focus.', '2005-07-06 13:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512285, 198801, 27158, '<td valign="top">this has potential, but there are several things I find distracting. the upside down lettering is disturbing as is the shallow dof. There seems to be a lack of continuity as it is not clear what the lower object is.</td>', 'this has potential, but there are several things I find distracting. the upside down lettering is disturbing as is the shallow dof. There seems to be a lack of continuity as it is not clear what the lower object is.', '2005-07-06 13:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512291, 198927, 33560, '<td valign="top">Sometimes being out of focus can help a photo, but the general practice is to have the subject be enhanced by having the background and other distracting elements be out of focus.  The part of the photo that seems to be in focus is the shadow cast by the flash.   And if this is the subject it is not well treated.  Allthough qua is not my own taste for either nail polish or sheets, I am willing to tolerate it happily in photos of others.   But I''m afraid the aqua cast of the pale adult foot is quite off-putting.<br/> <br/> The idea for the photo is a good one, but it''s hard to find any part of its execution worthy of favorable comment.</td>', 'Sometimes being out of focus can help a photo, but the general practice is to have the subject be enhanced by having the background and other distracting elements be out of focus.  The part of the photo that seems to be in focus is the shadow cast by the flash.   And if this is the subject it is not well treated.  Allthough qua is not my own taste for either nail polish or sheets, I am willing to tolerate it happily in photos of others.   But I''m afraid the aqua cast of the pale adult foot is quite off-putting.  The idea for the photo is a good one, but it''s hard to find any part of its execution worthy of favorable comment.', '2005-07-06 13:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512293, 197579, 35804, '<td valign="top">There is something very "twilightzone" about this...which is probably why I like it so much! I can imagine many comments have not been as favorable so far?...I could be completely wrong...anyway...I love this...makes me wax nostalgic...If I were to change anything, the only thing I might address would be the contrast...maybe a slight bump in the contrast might be nice..but not too much because the "nostalgic" feel of this image would dissappear.</td>', 'There is something very "twilightzone" about this...which is probably why I like it so much! I can imagine many comments have not been as favorable so far?...I could be completely wrong...anyway...I love this...makes me wax nostalgic...If I were to change anything, the only thing I might address would be the contrast...maybe a slight bump in the contrast might be nice..but not too much because the "nostalgic" feel of this image would dissappear.', '2005-07-06 13:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1512296, 199430, 33947, '<td valign="top">EXCELLENT macro! Nice line...I like that the seam runs on a diagonal. Sharp...love that you can see the red fibers. Fun.</td>', 'EXCELLENT macro! Nice line...I like that the seam runs on a diagonal. Sharp...love that you can see the red fibers. Fun.', '2005-07-06 13:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
