(1512309, 199502, 35804, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the fact that you have somehow manipulated the bill by folding or rolling it ...whatever...to create an really interesting depth of field of usually flat object...that eye really jumps...excellent clarity...great detail of the engraving..well done.</td>', 'I LOVE the fact that you have somehow manipulated the bill by folding or rolling it ...whatever...to create an really interesting depth of field of usually flat object...that eye really jumps...excellent clarity...great detail of the engraving..well done.', '2005-07-06 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
