(1513947, 198803, 39144, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. I love the water drop with the flower in it! Good color usage! I hope this takes first!</td>', 'Excellent photo. I love the water drop with the flower in it! Good color usage! I hope this takes first!', '2005-07-06 20:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513949, 199533, 39144, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Colors and contrast are excelelnt, as well as DOF. 10</td>', 'Nice capture! Colors and contrast are excelelnt, as well as DOF. 10', '2005-07-06 20:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513955, 198610, 39144, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I love how just the eye has the color, and the reflection is awesome! Great job!</td>', 'Nice photo. I love how just the eye has the color, and the reflection is awesome! Great job!', '2005-07-06 20:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513957, 199430, 39144, '<td valign="top">Great idea and excellent DOF. Bumping up to a 9.</td>', 'Great idea and excellent DOF. Bumping up to a 9.', '2005-07-06 20:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513958, 197052, 34759, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. I love the textures in the sand.</td>', 'Very nice shot. I love the textures in the sand.', '2005-07-06 20:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513961, 198557, 39144, '<td valign="top">great job on catching this bugger in mid-flight. bumping up to a 9</td>', 'great job on catching this bugger in mid-flight. bumping up to a 9', '2005-07-06 20:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513963, 199545, 34759, '<td valign="top">That''s really cute. The poor thing looks so sad!</td>', 'That''s really cute. The poor thing looks so sad!', '2005-07-06 20:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513964, 198655, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice texture in the feathers.</td>', 'Nice texture in the feathers.', '2005-07-06 20:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513965, 199523, 39144, '<td valign="top">I just don''t like anything about it. It just disgusts me. Sorry.</td>', 'I just don''t like anything about it. It just disgusts me. Sorry.', '2005-07-06 20:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513967, 198830, 34759, '<td valign="top">I don''t really think the extra white space flatters the photo at all.</td>', 'I don''t really think the extra white space flatters the photo at all.', '2005-07-06 20:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513968, 198220, 39144, '<td valign="top">Nothing too interesting about your photo. Also, there is not really much detail, either because of lighting or the camera was just a little out of focus. Can''t tell.</td>', 'Nothing too interesting about your photo. Also, there is not really much detail, either because of lighting or the camera was just a little out of focus. Can''t tell.', '2005-07-06 20:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513970, 198633, 34759, '<td valign="top">Nice. I love the color and sparkle in the honey.</td>', 'Nice. I love the color and sparkle in the honey.', '2005-07-06 20:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513972, 198448, 39144, '<td valign="top">Not really close up, and the negative look is really bad. No detail anywhere. Too many areas "blown out".</td>', 'Not really close up, and the negative look is really bad. No detail anywhere. Too many areas "blown out".', '2005-07-06 20:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513973, 198103, 39144, '<td valign="top">I just can''t see this in a macro competition, even if the title does include "close up". Aside from that fact, it is just not very interesting.</td>', 'I just can''t see this in a macro competition, even if the title does include "close up". Aside from that fact, it is just not very interesting.', '2005-07-06 20:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513978, 198614, 39144, '<td valign="top">The idea was probably good at first, and the positioning for the rule of thirds not bad, but the overall composition/color/detail of the photo is unimpressive.</td>', 'The idea was probably good at first, and the positioning for the rule of thirds not bad, but the overall composition/color/detail of the photo is unimpressive.', '2005-07-06 20:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513979, 198071, 34759, '<td valign="top">I think this would have looked a lot bette without the highlihgts on the glass. Different lighting probably would have improved that.</td>', 'I think this would have looked a lot bette without the highlihgts on the glass. Different lighting probably would have improved that.', '2005-07-06 20:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513981, 199314, 39144, '<td valign="top">The branch is out of focus. Silhouettes are nice in some photos, but not a macro.</td>', 'The branch is out of focus. Silhouettes are nice in some photos, but not a macro.', '2005-07-06 20:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513983, 198256, 39144, '<td valign="top">Nice job on getting up close, but there really isn''t anything interesting enough to keep my attention in the photo. I find it bland and without character.</td>', 'Nice job on getting up close, but there really isn''t anything interesting enough to keep my attention in the photo. I find it bland and without character.', '2005-07-06 20:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513984, 198288, 34759, '<td valign="top">Not the most artistic shot in the world, but I like the humor in it. Have anything to get rid of all the flowers? :)</td>', 'Not the most artistic shot in the world, but I like the humor in it. Have anything to get rid of all the flowers? :)', '2005-07-06 20:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513987, 198048, 34759, '<td valign="top">Cute title!</td>', 'Cute title!', '2005-07-06 20:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513989, 199399, 34759, '<td valign="top">Mmmm.... that looks like it smells so good. Now I''m craving coffee. Nice shot, though the lighting looks like it was a tad harsh.</td>', 'Mmmm.... that looks like it smells so good. Now I''m craving coffee. Nice shot, though the lighting looks like it was a tad harsh.', '2005-07-06 20:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513993, 197916, 34759, '<td valign="top">Spooky shot. Nice job.</td>', 'Spooky shot. Nice job.', '2005-07-06 20:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513996, 198700, 34759, '<td valign="top">Such a pretty cat! :)</td>', 'Such a pretty cat! :)', '2005-07-06 20:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1513999, 199631, 34759, '<td valign="top">I''m normally not too crazy about selective desaturation, but I really love this photo.</td>', 'I''m normally not too crazy about selective desaturation, but I really love this photo.', '2005-07-06 20:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514001, 197846, 34759, '<td valign="top">Eeek.. he looks so angry. You were very brave to get so close. I couldn''t do it!</td>', 'Eeek.. he looks so angry. You were very brave to get so close. I couldn''t do it!', '2005-07-06 20:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514004, 199291, 34759, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The wood (?) works very well with the blueberries.</td>', 'I really like this. The wood (?) works very well with the blueberries.', '2005-07-06 20:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514017, 198803, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great concept in this shot!  I like the composition and colors, and especially the refraction of the flower through the drop.</td>', 'Great concept in this shot!  I like the composition and colors, and especially the refraction of the flower through the drop.', '2005-07-06 20:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514027, 198756, 27767, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail in this shot. The flash is pretty bright. Maybe a little diffusion would soften it up a little.</td>', 'Excellent detail in this shot. The flash is pretty bright. Maybe a little diffusion would soften it up a little.', '2005-07-06 20:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514031, 198569, 27767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flowers, and lovely photo.  Columbines really are quite photogenic.  I like how the DOF makes the background nice and soft.</td>', 'Beautiful flowers, and lovely photo.  Columbines really are quite photogenic.  I like how the DOF makes the background nice and soft.', '2005-07-06 21:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514034, 198480, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great sharp focus. Composition feels a little funky, but I like it. Good DOF to soften the busy background.</td>', 'Great sharp focus. Composition feels a little funky, but I like it. Good DOF to soften the busy background.', '2005-07-06 21:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514037, 198866, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the title on this shot.  Excellent lighting and focus.  The colors and details of this shot really make it stand out from the crowd.</td>', 'I like the title on this shot.  Excellent lighting and focus.  The colors and details of this shot really make it stand out from the crowd.', '2005-07-06 21:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514041, 199451, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the soft colors in this shot.  The rose looks a little smushed, but it''s not a big deal.  The texture of the petals and water droplets is great.</td>', 'I like the soft colors in this shot.  The rose looks a little smushed, but it''s not a big deal.  The texture of the petals and water droplets is great.', '2005-07-06 21:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514044, 199545, 27767, '<td valign="top">Love the funky hairdoo :)  I like how the shallow DOF blurs out the hairs in the background.  Good focus on the subject.</td>', 'Love the funky hairdoo :)  I like how the shallow DOF blurs out the hairs in the background.  Good focus on the subject.', '2005-07-06 21:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514057, 199291, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  These blueberries look huge and the color, texture, and composition rule!..9</td>', 'This is a great shot!  These blueberries look huge and the color, texture, and composition rule!..9', '2005-07-06 21:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514059, 197886, 32754, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and macro showing steel points and the texture of the metal..repetition of the pattern is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Good lighting and macro showing steel points and the texture of the metal..repetition of the pattern is very pleasing to the eye.', '2005-07-06 21:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514061, 197911, 32754, '<td valign="top">excellent clarity and movement.</td>', 'excellent clarity and movement.', '2005-07-06 21:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514065, 198803, 32754, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and creative image..I like the flower inverted in the drop of water, like a lens, with the ladybug just above it.</td>', 'Very interesting and creative image..I like the flower inverted in the drop of water, like a lens, with the ladybug just above it.', '2005-07-06 21:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514068, 199447, 32754, '<td valign="top">cool head shot and wonderful macro; I can see all the details on the facets of the eyes...stunning job!</td>', 'cool head shot and wonderful macro; I can see all the details on the facets of the eyes...stunning job!', '2005-07-06 21:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514073, 198358, 32754, '<td valign="top">good lighting and texture of skin, great view of the eye; good use of dof.</td>', 'good lighting and texture of skin, great view of the eye; good use of dof.', '2005-07-06 21:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514077, 196941, 32754, '<td valign="top">Excellent bug shot! I like all the different textures and use of dof and lighting to enhance the segments of body.</td>', 'Excellent bug shot! I like all the different textures and use of dof and lighting to enhance the segments of body.', '2005-07-06 21:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514078, 197970, 32754, '<td valign="top">One of the best bug shots.  Good angle and detail of legs and body.</td>', 'One of the best bug shots.  Good angle and detail of legs and body.', '2005-07-06 21:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514079, 196891, 32754, '<td valign="top">i like the backlighting on this spider, it enhances the web and makes this very interesting...</td>', 'i like the backlighting on this spider, it enhances the web and makes this very interesting...', '2005-07-06 21:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514081, 199674, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like the head-on view of this spider..the eyes are great, he looks like an old man, too.</td>', 'I like the head-on view of this spider..the eyes are great, he looks like an old man, too.', '2005-07-06 21:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514084, 197893, 32754, '<td valign="top">Lovely color and lighting on stamens and pistils..I like the position of the flower in this frame and the hard light.</td>', 'Lovely color and lighting on stamens and pistils..I like the position of the flower in this frame and the hard light.', '2005-07-06 21:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514087, 198798, 32754, '<td valign="top">Beautiful detail of eyelashes and eye...perfect light and dof.</td>', 'Beautiful detail of eyelashes and eye...perfect light and dof.', '2005-07-06 21:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514091, 198412, 32754, '<td valign="top">I like this.  the backlight on the kiwi is great as is the red background...very vibrant and exciting photo.</td>', 'I like this.  the backlight on the kiwi is great as is the red background...very vibrant and exciting photo.', '2005-07-06 21:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514092, 199292, 37893, '<td valign="top">Care to share your photo secret? I''ve been wanting to do this. Great shot. It would probably be more dramatic if the croplet was just clinging on ever so slightly. Great use of color. Easily one of my favorites. 10</td>', 'Care to share your photo secret? I''ve been wanting to do this. Great shot. It would probably be more dramatic if the croplet was just clinging on ever so slightly. Great use of color. Easily one of my favorites. 10', '2005-07-06 21:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514094, 199484, 32754, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait..I like the fur around face looking like the wind is blowing it...did you put a fan behind this cat or is he outdoors?  Wonderful portrait and close up shot..the lighting is great; it appears to be direct sunlight but I may be wrong...7</td>', 'This is a nice portrait..I like the fur around face looking like the wind is blowing it...did you put a fan behind this cat or is he outdoors?  Wonderful portrait and close up shot..the lighting is great; it appears to be direct sunlight but I may be wrong...7', '2005-07-06 21:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514097, 198803, 37893, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... a twist of green and a spot of red? Ok throw in the daisy for good luck. Just love this image. I wonder how the image would look like if the lady bug was slightly to the left so it doesn''t cover the center of the daisy. GREAT image. 10!!!</td>', 'Hmmm... a twist of green and a spot of red? Ok throw in the daisy for good luck. Just love this image. I wonder how the image would look like if the lady bug was slightly to the left so it doesn''t cover the center of the daisy. GREAT image. 10!!!', '2005-07-06 21:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514101, 196767, 37893, '<td valign="top">WOW. you really did get up close and personal didn''t you? DOF could probably be improved. the outer limits of the photo is slightly out of focus but other than that, it''s an amazing macro shot. 9 from me.</td>', 'WOW. you really did get up close and personal didn''t you? DOF could probably be improved. the outer limits of the photo is slightly out of focus but other than that, it''s an amazing macro shot. 9 from me.', '2005-07-06 21:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514106, 199447, 37893, '<td valign="top">YIKES! GREAT shot! So how was this set up? I hope this little goateed dragon fly didn''t get hurt during the shoot :) Great DOF. Maybe a little rotation to the right to allow for a little more breathing space by the eye. Other than that, you''ve got my high score. 10+</td>', 'YIKES! GREAT shot! So how was this set up? I hope this little goateed dragon fly didn''t get hurt during the shoot :) Great DOF. Maybe a little rotation to the right to allow for a little more breathing space by the eye. Other than that, you''ve got my high score. 10+', '2005-07-06 21:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514107, 199078, 32754, '<td valign="top">great clarity and color..the shadow of stamens and pistils adds another element to this composition..it really pops out at you..</td>', 'great clarity and color..the shadow of stamens and pistils adds another element to this composition..it really pops out at you..', '2005-07-06 21:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514206, 198803, 4338, '<td valign="top">pretty cool 3fer</td>', 'pretty cool 3fer', '2005-07-06 22:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514290, 198610, 39336, '<td valign="top">Well, i think this is one of those photos many will be duplicating! It''s something now I want to do! How much work did you do in ps if any?</td>', 'Well, i think this is one of those photos many will be duplicating! It''s something now I want to do! How much work did you do in ps if any?', '2005-07-06 22:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514299, 196941, 39336, '<td valign="top">Ewww! Great close up maybe the line on the left bottom could be cloned out? what bug is this?</td>', 'Ewww! Great close up maybe the line on the left bottom could be cloned out? what bug is this?', '2005-07-06 22:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514306, 199269, 39483, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this photo. So original in composition and well shot. I especially like the split colored background. It works wonderfully well with the white flower. For me, some more sharpness on the top part of the flower (where the ends meet the sky) would have made it even better.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this photo. So original in composition and well shot. I especially like the split colored background. It works wonderfully well with the white flower. For me, some more sharpness on the top part of the flower (where the ends meet the sky) would have made it even better.Well done!', '2005-07-06 22:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514319, 198026, 39483, '<td valign="top">What details! I love that you can see the patterns of the wing lines, it draws your eyes in and around the photo. <br/>Seeing a bit more (perhaps down the middle) of the main body part might have made it more balanced? The cropping also seems too tight? I''m not an expert so this is just my opinion!<br/>Well done on the sharpness and contrast!</td>', 'What details! I love that you can see the patterns of the wing lines, it draws your eyes in and around the photo. Seeing a bit more (perhaps down the middle) of the main body part might have made it more balanced? The cropping also seems too tight? I''m not an expert so this is just my opinion!Well done on the sharpness and contrast!', '2005-07-06 22:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514328, 196724, 39483, '<td valign="top">Original shot and I really like the yellow and white contrast. The bubbles pop out of the image and seem so incredibly spherical and three dimensional! I also like the slight tilt.<br/>Well done!</td>', 'Original shot and I really like the yellow and white contrast. The bubbles pop out of the image and seem so incredibly spherical and three dimensional! I also like the slight tilt.Well done!', '2005-07-06 22:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514336, 197945, 39483, '<td valign="top">What a shot. You''ve captured its left eye beautifully well and the skin seems so very real and touchable (the right side of its face seems a bit overprocessed but it might be my monitor) The contrast of the yellow and green works very well in and of itself. Very well done and nice depth of field!</td>', 'What a shot. You''ve captured its left eye beautifully well and the skin seems so very real and touchable (the right side of its face seems a bit overprocessed but it might be my monitor) The contrast of the yellow and green works very well in and of itself. Very well done and nice depth of field!', '2005-07-06 22:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514342, 199074, 39483, '<td valign="top">That''s bound to be a favorite! Great expression on its face (or so we imagine), the position of the mouth led me to look back and forth around the image. Great sharpness and amazing contrast!<br/>Very well done! Love the tight crop.</td>', 'That''s bound to be a favorite! Great expression on its face (or so we imagine), the position of the mouth led me to look back and forth around the image. Great sharpness and amazing contrast!Very well done! Love the tight crop.', '2005-07-06 22:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514351, 199520, 39483, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the contrast between the yellow and the black background. On my monitor, the details seem a bit overprocessed. The water drops add interesting details to the image and the half crop is nice as well!</td>', 'I really like the composition and the contrast between the yellow and the black background. On my monitor, the details seem a bit overprocessed. The water drops add interesting details to the image and the half crop is nice as well!', '2005-07-06 23:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514363, 199531, 39483, '<td valign="top">The texture on the stem is amazing! Great composition and nice depth of field.<br/>It feels incredibly real and touchable. In my opinion, perhaps a brighter apple color (brighter red or green) might have helped increase the overall intensity of the image. Well done.</td>', 'The texture on the stem is amazing! Great composition and nice depth of field.It feels incredibly real and touchable. In my opinion, perhaps a brighter apple color (brighter red or green) might have helped increase the overall intensity of the image. Well done.', '2005-07-06 23:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514373, 199481, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro.  I like the DOF softening the backdrop so the bee stands out well.</td>', 'Very nice macro.  I like the DOF softening the backdrop so the bee stands out well.', '2005-07-06 23:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514376, 199036, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good detail in this shot.  The soft background sets off your subject very well.</td>', 'Good detail in this shot.  The soft background sets off your subject very well.', '2005-07-06 23:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1514384, 198150, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. It has an impressionist feel to it.  I hope other voters don''t beat you up too much for choosing the front of the petals for the focal point, because it sure makes your flower shot unique.</td>', 'I really like this shot. It has an impressionist feel to it.  I hope other voters don''t beat you up too much for choosing the front of the petals for the focal point, because it sure makes your flower shot unique.', '2005-07-06 23:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
