(1515068, 199351, 3669, '<td valign="top">Let''s see, I counted a little over 100 bug shots.  After awhile commenting gets to be ho humm and my fingers automatically type "good capture...nice focus".  This one included.  However, I will add that this one appears flat.  I use Photoshop Elements and would try adjusting the shadows and highlights to give it more depth and make your bee stand out from the picture better.  Also, try cropping a little closer at the bottom to get rid of the shadow.</td>', 'Let''s see, I counted a little over 100 bug shots.  After awhile commenting gets to be ho humm and my fingers automatically type "good capture...nice focus".  This one included.  However, I will add that this one appears flat.  I use Photoshop Elements and would try adjusting the shadows and highlights to give it more depth and make your bee stand out from the picture better.  Also, try cropping a little closer at the bottom to get rid of the shadow.', '2005-07-07 06:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515069, 199251, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and focus.  I like the way you cropped this photo for an interesting veiwpoint.</td>', 'Nice colors and focus.  I like the way you cropped this photo for an interesting veiwpoint.', '2005-07-07 06:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515070, 199342, 3669, '<td valign="top">Good capture...excellent focus.  I like the muted colors.</td>', 'Good capture...excellent focus.  I like the muted colors.', '2005-07-07 06:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515071, 197764, 3669, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little TOO close for my liking.  Good focus and too much detail.</td>', 'Perhaps a little TOO close for my liking.  Good focus and too much detail.', '2005-07-07 06:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515072, 199528, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.  Interesting detail and color.</td>', 'Nice focus.  Interesting detail and color.', '2005-07-07 06:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515074, 199650, 3669, '<td valign="top">Good DOF.  Nice colors and detail.</td>', 'Good DOF.  Nice colors and detail.', '2005-07-07 06:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515077, 199466, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting DOF.  His eyes ARE neat, however, I would like to see more defined edges around the frog.  I like the muted colors in the background.</td>', 'Interesting DOF.  His eyes ARE neat, however, I would like to see more defined edges around the frog.  I like the muted colors in the background.', '2005-07-07 06:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515078, 199393, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice colors...interesting perspective.</td>', 'Nice colors...interesting perspective.', '2005-07-07 06:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515079, 196724, 3669, '<td valign="top">It is very nice to see some origionality in a challenge full of flowers and bugs.  Interesting DOF.  Nice color and focus.  Now, I think I''ll go to the frig and get me something to drink.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It is very nice to see some origionality in a challenge full of flowers and bugs.  Interesting DOF.  Nice color and focus.  Now, I think I''ll go to the frig and get me something to drink.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-07-07 06:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515080, 199120, 40404, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The fade on the left-bottom gives it more depth, too.</td>', 'Great capture.  The fade on the left-bottom gives it more depth, too.', '2005-07-07 06:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515081, 199074, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter to get close and personal to.  Good to see some originality in a challenge full of flowers and bugs.  Good focus and detail.  A good thing for this picture, I think...LOL  :-)</td>', 'Interesting subject matter to get close and personal to.  Good to see some originality in a challenge full of flowers and bugs.  Good focus and detail.  A good thing for this picture, I think...LOL  :-)', '2005-07-07 06:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515082, 197945, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice capture...good pose.  Perhaps a little oversharpened.  Picked up some artifact.</td>', 'Nice capture...good pose.  Perhaps a little oversharpened.  Picked up some artifact.', '2005-07-07 06:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515085, 198931, 3669, '<td valign="top">A little flat and dark.  I think it could use a little boost of contrast.  I like the placement of your subject and the crop of the picture.  Nice perspective.</td>', 'A little flat and dark.  I think it could use a little boost of contrast.  I like the placement of your subject and the crop of the picture.  Nice perspective.', '2005-07-07 06:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515087, 199492, 3669, '<td valign="top">Pretty flower and nice lighting and focus, however it is too centered in the picture.  I think rotating this image about 30-45 degrees either way would look more interesting than just vertical.</td>', 'Pretty flower and nice lighting and focus, however it is too centered in the picture.  I think rotating this image about 30-45 degrees either way would look more interesting than just vertical.', '2005-07-07 06:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515089, 198756, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  Great lighting and focus.  I love the colors.  I also like your choice of border.  I hope you are scoring well because this is a great photo.</td>', 'Excellent capture.  Great lighting and focus.  I love the colors.  I also like your choice of border.  I hope you are scoring well because this is a great photo.', '2005-07-07 06:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515090, 199114, 3669, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo of color and texture.  It is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of flowers and bugs.  Good luck!!  :-)</td>', 'Interesting photo of color and texture.  It is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of flowers and bugs.  Good luck!!  :-)', '2005-07-07 06:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515092, 199385, 3669, '<td valign="top">Excellent effects.  Well done.  It is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of flowers and bugs.  I hope you are doing well as this is a great photo.</td>', 'Excellent effects.  Well done.  It is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of flowers and bugs.  I hope you are doing well as this is a great photo.', '2005-07-07 06:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515093, 198830, 3669, '<td valign="top">I guess you are probably already getting lots of gruff about the uneven border.   Your close-up is nicely done and well focused.  The lashes, however, are a little unruly.  A little spit on the fingers could shape them up nicely.</td>', 'I guess you are probably already getting lots of gruff about the uneven border.   Your close-up is nicely done and well focused.  The lashes, however, are a little unruly.  A little spit on the fingers could shape them up nicely.', '2005-07-07 06:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515095, 198339, 3669, '<td valign="top">Just a bit more focus and some JPEG clean-up and you''d have yourself a better picture.  The prism effect on the background is nice.</td>', 'Just a bit more focus and some JPEG clean-up and you''d have yourself a better picture.  The prism effect on the background is nice.', '2005-07-07 06:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515096, 198977, 3669, '<td valign="top">ACK...now I''ll be seeing colored spots when I close my eyes.  While it is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of bugs and flowers, this is just not pleasing to the eyes.</td>', 'ACK...now I''ll be seeing colored spots when I close my eyes.  While it is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of bugs and flowers, this is just not pleasing to the eyes.', '2005-07-07 06:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515098, 198698, 3669, '<td valign="top">Cute close-up.  It is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of bugs and flowers.  Nice lighting and good focus.</td>', 'Cute close-up.  It is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of bugs and flowers.  Nice lighting and good focus.', '2005-07-07 06:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515100, 198448, 3669, '<td valign="top">While it is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of bugs and flowers, I''m afraid that don''t particularily like this close-up.  Usually photos that are overdone in post-processing don''t do well here.</td>', 'While it is nice to see some originality in a challenge full of bugs and flowers, I''m afraid that don''t particularily like this close-up.  Usually photos that are overdone in post-processing don''t do well here.', '2005-07-07 06:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515101, 198557, 3669, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I love the colors.</td>', 'Great capture.  I love the colors.', '2005-07-07 07:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515102, 199667, 3669, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea.  Nice lighting and focus.</td>', 'Very creative idea.  Nice lighting and focus.', '2005-07-07 07:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515106, 198026, 3669, '<td valign="top">Neat perspective.  I like the attention to detail.  Focus and lighting are nice.</td>', 'Neat perspective.  I like the attention to detail.  Focus and lighting are nice.', '2005-07-07 07:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515108, 199541, 3669, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Excellent focus.  Lighting is near perfect and the picture shows depth.  I love the colors.  Good job.  I hope you are scoring well because this is a very good macro.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Excellent focus.  Lighting is near perfect and the picture shows depth.  I love the colors.  Good job.  I hope you are scoring well because this is a very good macro.', '2005-07-07 07:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1515110, 199080, 3669, '<td valign="top">LOL...a refreashing take on the challenge.  Good job.</td>', 'LOL...a refreashing take on the challenge.  Good job.', '2005-07-07 07:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
