(1516137, 198150, 6388, '<td valign="top">where''s the impressionism challenge when you need it.  I haven''t been particularly moved by the flower macros in this challenge, but I have to tell you this is phenomenal.  I really hope this becomes a print when you''re done...I think you''d make some sales with it.  Beautiful texture and subtle bokeh.  the focus on the front petal isn''t perfect (or maybe your sharpening method added a few artifacts that obscures it some), but close enough for me.  Very very nice.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'where''s the impressionism challenge when you need it.  I haven''t been particularly moved by the flower macros in this challenge, but I have to tell you this is phenomenal.  I really hope this becomes a print when you''re done...I think you''d make some sales with it.  Beautiful texture and subtle bokeh.  the focus on the front petal isn''t perfect (or maybe your sharpening method added a few artifacts that obscures it some), but close enough for me.  Very very nice. P', '2005-07-07 15:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516138, 199074, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow! Outstanding detail and composition as well as a really nice job of processing. The noise on the left is a bit distracting, but takes very little away from this amazing image. Great great job!</td>', 'Wow! Outstanding detail and composition as well as a really nice job of processing. The noise on the left is a bit distracting, but takes very little away from this amazing image. Great great job!', '2005-07-07 15:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
