(1516157, 198358, 6388, '<td valign="top">a Tokay, no?  excellent detail and DOF.  perhaps a little more contrasted backdrop (darker OR lighter) might make this guy pop a little more.  I''m looking forward to seeing what lens/camera you used for this.  the rich tones and sharp contrast are brilliant.<br/> <br/>P</td>', 'a Tokay, no?  excellent detail and DOF.  perhaps a little more contrasted backdrop (darker OR lighter) might make this guy pop a little more.  I''m looking forward to seeing what lens/camera you used for this.  the rich tones and sharp contrast are brilliant. P', '2005-07-07 15:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516161, 199291, 37212, '<td valign="top">One of the first that I voted on, now that I have come back to it I like it even more.  I think it is a good picture, nothing wrong, perfect......</td>', 'One of the first that I voted on, now that I have come back to it I like it even more.  I think it is a good picture, nothing wrong, perfect......', '2005-07-07 15:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
