(1516177, 199410, 37212, '<td valign="top">Not very attractive, but it does meet the challenge and the only thing wrong is, well......yuck.</td>', 'Not very attractive, but it does meet the challenge and the only thing wrong is, well......yuck.', '2005-07-07 15:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516185, 199291, 19952, '<td valign="top">This macro is absolutely perfect. In my opinion, you did every single thing right, from composition to processing. Great great job!</td>', 'This macro is absolutely perfect. In my opinion, you did every single thing right, from composition to processing. Great great job!', '2005-07-07 15:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516188, 198113, 37212, '<td valign="top">Nice looking cat, the shadow in the forground takes away from the pic and the slight image of the cat in the upper right hand corner is distracting.</td>', 'Nice looking cat, the shadow in the forground takes away from the pic and the slight image of the cat in the upper right hand corner is distracting.', '2005-07-07 16:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516192, 198412, 37212, '<td valign="top">I really like the details that you captured but I don''t care for the background that you used.</td>', 'I really like the details that you captured but I don''t care for the background that you used.', '2005-07-07 16:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516196, 199586, 19746, '<td valign="top">Interesting rhythm and pattern created in this shot, lovely complimentary yellows and purples and although I feel this image could be slightly sharper around the drops I think it''s terrific.  Original take on the classic flower shot, 9 from me and best of luck.<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Interesting rhythm and pattern created in this shot, lovely complimentary yellows and purples and although I feel this image could be slightly sharper around the drops I think it''s terrific.  Original take on the classic flower shot, 9 from me and best of luck. Alex', '2005-07-07 16:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516204, 199126, 37212, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, good job, details are very nice.</td>', 'Very pretty, good job, details are very nice.', '2005-07-07 16:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516207, 199048, 19746, '<td valign="top">Well you''ve thrown the ''avoid centred composition'' rule out of the window, and it has worked BRILLIANTLY! :)<br/> <br/>Great tones on this one and the cinnamon stick pattern is incredible.  I would have perhaps gone with a slightly shallower DOF and I think the cinnamon sticks are a little over saturated/sharpened?  Either way I think this is a great shot, and it''s really refreshing to see something original in the macro challenge.<br/> <br/>A 9 from me - best of luck.<br/>Alex</td>', 'Well you''ve thrown the ''avoid centred composition'' rule out of the window, and it has worked BRILLIANTLY! :) Great tones on this one and the cinnamon stick pattern is incredible.  I would have perhaps gone with a slightly shallower DOF and I think the cinnamon sticks are a little over saturated/sharpened?  Either way I think this is a great shot, and it''s really refreshing to see something original in the macro challenge. A 9 from me - best of luck.Alex', '2005-07-07 16:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516218, 196987, 19952, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool effect - I''m really interested in knowing how you did this. Very nice job!</td>', 'This is such a cool effect - I''m really interested in knowing how you did this. Very nice job!', '2005-07-07 16:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516222, 199101, 39116, '<td valign="top">it is just a little out of focus ....but ill mark it 7.....well done</td>', 'it is just a little out of focus ....but ill mark it 7.....well done', '2005-07-07 16:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1516230, 198358, 19746, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus, great DOF isolating an individual feature on an already small subject - fantastic work.<br/> <br/>This is a fantastic shot, textures of the skin, the detail on the eye, the expression are all awesome.  A small gripe about the BG, I think it would be even more striking on black, red or orange, the neutral gray definitely does not hurt though.<br/> <br/>Nice to see a different sort of macro - refreshing.  Good luck for the challenge!  One of my few 10s<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'Perfect focus, great DOF isolating an individual feature on an already small subject - fantastic work. This is a fantastic shot, textures of the skin, the detail on the eye, the expression are all awesome.  A small gripe about the BG, I think it would be even more striking on black, red or orange, the neutral gray definitely does not hurt though. Nice to see a different sort of macro - refreshing.  Good luck for the challenge!  One of my few 10s Alex', '2005-07-07 16:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
