(1517395, 199622, 23680, '<td valign="top">Way too saturated, too much going on between the subject and the border.  I like the choice of white background though</td>', 'Way too saturated, too much going on between the subject and the border.  I like the choice of white background though', '2005-07-08 00:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517400, 199397, 20324, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nice vibrant color, but it seems too busy and harsh for the eyes. I would try to crop it differently.</td>', 'Good idea, nice vibrant color, but it seems too busy and harsh for the eyes. I would try to crop it differently.', '2005-07-08 00:14:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517405, 196724, 20324, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but i would have taken a picture of just the bubbles, or cropped this to concentrate on them. The foam and fuzzy background don''t add to the picture. Also, why didn''t you straighten this or make the angle more prominent?</td>', 'Good idea, but i would have taken a picture of just the bubbles, or cropped this to concentrate on them. The foam and fuzzy background don''t add to the picture. Also, why didn''t you straighten this or make the angle more prominent?', '2005-07-08 00:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517408, 198480, 20324, '<td valign="top">The red flower is distracting and the composition is a little awkward and tight at the top and bottom of the dragonfly.</td>', 'The red flower is distracting and the composition is a little awkward and tight at the top and bottom of the dragonfly.', '2005-07-08 00:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517410, 198480, 23680, '<td valign="top">Nice macro of the bug, good color and sharpness.  A tighter crop on the right to eliminate the red flower I think would be more effective, that red draws my eye away from your subject</td>', 'Nice macro of the bug, good color and sharpness.  A tighter crop on the right to eliminate the red flower I think would be more effective, that red draws my eye away from your subject', '2005-07-08 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517416, 198927, 20324, '<td valign="top">The baby feet would have been enough. The big toe is unapplealing, no offense.<br/>Over all, the picture doesn''t seem sharp to me but at the same time it isn''t soft.</td>', 'The baby feet would have been enough. The big toe is unapplealing, no offense.Over all, the picture doesn''t seem sharp to me but at the same time it isn''t soft.', '2005-07-08 00:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517419, 199586, 37779, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe it! How did you do it? AMAZING!! Love this, brilliant! It''s THE winner of this challenge. Wow, this is just awesome. 10++++ :)</td>', 'I can''t believe it! How did you do it? AMAZING!! Love this, brilliant! It''s THE winner of this challenge. Wow, this is just awesome. 10++++ :)', '2005-07-08 00:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
