(1517916, 199667, 30364, '<td valign="top">Oh, you''ll be getting belted by all the Euroweenies etc.  What''s new?  It''s an OK image &amp; a worthy sentiment.  And it''s not a flower.  Happy birthday!  8  <br/>Back again the day after London ... now it''s even more worthy.  10.</td>', 'Oh, you''ll be getting belted by all the Euroweenies etc.  What''s new?  It''s an OK image & a worthy sentiment.  And it''s not a flower.  Happy birthday!  8  Back again the day after London ... now it''s even more worthy.  10.', '2005-07-08 07:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517918, 196724, 30364, '<td valign="top">A very good idea, a well executed photograph, and a great beverage.  I''ll have a pint.  Cheers!  9</td>', 'A very good idea, a well executed photograph, and a great beverage.  I''ll have a pint.  Cheers!  9', '2005-07-08 07:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517922, 197960, 30364, '<td valign="top">That''s a terrific image.  Original subject, well conceived (composition &amp; point of focus), and perfect execution.  It has a marvellous 3-dimensional character.  Well done.  10</td>', 'That''s a terrific image.  Original subject, well conceived (composition & point of focus), and perfect execution.  It has a marvellous 3-dimensional character.  Well done.  10', '2005-07-08 07:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517923, 198150, 30364, '<td valign="top">At last!  A flower shot with some imagination and originality.  This is terrific &amp; shows what can be done if the brain is focused as well as the camera.  9<br/>Back for final look ... let''s make it a 10.</td>', 'At last!  A flower shot with some imagination and originality.  This is terrific & shows what can be done if the brain is focused as well as the camera.  9Back for final look ... let''s make it a 10.', '2005-07-08 07:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517924, 198154, 24330, '<td valign="top">hopeless subject, no focal point/begining,middle or end.<br/>sorry just can,t see the point of this pic.</td>', 'hopeless subject, no focal point/begining,middle or end.sorry just can,t see the point of this pic.', '2005-07-08 07:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1517927, 197524, 30364, '<td valign="top">Original and technically excellent view of a delicious subject.  Good thinking and fine photography.  8</td>', 'Original and technically excellent view of a delicious subject.  Good thinking and fine photography.  8', '2005-07-08 07:47:05.000000', NULL, 1);
