(1517933, 198338, 30364, '<td valign="top">The outstanding bug shot of the challenge.  You grasp what so many have overlooked; it''s not the subject, it''s the IDEA that matters most.  Well done.  9</td>', 'The outstanding bug shot of the challenge.  You grasp what so many have overlooked; it''s not the subject, it''s the IDEA that matters most.  Well done.  9', '2005-07-08 07:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
