(1517950, 199142, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well chosen subject. I like the touch of shadow. It gives a feeling of time of day and accents the sunny nature of the flower.</td>', 'Well chosen subject. I like the touch of shadow. It gives a feeling of time of day and accents the sunny nature of the flower.', '2005-07-08 07:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
