(1518542, 198787, 36981, '<td valign="top">This wasn''t as interesting as it could have been for me. I think that the depth of field is a bit disturbing - the grass is out of focus (and it looks like there might even be some motion blue on the frontmost piece of grass), but not enough so that it is a background object - it still seems to have enough space &amp; focus to be distracting.  The subject itself isn''t interesting enough in this light to pull my eyes in.</td>', 'This wasn''t as interesting as it could have been for me. I think that the depth of field is a bit disturbing - the grass is out of focus (and it looks like there might even be some motion blue on the frontmost piece of grass), but not enough so that it is a background object - it still seems to have enough space & focus to be distracting.  The subject itself isn''t interesting enough in this light to pull my eyes in.', '2005-07-08 12:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
