(1518559, 198103, 36981, '<td valign="top">Well photographed, and I like the angle &amp; composition.  The colors &amp; detail are beautiful.  While I know the challenge includes closeups, I don''t feel this is close enough to meet the spirit of the challenge (I''m generally not tryannical about this - this is only 1 of 2 images I am marking down for challenge appropriateness).  5</td>', 'Well photographed, and I like the angle & composition.  The colors & detail are beautiful.  While I know the challenge includes closeups, I don''t feel this is close enough to meet the spirit of the challenge (I''m generally not tryannical about this - this is only 1 of 2 images I am marking down for challenge appropriateness).  5', '2005-07-08 12:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
