(1519626, 198525, 25678, '<td valign="top">I like this one a lot</td>', 'I like this one a lot', '2005-07-08 19:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519627, 199348, 25678, '<td valign="top">Fun and creative!</td>', 'Fun and creative!', '2005-07-08 19:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519628, 199500, 7628, '<td valign="top">I liike the humor in yor title.  Wish the green and red were a little deeper, and the whites less yellow. Hard to light mayo without some glare.</td>', 'I liike the humor in yor title.  Wish the green and red were a little deeper, and the whites less yellow. Hard to light mayo without some glare.', '2005-07-08 19:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519629, 199291, 3032, '<td valign="top">Like this it almost looks like red cabbage. :)<br/>I like the simpleness (as opposed to confused) of the composition and colors. The light is very good here. Bit unsure about the contrast and punch of the colors. Could perhaps do with a bit harder USM. 7</td>', 'Like this it almost looks like red cabbage. :)I like the simpleness (as opposed to confused) of the composition and colors. The light is very good here. Bit unsure about the contrast and punch of the colors. Could perhaps do with a bit harder USM. 7', '2005-07-08 19:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519632, 199605, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and good use of leading lines and depth of focus.  Wish your beetle were sharper.</td>', 'Nice colors and good use of leading lines and depth of focus.  Wish your beetle were sharper.', '2005-07-08 19:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519634, 198116, 25678, '<td valign="top">I think some tweaking with brightness and colors and saturation will help this picture a lot.  It''s a nice idea, but the colors are dark and muted, making the picture not as interesting as it could be</td>', 'I think some tweaking with brightness and colors and saturation will help this picture a lot.  It''s a nice idea, but the colors are dark and muted, making the picture not as interesting as it could be', '2005-07-08 19:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519636, 199677, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the way the light on the flower works vs the dark background. The soft mood is good too. The crop would be better if the small bit of another flower at the left corner would have been cropped off, but that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'I like the way the light on the flower works vs the dark background. The soft mood is good too. The crop would be better if the small bit of another flower at the left corner would have been cropped off, but that''s just my opinion.', '2005-07-08 19:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519637, 197784, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is so nicely done.  Its sure to be a ribbon contender</td>', 'This is so nicely done.  Its sure to be a ribbon contender', '2005-07-08 19:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519638, 197030, 3032, '<td valign="top">You''d think your watching some kind of jewel. Good job!</td>', 'You''d think your watching some kind of jewel. Good job!', '2005-07-08 19:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519639, 199654, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp picture.  All those little hairs on your beetle really stand out!  Nice placement of the beetle on the thirds lines - creates a sense of where he wants to go.  Wish the background were darker or lighter so the beetle would "pop" more - he is blending in twith the background even with your nice use of narrow depth of focus.</td>', 'Nice sharp picture.  All those little hairs on your beetle really stand out!  Nice placement of the beetle on the thirds lines - creates a sense of where he wants to go.  Wish the background were darker or lighter so the beetle would "pop" more - he is blending in twith the background even with your nice use of narrow depth of focus.', '2005-07-08 19:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519640, 199631, 3032, '<td valign="top">One of those occasion where selective desat works.</td>', 'One of those occasion where selective desat works.', '2005-07-08 19:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519641, 197846, 1024, '<td valign="top">Fierce and awesome.  Personally I would be nervous getting this close to this guy.</td>', 'Fierce and awesome.  Personally I would be nervous getting this close to this guy.', '2005-07-08 19:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519642, 199579, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition with your fly perched along the top thirds line.  You caught some nice details  wish it were sharper.</td>', 'Lovely composition with your fly perched along the top thirds line.  You caught some nice details  wish it were sharper.', '2005-07-08 19:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519643, 198421, 25678, '<td valign="top">I like this picture and the idea.  Personally, I''m not fond of the flatness of the composition.  Doing something compositionally to give it more perspective would have helped this picture (IMHO)</td>', 'I like this picture and the idea.  Personally, I''m not fond of the flatness of the composition.  Doing something compositionally to give it more perspective would have helped this picture (IMHO)', '2005-07-08 19:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519644, 199582, 36641, '<td valign="top">The detail of the wings really stands out.  Nice!</td>', 'The detail of the wings really stands out.  Nice!', '2005-07-08 19:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519646, 199528, 3032, '<td valign="top">I love the classic mood/color of this.</td>', 'I love the classic mood/color of this.', '2005-07-08 19:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519647, 198927, 1024, '<td valign="top">The focus on this is just a little too soft.</td>', 'The focus on this is just a little too soft.', '2005-07-08 19:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519652, 198236, 3032, '<td valign="top">It''s like you are in a tanker and an F16 is coming nearby to refuel.<br/>Very cool.</td>', 'It''s like you are in a tanker and an F16 is coming nearby to refuel.Very cool.', '2005-07-08 19:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519653, 199492, 36641, '<td valign="top">Very Pretty</td>', 'Very Pretty', '2005-07-08 19:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519655, 198150, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very abstract with the really narrow depth of focus.  The impression of light an shadow helps the eye understand the picture none-the-less.  Your use of diagonals creates a pleasing composition.  I imagine this won''t appeal to everyone, but I enjoy it. 7</td>', 'Very abstract with the really narrow depth of focus.  The impression of light an shadow helps the eye understand the picture none-the-less.  Your use of diagonals creates a pleasing composition.  I imagine this won''t appeal to everyone, but I enjoy it. 7', '2005-07-08 19:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519656, 199597, 3032, '<td valign="top">Magical colors.</td>', 'Magical colors.', '2005-07-08 19:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519657, 197841, 3032, '<td valign="top">Very confusing nature. Nice catch.</td>', 'Very confusing nature. Nice catch.', '2005-07-08 19:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519663, 199165, 3032, '<td valign="top">The tones of the B&amp;W are great but the flower in front lacks a bit of exposure to properly pop out. Some weak macro flash might have worked very well here.</td>', 'The tones of the B&W are great but the flower in front lacks a bit of exposure to properly pop out. Some weak macro flash might have worked very well here.', '2005-07-08 19:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519664, 199410, 7628, '<td valign="top">Disgusting detail - I really feel I''m right there!  Nice to include the ball and the kids in the background - it really helps get your message across.  The bright blades of glass in the foreground distract - but could you have gotten in closer without passing out?</td>', 'Disgusting detail - I really feel I''m right there!  Nice to include the ball and the kids in the background - it really helps get your message across.  The bright blades of glass in the foreground distract - but could you have gotten in closer without passing out?', '2005-07-08 19:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519667, 199140, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors.  The white has some good detail in it - hard to do.  Wish the DOF were greater and the whole berry were in focus.</td>', 'Nice bright colors.  The white has some good detail in it - hard to do.  Wish the DOF were greater and the whole berry were in focus.', '2005-07-08 19:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519669, 199315, 3032, '<td valign="top">I love it how the rain is presented in streaks and how the raindrops spatter of the lilly. Exposure is excellent.</td>', 'I love it how the rain is presented in streaks and how the raindrops spatter of the lilly. Exposure is excellent.', '2005-07-08 19:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519671, 198806, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the way this photo makes us notice things we don''t normally see when we look at a pineapple.  A very good use of macro.  Feels a little dark and has a bit too much of a yellow cast.</td>', 'I like the way this photo makes us notice things we don''t normally see when we look at a pineapple.  A very good use of macro.  Feels a little dark and has a bit too much of a yellow cast.', '2005-07-08 19:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519672, 198756, 36060, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, very clear and good colours.</td>', 'Lovely photo, very clear and good colours.', '2005-07-08 19:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519673, 198846, 36060, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, very clear and good colours.</td>', 'Lovely photo, very clear and good colours.', '2005-07-08 19:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519674, 197333, 36060, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, very clear and good colours.</td>', 'Lovely photo, very clear and good colours.', '2005-07-08 19:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519682, 199511, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very simple and elegant.  Nice composition.  Perhaps a little more contrast would make the whites brighter and the shadows darker.  With something so smooth it creates the illusion of lact of focus - maybe having a headphones wirte or other detail winding across the picture would give more detail and depth - but then you''d loose the almost abstract simplicity.</td>', 'Very simple and elegant.  Nice composition.  Perhaps a little more contrast would make the whites brighter and the shadows darker.  With something so smooth it creates the illusion of lact of focus - maybe having a headphones wirte or other detail winding across the picture would give more detail and depth - but then you''d loose the almost abstract simplicity.', '2005-07-08 19:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519683, 199164, 36060, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I like it very much</td>', 'Great shot, I like it very much', '2005-07-08 19:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519685, 199311, 3032, '<td valign="top">I just love how the pinks and greens flow into eachother. The main subject seems to be in the way. :) 8</td>', 'I just love how the pinks and greens flow into eachother. The main subject seems to be in the way. :) 8', '2005-07-08 19:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519687, 199120, 3032, '<td valign="top">Fresh. That''s the firs word that pops up.<br/>Interesting how the green under the water is so much more saturated than the dry greens.<br/>Good.</td>', 'Fresh. That''s the firs word that pops up.Interesting how the green under the water is so much more saturated than the dry greens.Good.', '2005-07-08 19:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519689, 197058, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle and some nice details.  Like the diagonal composition. Wish there were a bit larger depth of focus - and the bill were included.  A bit grainy n the gark green to the right.</td>', 'Interesting angle and some nice details.  Like the diagonal composition. Wish there were a bit larger depth of focus - and the bill were included.  A bit grainy n the gark green to the right.', '2005-07-08 19:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519691, 197960, 3032, '<td valign="top">I love it how the repetition of forms fades away into the background. Very dynamic. 8</td>', 'I love it how the repetition of forms fades away into the background. Very dynamic. 8', '2005-07-08 19:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519694, 199074, 3032, '<td valign="top">Funny &amp; Good!</td>', 'Funny & Good!', '2005-07-08 19:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519695, 198846, 7628, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject to get close too.  Lovely curves - the composition holds them well. This seems to have a greenish cast.  I think it would be much more engagin brighter and more red and less green and yellow.</td>', 'An interesting subject to get close too.  Lovely curves - the composition holds them well. This seems to have a greenish cast.  I think it would be much more engagin brighter and more red and less green and yellow.', '2005-07-08 19:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519697, 198857, 3032, '<td valign="top">Creative background. It works even better when you stand back a bit from the screen.</td>', 'Creative background. It works even better when you stand back a bit from the screen.', '2005-07-08 19:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519702, 198739, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition - really "slices" the subject in a way that makes it very engaging to look at.  Nice color and texture - I SO wish it were all in focus - that soft spot at the top in the middle is distracting. 7</td>', 'Lovely composition - really "slices" the subject in a way that makes it very engaging to look at.  Nice color and texture - I SO wish it were all in focus - that soft spot at the top in the middle is distracting. 7', '2005-07-08 20:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519704, 198656, 7628, '<td valign="top">pretty and fluid.  Nice contrast and sharpness and composition.  Your central droplet really stands out - both sharp and darker than the background. 7</td>', 'pretty and fluid.  Nice contrast and sharpness and composition.  Your central droplet really stands out - both sharp and darker than the background. 7', '2005-07-08 20:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519706, 199671, 3032, '<td valign="top">This is so Sher. O my, do I love your style. Such simple subjects portrayed in such a powerful way.</td>', 'This is so Sher. O my, do I love your style. Such simple subjects portrayed in such a powerful way.', '2005-07-08 20:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519709, 198236, 7628, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  Great composition and action!  Wish those wings stood out from the background a little better - but what a marvelous capture!</td>', 'Yikes!  Great composition and action!  Wish those wings stood out from the background a little better - but what a marvelous capture!', '2005-07-08 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519711, 199170, 3032, '<td valign="top">Amazing, makes me wonder what they actually see with those CCD eyes of them.<br/>Wonderful how the eyes stand out, the stuff between them looks like metal. Biomechanical fly? :)</td>', 'Amazing, makes me wonder what they actually see with those CCD eyes of them.Wonderful how the eyes stand out, the stuff between them looks like metal. Biomechanical fly? :)', '2005-07-08 20:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519713, 199061, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and tone! Good work with the lighting. I like how you''ve placed the subject in the frame.  perhaps a little more room at the top  and a bit less on the right would be better.</td>', 'Nice detail and tone! Good work with the lighting. I like how you''ve placed the subject in the frame.  perhaps a little more room at the top  and a bit less on the right would be better.', '2005-07-08 20:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519715, 198655, 3032, '<td valign="top">That kind of bluepurple is my favorite color. Good composition, there is a good flow and direction in the image. I don''t like the eye however. The reflection breaks it in two and it would have more imapact with some light in it.</td>', 'That kind of bluepurple is my favorite color. Good composition, there is a good flow and direction in the image. I don''t like the eye however. The reflection breaks it in two and it would have more imapact with some light in it.', '2005-07-08 20:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519716, 197333, 7628, '<td valign="top">terrific detail and color, nicely framed.  Doesn;t get much better than this! 9</td>', 'terrific detail and color, nicely framed.  Doesn;t get much better than this! 9', '2005-07-08 20:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519720, 198786, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great colors. The pistils stand out perfectly with the yellow bits precisely in the orange-red background.</td>', 'Great colors. The pistils stand out perfectly with the yellow bits precisely in the orange-red background.', '2005-07-08 20:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519722, 197917, 3032, '<td valign="top">The way the light builds up in intensity is very interesting, almost magical.</td>', 'The way the light builds up in intensity is very interesting, almost magical.', '2005-07-08 20:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519724, 198558, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely look at a feather - good detail, composition.  The water droplet give a nice spot for your eye to settle and encourages them to move on because you can see through it.  the bright highlights in the droplet are a bit blown out.</td>', 'Lovely look at a feather - good detail, composition.  The water droplet give a nice spot for your eye to settle and encourages them to move on because you can see through it.  the bright highlights in the droplet are a bit blown out.', '2005-07-08 20:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519726, 199541, 3032, '<td valign="top">The green works well with the purples, the DOF helps to make it stand out. As a composition it isn''t perfect but what I said in the first sentence helps to make it stand out from the others. 7</td>', 'The green works well with the purples, the DOF helps to make it stand out. As a composition it isn''t perfect but what I said in the first sentence helps to make it stand out from the others. 7', '2005-07-08 20:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519730, 199419, 7628, '<td valign="top">Glistenning!  Good choice of colors - the green and gold are lovely together.  the feather and water drop at the left are a bit too bright, and the green is noticeably grainy.  A little dodging and some selective blurring might help.</td>', 'Glistenning!  Good choice of colors - the green and gold are lovely together.  the feather and water drop at the left are a bit too bright, and the green is noticeably grainy.  A little dodging and some selective blurring might help.', '2005-07-08 20:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519732, 199417, 40486, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture</td>', 'Very nice picture', '2005-07-08 20:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519736, 199393, 3032, '<td valign="top">Almost pastel like colors. The yellow works well with the blue. I like the composition, all the lines in the blue lead to the yellow, but all lines in the whole picture lead to somewhere not in the centre or to near the edge. It lacks the real sharpness punch but on the other hand the soft approach works pretty good. 7</td>', 'Almost pastel like colors. The yellow works well with the blue. I like the composition, all the lines in the blue lead to the yellow, but all lines in the whole picture lead to somewhere not in the centre or to near the edge. It lacks the real sharpness punch but on the other hand the soft approach works pretty good. 7', '2005-07-08 20:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519741, 199447, 3032, '<td valign="top">Gilette should invent some shaving devices for flies and mosquitos. ;)<br/>Jeez, this is close. Colors, sharpness, exposure and overall punch are so good here. Normally you''d say ''damn those buggers'' but this one is actually making a funny face. How can you slam one to death after a pic like this?</td>', 'Gilette should invent some shaving devices for flies and mosquitos. ;)Jeez, this is close. Colors, sharpness, exposure and overall punch are so good here. Normally you''d say ''damn those buggers'' but this one is actually making a funny face. How can you slam one to death after a pic like this?', '2005-07-08 20:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519744, 199596, 3032, '<td valign="top">Nice glow. Red works well with the purple and green in the background. A tad soft, but it still works for me. 7</td>', 'Nice glow. Red works well with the purple and green in the background. A tad soft, but it still works for me. 7', '2005-07-08 20:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519747, 198665, 3032, '<td valign="top">It is almost as if the leaves are rotating like a windmill. That''s what I like here. The waterdrops give a fresh outdoors feel to the shot. Well done.</td>', 'It is almost as if the leaves are rotating like a windmill. That''s what I like here. The waterdrops give a fresh outdoors feel to the shot. Well done.', '2005-07-08 20:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519750, 199453, 3032, '<td valign="top">Looking into the vulcano. I like the fiery punch but I dislike the hard shadows on the left.</td>', 'Looking into the vulcano. I like the fiery punch but I dislike the hard shadows on the left.', '2005-07-08 20:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1519754, 199164, 3032, '<td valign="top">Bumpin it up, this is just great. All lines lead inward and once you''re in it blows you away.</td>', 'Bumpin it up, this is just great. All lines lead inward and once you''re in it blows you away.', '2005-07-08 20:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
