(1520062, 199385, 39313, '<td valign="top">Good host, yet the pin could be hidden to give more enphasis on the phantasmagoric smoke.<br/>Just a name suggestion: nightmare.</td>', 'Good host, yet the pin could be hidden to give more enphasis on the phantasmagoric smoke.Just a name suggestion: nightmare.', '2005-07-08 22:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520066, 199039, 19982, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8, Like the angle of the snail across the image.  For a higher score, I tend to prefer looking forward into a subject rather than down on top of it.<br/> <br/>Technical: 6, Snail is mostly in focus, but part of it almost looks like motion blur (snail moving too fast?!?  &lt;g&gt;),  You could have applied a little gaussian blur to the green surface or cloned out the spots.<br/> <br/>Appeal: 6, I like the colors<br/> <br/>Challenge: 7, Nice close-up ... almost macro.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 7, NIce</td>', 'Composition: 8, Like the angle of the snail across the image.  For a higher score, I tend to prefer looking forward into a subject rather than down on top of it. Technical: 6, Snail is mostly in focus, but part of it almost looks like motion blur (snail moving too fast?!?  <g>),  You could have applied a little gaussian blur to the green surface or cloned out the spots. Appeal: 6, I like the colors Challenge: 7, Nice close-up ... almost macro. Overall Calculated Average Score: 7, NIce', '2005-07-08 22:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520074, 199540, 19982, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6, Centered subject isn''t too appealing, but at least you tilted it and gave it a little energy.<br/> <br/>Technical: 4, Can''t tell if the bug is supposed to really be a part of the picture or not.  Doesn''t seem to be as sharp as it could have been.<br/> <br/>Appeal: 4, Colors are so-so.  But what this really lacks is a strong subject.  The plant is so large, yet difficult to focus on, that it doesn''t seem to be the "focal point" of the image.  And yet, if it isn''t ... then what is?  The bug only confuses the matter because if it was the focal point, then it should have been more in focus.<br/> <br/>Challenge: 5, Decent close-up<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 5, Middle-of-the-road (not bad, but as good as it could be either)</td>', 'Composition: 6, Centered subject isn''t too appealing, but at least you tilted it and gave it a little energy. Technical: 4, Can''t tell if the bug is supposed to really be a part of the picture or not.  Doesn''t seem to be as sharp as it could have been. Appeal: 4, Colors are so-so.  But what this really lacks is a strong subject.  The plant is so large, yet difficult to focus on, that it doesn''t seem to be the "focal point" of the image.  And yet, if it isn''t ... then what is?  The bug only confuses the matter because if it was the focal point, then it should have been more in focus. Challenge: 5, Decent close-up Overall Calculated Average Score: 5, Middle-of-the-road (not bad, but as good as it could be either)', '2005-07-08 22:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520089, 197624, 19982, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8, I like the boldness in moving the subject all the way to one side and leaving the rest of the image in negative space.<br/> <br/>Technical: 6, Nice sharp subject.  Good lighting and exposure.<br/> <br/>Appeal: 7, I like the colors, both of the cherry and the background.<br/> <br/>Challenge: 4, It''s a nice close-up ... but if I were to simply stumble upon this image in a gallery, I wouldn''t categorize it as a macro and probably wouldn''t think to call it a close-up.  So I''m going for slightly less than middle of the road 4 here.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 6, This is a really nice image and one that I would like more outside of the challenge.  Basically, I just wish it were a stronger competitor as far as the challenge is concerned.</td>', 'Composition: 8, I like the boldness in moving the subject all the way to one side and leaving the rest of the image in negative space. Technical: 6, Nice sharp subject.  Good lighting and exposure. Appeal: 7, I like the colors, both of the cherry and the background. Challenge: 4, It''s a nice close-up ... but if I were to simply stumble upon this image in a gallery, I wouldn''t categorize it as a macro and probably wouldn''t think to call it a close-up.  So I''m going for slightly less than middle of the road 4 here. Overall Calculated Average Score: 6, This is a really nice image and one that I would like more outside of the challenge.  Basically, I just wish it were a stronger competitor as far as the challenge is concerned.', '2005-07-08 22:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520191, 199164, 27421, '<td valign="top">Needs more depth of field.... 5.</td>', 'Needs more depth of field.... 5.', '2005-07-08 23:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520193, 196770, 27421, '<td valign="top">Slightly over saturated appearance....5.</td>', 'Slightly over saturated appearance....5.', '2005-07-08 23:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520214, 197030, 19982, '<td valign="top">Composition: 7, Nice angled curve<br/> <br/>Technical: 6, Sharp where it counts while showing shallow DOF<br/> <br/>Appeal: 3, For me, it''s just too "dark" overall (which may be very appealing to some, but for me, a happy person who likes bright colors, it doesn''t work well).<br/> <br/>Challenge: 5, Hard to put the size into context ... what are we really looking at?  Is it something small and really close up?  Or something larger?  In other words, I think it needs something to help give the image context.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 5, Not really a bad pic, and technically okay, just not one that appeals to me.</td>', 'Composition: 7, Nice angled curve Technical: 6, Sharp where it counts while showing shallow DOF Appeal: 3, For me, it''s just too "dark" overall (which may be very appealing to some, but for me, a happy person who likes bright colors, it doesn''t work well). Challenge: 5, Hard to put the size into context ... what are we really looking at?  Is it something small and really close up?  Or something larger?  In other words, I think it needs something to help give the image context. Overall Calculated Average Score: 5, Not really a bad pic, and technically okay, just not one that appeals to me.', '2005-07-08 23:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520224, 199397, 19982, '<td valign="top">Composition: 3, Too static (straight up and down).  Next time try an angle to give it more energy.<br/> <br/>Technical: 6, Nice and sharp in the middle, shows (good) shallow DOF.<br/> <br/>Appeal: 3, Lacks a strong "subject" (a specific reason to look at the image). Throw a bug in there and ya got something!  No, but really... it needs something to focus the viewer''s attention<br/> <br/>Challenge: 5, Appears to fit the challenge, but it''s hard to tell.  It needs some kind of context to let the viewer know the size of the objects in the image.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 4, Technically not a bad image... it''s just that, beyond being "abstract", it lacks a reason for the viewer to want to spend more time looking at it.</td>', 'Composition: 3, Too static (straight up and down).  Next time try an angle to give it more energy. Technical: 6, Nice and sharp in the middle, shows (good) shallow DOF. Appeal: 3, Lacks a strong "subject" (a specific reason to look at the image). Throw a bug in there and ya got something!  No, but really... it needs something to focus the viewer''s attention Challenge: 5, Appears to fit the challenge, but it''s hard to tell.  It needs some kind of context to let the viewer know the size of the objects in the image. Overall Calculated Average Score: 4, Technically not a bad image... it''s just that, beyond being "abstract", it lacks a reason for the viewer to want to spend more time looking at it.', '2005-07-08 23:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520225, 198866, 35218, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.  Got a 10 from me for amusement value.  Exposure on teh flower could have been improved but what the heck.</td>', 'Outstanding.  Got a 10 from me for amusement value.  Exposure on teh flower could have been improved but what the heck.', '2005-07-08 23:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
