(1520789, 199403, 37851, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked more of a side profile, so I could see his eyes.  Hippos are so cute.</td>', 'I think I would have liked more of a side profile, so I could see his eyes.  Hippos are so cute.', '2005-07-09 08:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520791, 199500, 37851, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  It does seem to have a yellowish cast to it though.</td>', 'Great idea.  It does seem to have a yellowish cast to it though.', '2005-07-09 08:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520792, 198288, 37851, '<td valign="top">I think you should have included a dead one in the background.</td>', 'I think you should have included a dead one in the background.', '2005-07-09 08:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520793, 199526, 37851, '<td valign="top">A bit too much shadow.</td>', 'A bit too much shadow.', '2005-07-09 08:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520794, 199412, 37851, '<td valign="top">I know it''s a macro challange, but I do think just a very little bit more of fur would have looked better on the top and sides of the eye.</td>', 'I know it''s a macro challange, but I do think just a very little bit more of fur would have looked better on the top and sides of the eye.', '2005-07-09 08:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520795, 199317, 37851, '<td valign="top">Looks like a bunch of those "I support" bracelets.  I am glad they FINALY have a group that supports and promotes Asparagus.<br/>Great colors too.</td>', 'Looks like a bunch of those "I support" bracelets.  I am glad they FINALY have a group that supports and promotes Asparagus.Great colors too.', '2005-07-09 08:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520798, 197202, 37851, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  You almost cant tell if it is a house cat or a mountain lion.</td>', 'Beautiful.  You almost cant tell if it is a house cat or a mountain lion.', '2005-07-09 08:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520799, 198226, 37851, '<td valign="top">Look up kitty!  I can tell those eyes are beautiful.  I wish I could see it better.</td>', 'Look up kitty!  I can tell those eyes are beautiful.  I wish I could see it better.', '2005-07-09 08:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520800, 199497, 37851, '<td valign="top">He looks so furry and cuddly!</td>', 'He looks so furry and cuddly!', '2005-07-09 08:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520855, 199165, 23053, '<td valign="top">I like the dark processing here, but I am a bit odd.  Honestly, I wonder about the choice of processing since it isn''t something you would normally see in a flower shot - I mean it''s harsh, contrasty, and black&amp;white.   Certainly a bold choice.  As far as cropping goes, I think a closer cut would be nice, so as to eliminate some of the extra space on the sides.  For the most part, I do like this shot, despite my grumblings.  Good luck in the challenge and happy shooting.</td>', 'I like the dark processing here, but I am a bit odd.  Honestly, I wonder about the choice of processing since it isn''t something you would normally see in a flower shot - I mean it''s harsh, contrasty, and black&white.   Certainly a bold choice.  As far as cropping goes, I think a closer cut would be nice, so as to eliminate some of the extra space on the sides.  For the most part, I do like this shot, despite my grumblings.  Good luck in the challenge and happy shooting.', '2005-07-09 09:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520862, 199399, 34508, '<td valign="top">incredible texture.</td>', 'incredible texture.', '2005-07-09 10:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520866, 198857, 23053, '<td valign="top">Well done...I think this is the first that I have come accross where the background - always extremely out of focus in macro shots - is well suited for the subject.  It is a bit spooky due to the strong shadows on the face.</td>', 'Well done...I think this is the first that I have come accross where the background - always extremely out of focus in macro shots - is well suited for the subject.  It is a bit spooky due to the strong shadows on the face.', '2005-07-09 10:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520872, 199378, 23053, '<td valign="top">Very delicate photo...why is the feather in water?  Granted, it is a very small detail, and the way the surface of the water bends just slightly at the feather''s touch does add to the softness, so it is a good choice, I suppose.  I like you color choice and composition.  I wish that macro shots could allow a greater depth of field, as the shallow depth here leaves me wanting more.</td>', 'Very delicate photo...why is the feather in water?  Granted, it is a very small detail, and the way the surface of the water bends just slightly at the feather''s touch does add to the softness, so it is a good choice, I suppose.  I like you color choice and composition.  I wish that macro shots could allow a greater depth of field, as the shallow depth here leaves me wanting more.', '2005-07-09 10:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520882, 199398, 23053, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject...very unique here, unless a dragonfly is holding the fork or something...even then it''s still unique.  I can''t decide whether or not I like how the shot is cropped.  All at once, I''d like to see the drop that is falling (maybe because that is a common thing to see in shots of this type) and I am glad you cut it off, since it goes against convention, making it stand out.  The shot is odd compositionally, but I can''t put my finger on why.  Good luck in the challenge - sorry I couldn''t be more clear in my comment.</td>', 'Interesting subject...very unique here, unless a dragonfly is holding the fork or something...even then it''s still unique.  I can''t decide whether or not I like how the shot is cropped.  All at once, I''d like to see the drop that is falling (maybe because that is a common thing to see in shots of this type) and I am glad you cut it off, since it goes against convention, making it stand out.  The shot is odd compositionally, but I can''t put my finger on why.  Good luck in the challenge - sorry I couldn''t be more clear in my comment.', '2005-07-09 10:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520890, 199039, 23053, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the focus here on the shell rather than the snail''s flesh.  Granted, the snail''s flesh is interesting and highly textured, but the shell here is fascinating, looking like an old piece of furniture with an inlaid top and a shellac finish.  Good composition and color, though.</td>', 'I would like to see the focus here on the shell rather than the snail''s flesh.  Granted, the snail''s flesh is interesting and highly textured, but the shell here is fascinating, looking like an old piece of furniture with an inlaid top and a shellac finish.  Good composition and color, though.', '2005-07-09 10:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520898, 199410, 23053, '<td valign="top">Remind me never to borrow your camera...ever.  A lot of talk is made here about shots that do well and shots that don''t.  You know this won''t do well based soley on the subject alone.  I mean, come on, Americans hate soccer - plain and simple.</td>', 'Remind me never to borrow your camera...ever.  A lot of talk is made here about shots that do well and shots that don''t.  You know this won''t do well based soley on the subject alone.  I mean, come on, Americans hate soccer - plain and simple.', '2005-07-09 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520902, 199514, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is technically well executed, but that is it.  I am honestly suprised that this wasn''t DQ''d due to the literal representation clause...but I''m not a fan of that clause anyway.  In the future, utilizing your obvious skill in the technical aspect of photography while employing a more artistic aproach should yield you better results.</td>', 'This is technically well executed, but that is it.  I am honestly suprised that this wasn''t DQ''d due to the literal representation clause...but I''m not a fan of that clause anyway.  In the future, utilizing your obvious skill in the technical aspect of photography while employing a more artistic aproach should yield you better results.', '2005-07-09 10:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520938, 199502, 39336, '<td valign="top">Is this from a bill? Very "out of the macro" box! I like it!</td>', 'Is this from a bill? Very "out of the macro" box! I like it!', '2005-07-09 10:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520940, 199523, 39336, '<td valign="top">Oh this is so gross! But I love the "Fish Heads, Fish Heads, Rolly Polly Fish Heads...Fish Head, Fish Heads, Eat them Up....YUMMMM! Wow, I havent'' heard that song for YEARS!!</td>', 'Oh this is so gross! But I love the "Fish Heads, Fish Heads, Rolly Polly Fish Heads...Fish Head, Fish Heads, Eat them Up....YUMMMM! Wow, I havent'' heard that song for YEARS!!', '2005-07-09 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520948, 198962, 23053, '<td valign="top">This is an astonishing shot that should place highly.  Now I''m off to vote on 1) bugs  2) flowers  3) who knows?<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.  I think you''ll do just fine.</td>', 'This is an astonishing shot that should place highly.  Now I''m off to vote on 1) bugs  2) flowers  3) who knows? Good luck in the challenge.  I think you''ll do just fine.', '2005-07-09 11:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520958, 198803, 39663, '<td valign="top">spectacular, just simply posteresc</td>', 'spectacular, just simply posteresc', '2005-07-09 11:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520961, 199354, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great overall detail...looks like it is wearing a welders mask! Like the composition and colors too!</td>', 'Great overall detail...looks like it is wearing a welders mask! Like the composition and colors too!', '2005-07-09 11:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520966, 199078, 8891, '<td valign="top">Lilies are a bear to shoot, at least for me. They are some beautiful flowers but it is hard to get a really great angle and see the whole flower . You''ve about done that here and like that your focus was good enough so that the the most front petal is entirely clear and sharp. Like the shadow too. My only nit is that the crop is a bit too tight at the top and loses part of one stamen or pistil or whatever that thing is that has the dark pollen on that stains your clothes. Well done otherwise.</td>', 'Lilies are a bear to shoot, at least for me. They are some beautiful flowers but it is hard to get a really great angle and see the whole flower . You''ve about done that here and like that your focus was good enough so that the the most front petal is entirely clear and sharp. Like the shadow too. My only nit is that the crop is a bit too tight at the top and loses part of one stamen or pistil or whatever that thing is that has the dark pollen on that stains your clothes. Well done otherwise.', '2005-07-09 11:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520967, 199074, 35947, '<td valign="top">Hahaha!  Great shot!</td>', 'Hahaha!  Great shot!', '2005-07-09 11:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520971, 198806, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great abstract with excellent detail.  Like the colors and the lighting as well. Now I know it is probably not, but it looks upside down to me. The I think the if this was rotated 180 degrees that you may have a stronger image. THe areas that are not as focused would be at the bottome and I think even the diagonal pattern would stand out more. Great idea for the challenge and a very fine shot.</td>', 'Great abstract with excellent detail.  Like the colors and the lighting as well. Now I know it is probably not, but it looks upside down to me. The I think the if this was rotated 180 degrees that you may have a stronger image. THe areas that are not as focused would be at the bottome and I think even the diagonal pattern would stand out more. Great idea for the challenge and a very fine shot.', '2005-07-09 11:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520975, 198480, 34659, '<td valign="top">Fantastic clarity and magnificent colors!  I''m amazed at the DOF over the entire damselfly.  Beautiful shot!  9  Bumping up to 10.  Incredible DOF!</td>', 'Fantastic clarity and magnificent colors!  I''m amazed at the DOF over the entire damselfly.  Beautiful shot!  9  Bumping up to 10.  Incredible DOF!', '2005-07-09 11:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520976, 199170, 34659, '<td valign="top">Would love to know how you accomplished this shot...  VERY cool image and amazing DOF in the foreground.  9</td>', 'Would love to know how you accomplished this shot...  VERY cool image and amazing DOF in the foreground.  9', '2005-07-09 11:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520978, 198798, 8891, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool stuff, Like those great HUGE lashes and their detail. I think the square crop does not enhance what it is you might want me to see in this. My eye has a bit of problem getting past the area on the right....it gets there eventually, but not immediately because of it. It may have been unavoidable in shooting due to the movement of your subject, but it could have been lessened by a strong crop in from the right.</td>', 'Pretty cool stuff, Like those great HUGE lashes and their detail. I think the square crop does not enhance what it is you might want me to see in this. My eye has a bit of problem getting past the area on the right....it gets there eventually, but not immediately because of it. It may have been unavoidable in shooting due to the movement of your subject, but it could have been lessened by a strong crop in from the right.', '2005-07-09 11:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520981, 198656, 8891, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, and cool duotone used. Liked the detail and the flow about the rebounded drop. ALso like that second bubble by the cone of the first.  Very nice indeed.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, and cool duotone used. Liked the detail and the flow about the rebounded drop. ALso like that second bubble by the cone of the first.  Very nice indeed.', '2005-07-09 11:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520982, 198557, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot and in any other challenge this would have been right up there at the top, but the competition is fierce, so I''m being a little more picky than I normally would.  I think the DOF is good, but could be better at the tail.  I like the movement of the wings.  Also there are a couple of hot spots on the fly that detract from it''s color and definition.  All in all, a really great capture (and like I said, would have scored a 9 from me with less competition).  7</td>', 'Really nice shot and in any other challenge this would have been right up there at the top, but the competition is fierce, so I''m being a little more picky than I normally would.  I think the DOF is good, but could be better at the tail.  I like the movement of the wings.  Also there are a couple of hot spots on the fly that detract from it''s color and definition.  All in all, a really great capture (and like I said, would have scored a 9 from me with less competition).  7', '2005-07-09 11:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520987, 198926, 34659, '<td valign="top">Good DOF and I like the composition.  The lighting is harsh making the highlights a bit blown out, causing a loss of color and definition.  Also, while this is a beautiful shot, I''m not sure I''d consider it a macro because I know that these particular shells get to be very large.  Still a nice capture and I have to give the benefit of the doubt on the macro thing.  6</td>', 'Good DOF and I like the composition.  The lighting is harsh making the highlights a bit blown out, causing a loss of color and definition.  Also, while this is a beautiful shot, I''m not sure I''d consider it a macro because I know that these particular shells get to be very large.  Still a nice capture and I have to give the benefit of the doubt on the macro thing.  6', '2005-07-09 11:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1520991, 199533, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, but there''s some stiff competition in this challenge.  Your DOF, while pretty good, doesn''t really stand out when compared to some of the other entries.  More particularly on the wire, end of tail, head and legs of fly.  I like the blurred background and overall composition, but the lighting is a little harsh causing some hot spots on the wire and fly.  Still, a very nice shot.  6</td>', 'Nice capture, but there''s some stiff competition in this challenge.  Your DOF, while pretty good, doesn''t really stand out when compared to some of the other entries.  More particularly on the wire, end of tail, head and legs of fly.  I like the blurred background and overall composition, but the lighting is a little harsh causing some hot spots on the wire and fly.  Still, a very nice shot.  6', '2005-07-09 11:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521071, 199048, 31133, '<td valign="top">this is very pretty. Nice to see a unique entry. The red backdrop is a good color and appropriate complement to the cinamon swirl texture.</td>', 'this is very pretty. Nice to see a unique entry. The red backdrop is a good color and appropriate complement to the cinamon swirl texture.', '2005-07-09 12:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521072, 199497, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture! This is a 10, 10, 10 from me.</td>', 'Beautiful capture! This is a 10, 10, 10 from me.', '2005-07-09 13:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521075, 197937, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a capture! I''ve never seen anything like this before. Unfortunately, the texture and the color of the sand fight with my attention on the subject.</td>', 'What a capture! I''ve never seen anything like this before. Unfortunately, the texture and the color of the sand fight with my attention on the subject.', '2005-07-09 13:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521078, 199403, 11895, '<td valign="top">this is a nice picture but it''s hardly a macro</td>', 'this is a nice picture but it''s hardly a macro', '2005-07-09 13:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521079, 198935, 31133, '<td valign="top">haha this is a fun entry! I love the way his lips look, either preparing for attack on the cheese stick or just finishing an attack :-) For me, even  though I know it''s nearly impossible to avoid, I''d prefer if his nostrils were a little less in my face ... maybe some healing brush or something would help. he has beautiful eyes, by the way! Thanks for giving me such an enjoyable entry to view.</td>', 'haha this is a fun entry! I love the way his lips look, either preparing for attack on the cheese stick or just finishing an attack :-) For me, even  though I know it''s nearly impossible to avoid, I''d prefer if his nostrils were a little less in my face ... maybe some healing brush or something would help. he has beautiful eyes, by the way! Thanks for giving me such an enjoyable entry to view.', '2005-07-09 13:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521080, 198228, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice job with good colors and textures.</td>', 'Nice job with good colors and textures.', '2005-07-09 13:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521082, 199472, 11895, '<td valign="top">very over-exposed, I guess you will say that it was intentional for artistic purposes but it just doesn''t do any thing for me, you have lost too much detail</td>', 'very over-exposed, I guess you will say that it was intentional for artistic purposes but it just doesn''t do any thing for me, you have lost too much detail', '2005-07-09 13:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
