(1521436, 199048, 33947, '<td valign="top">Very fun idea and perspective, and nicely executed. Good, rich color. SHARP.</td>', 'Very fun idea and perspective, and nicely executed. Good, rich color. SHARP.', '2005-07-09 16:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521437, 198270, 33947, '<td valign="top">Great precision shot. Excellent depth of field. Beautifl highlights. 7</td>', 'Great precision shot. Excellent depth of field. Beautifl highlights. 7', '2005-07-09 16:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521440, 198481, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit. Appealing. I want some! 6</td>', 'Nicely lit. Appealing. I want some! 6', '2005-07-09 16:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521444, 199652, 33947, '<td valign="top">Good line and lighting. Nice simple, uncluttered composition. I like it. Bumping. 7</td>', 'Good line and lighting. Nice simple, uncluttered composition. I like it. Bumping. 7', '2005-07-09 16:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521447, 199317, 33947, '<td valign="top">Creative and fun idea. I wish it had been sharper...I wanted to give you more points. 5</td>', 'Creative and fun idea. I wish it had been sharper...I wanted to give you more points. 5', '2005-07-09 16:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521475, 199523, 19177, '<td valign="top">This is not a macro. It has real bright sun spots.<br/>The subject is kinda gross.</td>', 'This is not a macro. It has real bright sun spots.The subject is kinda gross.', '2005-07-09 16:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521514, 199036, 19982, '<td valign="top">Composition: 4, I like that the dragonfly is at an angle, and the two lines also help to add energy to the shot.  He''s also slightly off center (which is better than if he had been dead center).  My main "nit" on composition of bugs, animals, etc, is when the animal is facing away from you... appearing as if to "flee" from the camera.  For me, the composition would be so much stronger if the dragonfly were facing towards the camera instead of away.<br/> <br/>Technical: 7, The center of the dragonfly and its wings look tack sharp.  Kudos.  I''d like to have seen that sharpness on his eyes (if he were facing towards the camera).  Also, good use of shallow DOF.<br/> <br/>Appeal: 4, I like the colors and the various shades.  Improving the composition would have added to the appeal of the image. <br/> <br/>Challenge: 6, It''s a nice close-up.  A little closer still (really zooming in on the dragonfly) could make an extra powerful macro shot.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 5, It''s a nice shot and technically works well.  Only the composition keeps it from scoring higher...</td>', 'Composition: 4, I like that the dragonfly is at an angle, and the two lines also help to add energy to the shot.  He''s also slightly off center (which is better than if he had been dead center).  My main "nit" on composition of bugs, animals, etc, is when the animal is facing away from you... appearing as if to "flee" from the camera.  For me, the composition would be so much stronger if the dragonfly were facing towards the camera instead of away. Technical: 7, The center of the dragonfly and its wings look tack sharp.  Kudos.  I''d like to have seen that sharpness on his eyes (if he were facing towards the camera).  Also, good use of shallow DOF. Appeal: 4, I like the colors and the various shades.  Improving the composition would have added to the appeal of the image.  Challenge: 6, It''s a nice close-up.  A little closer still (really zooming in on the dragonfly) could make an extra powerful macro shot. Overall Calculated Average Score: 5, It''s a nice shot and technically works well.  Only the composition keeps it from scoring higher...', '2005-07-09 17:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521522, 198278, 19982, '<td valign="top">Composition: 6, I like the angle<br/> <br/>Technical: 7, Good use of DOF, and tack sharp in the middle.<br/> <br/>Appeal: 3, I keep asking myself... why don''t I like this picture. I dunno, maybe it''s just me.  A picture of a printed word just doesn''t turn me on...<br/> <br/>Challenge: 5, Good close-up, probably almost macro shot.<br/> <br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 5, Everything is fine about this image.  I just can''t bring myself to say I like it enough to vote higher.  You obviously have the skills and equipment to get a good macro shot, so maybe you were just having fun with this one.  I look forward to seeing more captivating macros from you in the future!</td>', 'Composition: 6, I like the angle Technical: 7, Good use of DOF, and tack sharp in the middle. Appeal: 3, I keep asking myself... why don''t I like this picture. I dunno, maybe it''s just me.  A picture of a printed word just doesn''t turn me on... Challenge: 5, Good close-up, probably almost macro shot. Overall Calculated Average Score: 5, Everything is fine about this image.  I just can''t bring myself to say I like it enough to vote higher.  You obviously have the skills and equipment to get a good macro shot, so maybe you were just having fun with this one.  I look forward to seeing more captivating macros from you in the future!', '2005-07-09 17:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521637, 197333, 30454, '<td valign="top">This is the best BUG shot I have seen for this challange. 10</td>', 'This is the best BUG shot I have seen for this challange. 10', '2005-07-09 18:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521639, 198803, 30454, '<td valign="top">What a great idea!!! Very nice...10</td>', 'What a great idea!!! Very nice...10', '2005-07-09 18:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521640, 197893, 30454, '<td valign="top">I lilke flower shots. I like the colors and lighting here. Simply great shot...10</td>', 'I lilke flower shots. I like the colors and lighting here. Simply great shot...10', '2005-07-09 18:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521641, 199492, 30454, '<td valign="top">Excellent details....10</td>', 'Excellent details....10', '2005-07-09 18:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
