(1521663, 198376, 25678, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and clarity (especially on it''s wings).  I''m not a huge fan of the tight cropping though.  A bit more of the dragonfly and/or flowers would open the pciture a bit more.  Of course, that''s just an opinion as cropping is subjective to personal taste.</td>', 'Nice picture and clarity (especially on it''s wings).  I''m not a huge fan of the tight cropping though.  A bit more of the dragonfly and/or flowers would open the pciture a bit more.  Of course, that''s just an opinion as cropping is subjective to personal taste.', '2005-07-09 18:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
