(1521677, 196987, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wish I could figure out what that is... ..a punk? Interesting anyway. Good job on the photo qualities also.</td>', 'Wish I could figure out what that is... ..a punk? Interesting anyway. Good job on the photo qualities also.', '2005-07-09 18:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
