(1521692, 199656, 7628, '<td valign="top">Quite some detail here.  And the sacrifice - that is a lot of blood!  I''m not sure that the space on the left does anything for the composition.  With the camera at a slightly lower angle you could get the mosquito against the green which might be a better contrast.</td>', 'Quite some detail here.  And the sacrifice - that is a lot of blood!  I''m not sure that the space on the left does anything for the composition.  With the camera at a slightly lower angle you could get the mosquito against the green which might be a better contrast.', '2005-07-09 18:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521696, 197648, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the gold and red colors and the sparkling quality.  Cropping in more, and perhaps off center would give more attention to the droplet and create a more interesting composition.</td>', 'I like the gold and red colors and the sparkling quality.  Cropping in more, and perhaps off center would give more attention to the droplet and create a more interesting composition.', '2005-07-09 18:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521698, 199515, 7628, '<td valign="top">The yellow has a lovely glowing quality -really pops from the pink.  A less balanced crop might create a more compelling composition.</td>', 'The yellow has a lovely glowing quality -really pops from the pink.  A less balanced crop might create a more compelling composition.', '2005-07-09 18:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521703, 199310, 7628, '<td valign="top">Pretty purple veins on these flowers.  It is hard to tell what is the central point of interest in this - there is no place that is entirely sharp, or highlighted by light.  I''d suggest picking one flower and make that a central point of interest by usual a narrow depth of focus or the difference between sunlight and shadow.</td>', 'Pretty purple veins on these flowers.  It is hard to tell what is the central point of interest in this - there is no place that is entirely sharp, or highlighted by light.  I''d suggest picking one flower and make that a central point of interest by usual a narrow depth of focus or the difference between sunlight and shadow.', '2005-07-09 18:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521707, 199422, 7628, '<td valign="top">A very interesting bug - good camouflage.  I like the composition - the diagonal, the large amount of blue - the placement of the subject between the detailed daisy and the plain blue.  I wish the subject was sharper and a bit more distinct from the daisy - perhaps you could make the yellow of the daisy a bit more orange and the bug a bit more green?</td>', 'A very interesting bug - good camouflage.  I like the composition - the diagonal, the large amount of blue - the placement of the subject between the detailed daisy and the plain blue.  I wish the subject was sharper and a bit more distinct from the daisy - perhaps you could make the yellow of the daisy a bit more orange and the bug a bit more green?', '2005-07-09 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521710, 199158, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - I like how the stamen lead your eye diagonally down the photo.  A bit grainy especially in the background.<br/></td>', 'Nice composition - I like how the stamen lead your eye diagonally down the photo.  A bit grainy especially in the background.', '2005-07-09 18:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521712, 199497, 7628, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail, great color, well chosen composition that contrasts well with the subject and provides meanignful context.  I only wish the top of the wings weren''t cut off by the frame.  Seems a tiny bit soft on focus. Those antennae are increadible! 8</td>', 'Excellent detail, great color, well chosen composition that contrasts well with the subject and provides meanignful context.  I only wish the top of the wings weren''t cut off by the frame.  Seems a tiny bit soft on focus. Those antennae are increadible! 8', '2005-07-09 18:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521718, 199590, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - like a planet in space - works well with your title.  Would be nicer with a fresher specimen (the bruise on the strawberry is distracting.  Also I''ddarken the background more - even get rid of the line at the bottom.  I like the way the leaves curl up and catch the light on the right hand side.</td>', 'Nice lighting - like a planet in space - works well with your title.  Would be nicer with a fresher specimen (the bruise on the strawberry is distracting.  Also I''ddarken the background more - even get rid of the line at the bottom.  I like the way the leaves curl up and catch the light on the right hand side.', '2005-07-09 18:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521719, 199583, 7628, '<td valign="top">Very fresh and simple.  Wish you''d chosen a narrower depth of focusso the background leaves were even blurrier.  I''d clone out that twig on the right too.</td>', 'Very fresh and simple.  Wish you''d chosen a narrower depth of focusso the background leaves were even blurrier.  I''d clone out that twig on the right too.', '2005-07-09 18:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521726, 197391, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and interesting subject.  Light is a bit bright (details are burned out) on some keys. Wish everything was sharp - or you''d chosen a differnet angle and a narrow DOF and purposely had a progression of focus to out of focus.</td>', 'Nice composition and interesting subject.  Light is a bit bright (details are burned out) on some keys. Wish everything was sharp - or you''d chosen a differnet angle and a narrow DOF and purposely had a progression of focus to out of focus.', '2005-07-09 18:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521730, 199269, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the white and black division of the background.  It is a nice composition.  Wish the light on the dandelion was graduated more do the top of the flower seems significantly darker than the background and the lower half significantly brighter that the background.  Perhaps a bit more contrast in post-processing?  Maybe a bit larger DOF would bring the whole dandelion head into focus - creating more sharp details to contast with the background.</td>', 'I like the white and black division of the background.  It is a nice composition.  Wish the light on the dandelion was graduated more do the top of the flower seems significantly darker than the background and the lower half significantly brighter that the background.  Perhaps a bit more contrast in post-processing?  Maybe a bit larger DOF would bring the whole dandelion head into focus - creating more sharp details to contast with the background.', '2005-07-09 18:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521732, 199039, 7628, '<td valign="top">A great composition with the snail curving out of the top left corner.  I like the colors.  Wish is were in better focus.</td>', 'A great composition with the snail curving out of the top left corner.  I like the colors.  Wish is were in better focus.', '2005-07-09 18:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521737, 198503, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color - subtle and effective.  The color helps to concentrate interest at the narrow point of sharp focus in the photo.  Good composition and details</td>', 'Nice use of color - subtle and effective.  The color helps to concentrate interest at the narrow point of sharp focus in the photo.  Good composition and details', '2005-07-09 18:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521746, 198103, 7628, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition here - that wheel filling the bottom right corner and the diagonal of the rest of the machine. The simplicity of the colors is nice -the yellow against the blue is very effective.  I''m sure you''ll get plenty of comments that this isn''t a macro except in the reasoning that it isn''t micro.  It is good work nonetheless!</td>', 'I really like the composition here - that wheel filling the bottom right corner and the diagonal of the rest of the machine. The simplicity of the colors is nice -the yellow against the blue is very effective.  I''m sure you''ll get plenty of comments that this isn''t a macro except in the reasoning that it isn''t micro.  It is good work nonetheless!', '2005-07-09 18:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521748, 199279, 7628, '<td valign="top">lovely to look at - simple and clear and very revealing of details we don''t normally see.  8</td>', 'lovely to look at - simple and clear and very revealing of details we don''t normally see.  8', '2005-07-09 18:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521751, 199354, 7628, '<td valign="top">VERY sharp - nice colors, clean composition. 8</td>', 'VERY sharp - nice colors, clean composition. 8', '2005-07-09 18:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1521761, 198358, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice details - good use of DOF to highlight certain details.  I think a darker background would work better.  The head is nicely framed, well composed. 7</td>', 'Nice details - good use of DOF to highlight certain details.  I think a darker background would work better.  The head is nicely framed, well composed. 7', '2005-07-09 19:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
