(1522147, 197894, 19311, '<td valign="top">Man that bad boy jumps right off the screen at ya.  Sitting on top of an i-pod?  Not sure I get that but the shot is great.  (just got the title, now I get it :)  Cool 9</td>', 'Man that bad boy jumps right off the screen at ya.  Sitting on top of an i-pod?  Not sure I get that but the shot is great.  (just got the title, now I get it :)  Cool 9', '2005-07-09 23:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
