(1522978, 198284, 8891, '<td valign="top">The angle on this is very good compositionally though I think that it might have been cropped a bit less tight to see more of the tube on the right and less of the grate at top which not as interesting. That said I like the reflection of the grate on the top of the tubes very much. Different and good overall.</td>', 'The angle on this is very good compositionally though I think that it might have been cropped a bit less tight to see more of the tube on the right and less of the grate at top which not as interesting. That said I like the reflection of the grate on the top of the tubes very much. Different and good overall.', '2005-07-10 10:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522980, 199667, 8891, '<td valign="top">Really close...nice composition and the colors are fine. you got a bit of shadow on the lower third but when your are this close, I do not know how you might have avoided it. Excellent detail.</td>', 'Really close...nice composition and the colors are fine. you got a bit of shadow on the lower third but when your are this close, I do not know how you might have avoided it. Excellent detail.', '2005-07-10 10:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522991, 199472, 8891, '<td valign="top">The detail on the subject is quite fine...I am not sure what the center of the flower adds to this though it does provide a base for the petal from which the subject is hanging. The  straight horizontal composition is bit stagnant (sic) and you might have tried more of a CW angle so that the subject was more towards the lower right third. Very good exposure.</td>', 'The detail on the subject is quite fine...I am not sure what the center of the flower adds to this though it does provide a base for the petal from which the subject is hanging. The  straight horizontal composition is bit stagnant (sic) and you might have tried more of a CW angle so that the subject was more towards the lower right third. Very good exposure.', '2005-07-10 10:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522996, 196767, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great detail on this and I like the colors and textures, you can see the inconsistency of the make up of the wing that  you would not see this close. That said I thnk you might have gotten too close and showing  a bit more of the pattern might have made a more colorful and inviting image as this looks a bit clinical as is. But I let the detail factor override some of that.</td>', 'Great detail on this and I like the colors and textures, you can see the inconsistency of the make up of the wing that  you would not see this close. That said I thnk you might have gotten too close and showing  a bit more of the pattern might have made a more colorful and inviting image as this looks a bit clinical as is. But I let the detail factor override some of that.', '2005-07-10 10:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1522997, 198815, 8891, '<td valign="top">Think this is more of a stil life than a macro. It is a very good still life and I love the tones that you chose, the composition and the challenge to your exposure was handled well in this.</td>', 'Think this is more of a stil life than a macro. It is a very good still life and I love the tones that you chose, the composition and the challenge to your exposure was handled well in this.', '2005-07-10 10:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523003, 197202, 21711, '<td valign="top">great shot, almost looks like one of my cats. i like the composition but i think this would get higher scores if the focus point was on the eye. - 7</td>', 'great shot, almost looks like one of my cats. i like the composition but i think this would get higher scores if the focus point was on the eye. - 7', '2005-07-10 10:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523006, 196968, 8891, '<td valign="top">Super detail on the subject and especially on the web. The compostion is fine vertically but horizontally it is a bit too centered. The framing of the bacground is nice and I think losing some of it on the right and cropping in from there a bit would improve the compostion. Regardless the exposure and detail are great and the composition is more of a nit than anything major.</td>', 'Super detail on the subject and especially on the web. The compostion is fine vertically but horizontally it is a bit too centered. The framing of the bacground is nice and I think losing some of it on the right and cropping in from there a bit would improve the compostion. Regardless the exposure and detail are great and the composition is more of a nit than anything major.', '2005-07-10 10:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523010, 198525, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very cool reflections captured in the stop action of the flow of the water. Like the abstraction of it very much. The detail on the spiket is good too...I sort of wishing it was on an angle for the sake of the composition but that might have effect the great reflections you got. Cool shot!</td>', 'Very cool reflections captured in the stop action of the flow of the water. Like the abstraction of it very much. The detail on the spiket is good too...I sort of wishing it was on an angle for the sake of the composition but that might have effect the great reflections you got. Cool shot!', '2005-07-10 10:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
