(1523058, 199291, 21711, '<td valign="top">this photo is one of my favorites in the challenge. the colors are perfect, the blueberries are tack sharp and the detail on them is quite nice. great DOF as well. the surface they are on is also interesting. im not sure what im seeing on the blueberry to the right, i see like a few black pixels, maybe dust?  Score: 10   +favorites</td>', 'this photo is one of my favorites in the challenge. the colors are perfect, the blueberries are tack sharp and the detail on them is quite nice. great DOF as well. the surface they are on is also interesting. im not sure what im seeing on the blueberry to the right, i see like a few black pixels, maybe dust?  Score: 10   +favorites', '2005-07-10 11:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523063, 199422, 8891, '<td valign="top">A most curious and interesting looking insect. It resembles sort of a minature flying dragon and looks almost like a toy.  Whatever is it? Some of that comes from the focus being off on the under side of it towards the legs, but it does make my wonder and I have been drawn to it each time I have seen it this week.</td>', 'A most curious and interesting looking insect. It resembles sort of a minature flying dragon and looks almost like a toy.  Whatever is it? Some of that comes from the focus being off on the under side of it towards the legs, but it does make my wonder and I have been drawn to it each time I have seen it this week.', '2005-07-10 11:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523069, 198481, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting in this, especially the lit edges of the fork behind the pasta. Nice composition and really intersesting and unusal for a macro.  (I was tempted to say either ''Where''s the bug?'' or ''Ats-a-nice'' but I couldn''t just leave at that....good luck!)</td>', 'Like the lighting in this, especially the lit edges of the fork behind the pasta. Nice composition and really intersesting and unusal for a macro.  (I was tempted to say either ''Where''s the bug?'' or ''Ats-a-nice'' but I couldn''t just leave at that....good luck!)', '2005-07-10 11:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523074, 198332, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like the detail, perspective and composition of this very much. I am not a real fan of selective focus but in macro it is something you have to deal with so it is fine in this. Just a little brighter and a bit more saturation for a suggested improvement but very good as is.</td>', 'I like the detail, perspective and composition of this very much. I am not a real fan of selective focus but in macro it is something you have to deal with so it is fine in this. Just a little brighter and a bit more saturation for a suggested improvement but very good as is.', '2005-07-10 11:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523077, 199251, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great composition, colors, detail and excellent composition. A few specs of white on the almost upper most petal might have been cloned out, but other than that, very good indeed.</td>', 'Great composition, colors, detail and excellent composition. A few specs of white on the almost upper most petal might have been cloned out, but other than that, very good indeed.', '2005-07-10 11:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523081, 199539, 8891, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and DOF, great exposure and colors. I am not sure how you might feel about a tighter crop to have more emphasis on the beetles. I think your detail is good enough that you could. Very good as is.</td>', 'Nice detail and DOF, great exposure and colors. I am not sure how you might feel about a tighter crop to have more emphasis on the beetles. I think your detail is good enough that you could. Very good as is.', '2005-07-10 11:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523083, 198150, 8891, '<td valign="top">A bit too much blur for my tastes but I lke the effect it has on this image very much. Very interesting photography on what might be considered an ordinary subject. It does add a lot of interest and makes the image a fine abstract.</td>', 'A bit too much blur for my tastes but I lke the effect it has on this image very much. Very interesting photography on what might be considered an ordinary subject. It does add a lot of interest and makes the image a fine abstract.', '2005-07-10 11:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
