(1523431, 198962, 28141, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but somehow the seed(?) looks really flat.  I''m not sure if it''s the lighting or what, but something feels off.</td>', 'Nice composition, but somehow the seed(?) looks really flat.  I''m not sure if it''s the lighting or what, but something feels off.', '2005-07-10 15:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523435, 199403, 31409, '<td valign="top">Only a face a mother could love! I like how it is in focus, the lower half of the head.</td>', 'Only a face a mother could love! I like how it is in focus, the lower half of the head.', '2005-07-10 15:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523438, 198830, 28141, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this border at all.  It looks more like the site isn''t displaying the full image than a border.  It''s completely distracting and detracts from what might otherwise have been a good image.</td>', 'I don''t like this border at all.  It looks more like the site isn''t displaying the full image than a border.  It''s completely distracting and detracts from what might otherwise have been a good image.', '2005-07-10 15:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523448, 199466, 31409, '<td valign="top">Is that one of those ugly cane toads? The white shadow behind his left eye is a little distracting, but still a compelling picture.</td>', 'Is that one of those ugly cane toads? The white shadow behind his left eye is a little distracting, but still a compelling picture.', '2005-07-10 15:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523451, 198209, 31409, '<td valign="top">Pretty colours and I like the effect of the fine ''hairs'' around the edges of the petals.</td>', 'Pretty colours and I like the effect of the fine ''hairs'' around the edges of the petals.', '2005-07-10 15:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523453, 199170, 28141, '<td valign="top">I find the border somewhat distracting, but otherwise I like this shot a lot.</td>', 'I find the border somewhat distracting, but otherwise I like this shot a lot.', '2005-07-10 15:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523455, 198816, 31409, '<td valign="top">"What big eyes you have m''dear!".  A nice change from the many flower pictures.</td>', '"What big eyes you have m''dear!".  A nice change from the many flower pictures.', '2005-07-10 15:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523464, 199036, 31409, '<td valign="top">If those two stems were not there, it would be the perfect picture, but I know you can''t remove them for the challenge. I like the effect of the black and white on the wings. The wings on the left are a little too blurred on the bottom but still an excellent shot.</td>', 'If those two stems were not there, it would be the perfect picture, but I know you can''t remove them for the challenge. I like the effect of the black and white on the wings. The wings on the left are a little too blurred on the bottom but still an excellent shot.', '2005-07-10 15:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523465, 199291, 28141, '<td valign="top">Somehow this makes the look like 2ft. tall blueberries...cool.</td>', 'Somehow this makes the look like 2ft. tall blueberries...cool.', '2005-07-10 15:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523466, 197841, 31409, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle! I like the dark background as opposed to the typical green ones.</td>', 'Interesting angle! I like the dark background as opposed to the typical green ones.', '2005-07-10 15:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523470, 198756, 36495, '<td valign="top">Nice, jsut dont like the ''frame'' of the yellow line.</td>', 'Nice, jsut dont like the ''frame'' of the yellow line.', '2005-07-10 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523538, 199328, 32767, '<td valign="top">Great lighting or effect on the paste. It''s sharp and has an electric feel.</td>', 'Great lighting or effect on the paste. It''s sharp and has an electric feel.', '2005-07-10 16:13:11.000000', NULL, 1);
