(1523856, 198048, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like the leaf here showing scale and though the composition is a bit stagnant I would think it be hard to compose and capture all this so no problem there. Love the shadow under the right fly very much, adds a lot of tinterest.....Is he waiting for a go,  I wonder? Great capture. good luck!</td>', 'I like the leaf here showing scale and though the composition is a bit stagnant I would think it be hard to compose and capture all this so no problem there. Love the shadow under the right fly very much, adds a lot of tinterest.....Is he waiting for a go,  I wonder? Great capture. good luck!', '2005-07-10 19:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523859, 199649, 8891, '<td valign="top">Like the choice of colors in this with the RGB and Primary representation. GREAT shadows and deep DOF!  This is a very striking image and I like very much.</td>', 'Like the choice of colors in this with the RGB and Primary representation. GREAT shadows and deep DOF!  This is a very striking image and I like very much.', '2005-07-10 19:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523860, 198961, 8891, '<td valign="top">Awesome detail on the bee and the foremost of the flowers and buds. Love the DOF. The bee, and you, made a very wise color choice and purple and green is one of my favorite color combos! I might be wishing the bee''s wings were both totally in focus, but that adds to the depth of this. Great shot. Good Luck!</td>', 'Awesome detail on the bee and the foremost of the flowers and buds. Love the DOF. The bee, and you, made a very wise color choice and purple and green is one of my favorite color combos! I might be wishing the bee''s wings were both totally in focus, but that adds to the depth of this. Great shot. Good Luck!', '2005-07-10 19:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523862, 199315, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like how you captured the rain in this and the composition of its diagonal downward motion. Macro wise it is fine to me because of the rain capture but I''m guessing you might be getting a lot of it is not macro. Great shot!</td>', 'I like how you captured the rain in this and the composition of its diagonal downward motion. Macro wise it is fine to me because of the rain capture but I''m guessing you might be getting a lot of it is not macro. Great shot!', '2005-07-10 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523864, 199291, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great texture contrasts on this, nice choice of background for that reason. These blues are huge and look lush and full of juice. Hope you enjoyed them later. Good luck!</td>', 'Great texture contrasts on this, nice choice of background for that reason. These blues are huge and look lush and full of juice. Hope you enjoyed them later. Good luck!', '2005-07-10 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523868, 199499, 8891, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the echinacea and bee, great detail and colors. Not sure of the bees position in this and I think there might have been more of  above the bee so he does not seem so cramped. Like that pollen build up on its leg. Did you notice any almost anesthetic effect of the flower on the bee....I saw one and it look half drunk and was just roaming about the flower very slowing. Most interesting.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the echinacea and bee, great detail and colors. Not sure of the bees position in this and I think there might have been more of  above the bee so he does not seem so cramped. Like that pollen build up on its leg. Did you notice any almost anesthetic effect of the flower on the bee....I saw one and it look half drunk and was just roaming about the flower very slowing. Most interesting.  Good luck!', '2005-07-10 19:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523869, 199315, 8860, '<td valign="top">Really lush and beautiful. This shot is tangible and gets my top marks for interesting use of shutter speed, focus and subject. This is the kind of shot I could only hope to have taken and is in sharp contrast to my own! Love it. [10]</td>', 'Really lush and beautiful. This shot is tangible and gets my top marks for interesting use of shutter speed, focus and subject. This is the kind of shot I could only hope to have taken and is in sharp contrast to my own! Love it. [10]', '2005-07-10 19:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523877, 199473, 8860, '<td valign="top">Fascinating shot - very unusual and would look great as a huge poster in a bar. Tops.</td>', 'Fascinating shot - very unusual and would look great as a huge poster in a bar. Tops.', '2005-07-10 20:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523880, 199279, 8860, '<td valign="top">Beautifully clear.</td>', 'Beautifully clear.', '2005-07-10 20:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523968, 198700, 1993, '<td valign="top">Much better than mine.  Bravo!</td>', 'Much better than mine.  Bravo!', '2005-07-10 20:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523975, 198857, 1993, '<td valign="top">I think a close crop on the flower would have made a stronger composition.  You could still have enough of the face in the shot to maintain  the imagery, I think.</td>', 'I think a close crop on the flower would have made a stronger composition.  You could still have enough of the face in the shot to maintain  the imagery, I think.', '2005-07-10 20:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523990, 199586, 31534, '<td valign="top">I really love this picture, I hope you gave details in the comments</td>', 'I really love this picture, I hope you gave details in the comments', '2005-07-10 20:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523995, 197179, 1993, '<td valign="top">just a little dark...but nice capture!</td>', 'just a little dark...but nice capture!', '2005-07-10 20:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1523998, 199441, 27161, '<td valign="top">It is hard to vote on this because I cannot tell if it is a 20 ft statue or a belt buckle.</td>', 'It is hard to vote on this because I cannot tell if it is a 20 ft statue or a belt buckle.', '2005-07-10 20:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524002, 199608, 39429, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and space.  It really creates a mood.</td>', 'Nice use of color and space.  It really creates a mood.', '2005-07-10 21:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524004, 199499, 39429, '<td valign="top">Strong sense of drama.  You really caught this bee.  DOF works well.</td>', 'Strong sense of drama.  You really caught this bee.  DOF works well.', '2005-07-10 21:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524006, 199438, 39429, '<td valign="top">Good capture of this "critter."  The weight of the compositions has more weight on the left - perhaps a change in crop would strenghten.</td>', 'Good capture of this "critter."  The weight of the compositions has more weight on the left - perhaps a change in crop would strenghten.', '2005-07-10 21:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524007, 199453, 39429, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  The long stamen adds balance to the composition, keeping it from being static.</td>', 'Beautiful.  The long stamen adds balance to the composition, keeping it from being static.', '2005-07-10 21:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524009, 199607, 39429, '<td valign="top">Fun subject.  The DOF is a bit shallow to catch all of the cutie, but the huge eyescptivate.  A change in crop might have strengthend it - perhaps more square.</td>', 'Fun subject.  The DOF is a bit shallow to catch all of the cutie, but the huge eyescptivate.  A change in crop might have strengthend it - perhaps more square.', '2005-07-10 21:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524010, 199497, 39429, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great clarity and focus.  The crop is a tad too tight for me.</td>', 'Wow!  Great clarity and focus.  The crop is a tad too tight for me.', '2005-07-10 21:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524011, 199430, 27161, '<td valign="top">Ahh, the baseball.  Always in the macro challenge and always a success.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Ahh, the baseball.  Always in the macro challenge and always a success.  Nice shot.', '2005-07-10 21:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524012, 197916, 39429, '<td valign="top">Love the backgroun and lighting.  The spide itself is less graphic.  Nice mood.</td>', 'Love the backgroun and lighting.  The spide itself is less graphic.  Nice mood.', '2005-07-10 21:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524013, 198026, 27161, '<td valign="top">A much more interesting perspective on bugs than all the others.</td>', 'A much more interesting perspective on bugs than all the others.', '2005-07-10 21:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524018, 199347, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great DOF on the fly.  The lighting is a little odd to me though - seems like maybe too much highlight?  I would probably have cropped it a little differently, to make the fly not so dead-center, but it''s still a great shot.  I think maybe the lighting thing has to do with the odd green color of the background - it doesn''t look natural.  Anyway - enough of my babbling, still a very strong entry.  7</td>', 'Great DOF on the fly.  The lighting is a little odd to me though - seems like maybe too much highlight?  I would probably have cropped it a little differently, to make the fly not so dead-center, but it''s still a great shot.  I think maybe the lighting thing has to do with the odd green color of the background - it doesn''t look natural.  Anyway - enough of my babbling, still a very strong entry.  7', '2005-07-10 21:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524023, 197846, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great DOF on the face and foreground body parts.  I''d like to see a little more DOF on some of the bee''s body parts a little further back (not all the way, just more than is currently shown).  Interesting thing he''s sitting/standing on with the paint? peeling - kinda cool.  Couple of hot spots on the head, but I''m really splitting hairs here.  It''s a very good shot.  7</td>', 'Great DOF on the face and foreground body parts.  I''d like to see a little more DOF on some of the bee''s body parts a little further back (not all the way, just more than is currently shown).  Interesting thing he''s sitting/standing on with the paint? peeling - kinda cool.  Couple of hot spots on the head, but I''m really splitting hairs here.  It''s a very good shot.  7', '2005-07-10 21:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524030, 199541, 34659, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot.  I think the lighting is a little bright, causing some hot spots.  Also, I''d like to see a little better DOF on the wings, front legs, &amp; tail.  Still, hard to count off much - it''s a very nice shot!  7</td>', 'Nicely composed shot.  I think the lighting is a little bright, causing some hot spots.  Also, I''d like to see a little better DOF on the wings, front legs, & tail.  Still, hard to count off much - it''s a very nice shot!  7', '2005-07-10 21:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524031, 198623, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cool shot and a cool bug.  I think I would have scored this higher if the bug was facing the camera more and better DOF.  I like the flower and dewdrop, but I also think there are some hot spots there - lighting a bit harsh.  Still, overall a very nice image.  Good job!  6</td>', 'Cool shot and a cool bug.  I think I would have scored this higher if the bug was facing the camera more and better DOF.  I like the flower and dewdrop, but I also think there are some hot spots there - lighting a bit harsh.  Still, overall a very nice image.  Good job!  6', '2005-07-10 21:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524035, 197647, 34659, '<td valign="top">Very unique and cool photo!  LOVE the colors and the DOF on the foremost blossoms.  The lack of DOF in the foreground is a little distracting to me, but it''s hard to count off much.  Beautiful composition and very neat subject matter.  7</td>', 'Very unique and cool photo!  LOVE the colors and the DOF on the foremost blossoms.  The lack of DOF in the foreground is a little distracting to me, but it''s hard to count off much.  Beautiful composition and very neat subject matter.  7', '2005-07-10 21:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524040, 196941, 34659, '<td valign="top">Boy, this is an unusual looking bug (a cicada perhaps?).  Nice DOF on parts of the bug, but other parts the lack of DOF is a distraction.  Nice lighting, but odd color background (doesn''t look natural).  All in all, good shot though - nice work.  6</td>', 'Boy, this is an unusual looking bug (a cicada perhaps?).  Nice DOF on parts of the bug, but other parts the lack of DOF is a distraction.  Nice lighting, but odd color background (doesn''t look natural).  All in all, good shot though - nice work.  6', '2005-07-10 21:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524045, 197970, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and amazing DOF on body.  DOF is a little off on far legs, wings, and eyes.  Highlight glare on eyes is a little distracting and bright spot in upper left, but otherwise great background.  Very nice capture.  7</td>', 'Beautiful colors and amazing DOF on body.  DOF is a little off on far legs, wings, and eyes.  Highlight glare on eyes is a little distracting and bright spot in upper left, but otherwise great background.  Very nice capture.  7', '2005-07-10 21:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524048, 198022, 37252, '<td valign="top">you need to get closer to your subject, and keep the subject in sharp focus when trying to achieve a macro, or "near-macro" photo. Try re-shooting this chain by getting in as close as your camera/lens will allow, and focus tightly on the most interesting part of the chain - perhaps where two links join together but also have contrast differences.</td>', 'you need to get closer to your subject, and keep the subject in sharp focus when trying to achieve a macro, or "near-macro" photo. Try re-shooting this chain by getting in as close as your camera/lens will allow, and focus tightly on the most interesting part of the chain - perhaps where two links join together but also have contrast differences.', '2005-07-10 21:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524049, 199337, 34659, '<td valign="top">Unique and beautiful shot.  Love the colors.  The highlights are a little blown out and the shadows a little dark (IMHO), but I like the soft warm lighting elsewhere.  Very nice composition.  DOF is not as strong as it could be - still a very nice shot.  6</td>', 'Unique and beautiful shot.  Love the colors.  The highlights are a little blown out and the shadows a little dark (IMHO), but I like the soft warm lighting elsewhere.  Very nice composition.  DOF is not as strong as it could be - still a very nice shot.  6', '2005-07-10 21:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524054, 199354, 34659, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot.  Beautiful natural colors and great composition.  (What is that stuff the bee has hanging from his mouth?)  Nice background too.  The DOF bothers me a little, but hard to take off too many points on this shot.  Great job.  7</td>', 'Really nice shot.  Beautiful natural colors and great composition.  (What is that stuff the bee has hanging from his mouth?)  Nice background too.  The DOF bothers me a little, but hard to take off too many points on this shot.  Great job.  7', '2005-07-10 21:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524055, 198448, 37252, '<td valign="top">the nightvision idea was cool. Sadly, it does nto fit macro - or even near macro as with those you need to be close enough to pick up details and should only see about 1-2 inches of the subject. Maybe had you zoomed in on just the eye, and then applied some nightvision look to it, although ou would have needed to tone it down a lot in order to see details, it would have fit the challenge more.</td>', 'the nightvision idea was cool. Sadly, it does nto fit macro - or even near macro as with those you need to be close enough to pick up details and should only see about 1-2 inches of the subject. Maybe had you zoomed in on just the eye, and then applied some nightvision look to it, although ou would have needed to tone it down a lot in order to see details, it would have fit the challenge more.', '2005-07-10 21:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524056, 199596, 34659, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite flower shots.  Beautiful colors and background.  DOF is a little off (IMHO), but really a nicely composed and executed shot.</td>', 'One of my favorite flower shots.  Beautiful colors and background.  DOF is a little off (IMHO), but really a nicely composed and executed shot.', '2005-07-10 21:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524058, 197909, 37252, '<td valign="top">creativity is present here, but very little focus is. the hair itself, being your subject should have been sharper</td>', 'creativity is present here, but very little focus is. the hair itself, being your subject should have been sharper', '2005-07-10 21:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524061, 199445, 34659, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Unique pose too.  Beautiful colors &amp; background.  Highlights on the blue areas are a little strong (IMHO), but hard not to give this one a high mark.  7</td>', 'Great shot!  Unique pose too.  Beautiful colors & background.  Highlights on the blue areas are a little strong (IMHO), but hard not to give this one a high mark.  7', '2005-07-10 21:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524063, 197801, 37252, '<td valign="top">not close enough to be considered a macor or even a near-macro. Seems a bit over-saturated also. Composition was good as you kept it within the trule of thirds.</td>', 'not close enough to be considered a macor or even a near-macro. Seems a bit over-saturated also. Composition was good as you kept it within the trule of thirds.', '2005-07-10 21:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524066, 198977, 37252, '<td valign="top">good contrast, but perhaps a little over-saturated. Subject is not interesting at all.</td>', 'good contrast, but perhaps a little over-saturated. Subject is not interesting at all.', '2005-07-10 21:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524069, 196888, 34659, '<td valign="top">Now that''s what I call ''up close and personal''!  Beautiful job - amazing DOF.  Great shot!  (Are those water droplets on his face/eyes?)  Background looks a little overprocessed, but it takes a while for your eyes to stray from the bee!  Very nice.</td>', 'Now that''s what I call ''up close and personal''!  Beautiful job - amazing DOF.  Great shot!  (Are those water droplets on his face/eyes?)  Background looks a little overprocessed, but it takes a while for your eyes to stray from the bee!  Very nice.', '2005-07-10 21:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524071, 198935, 37252, '<td valign="top">your title indicated the cheese stick to be the focus here - but your camera is focused on the eyes and nose.<br/></td>', 'your title indicated the cheese stick to be the focus here - but your camera is focused on the eyes and nose.', '2005-07-10 21:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524074, 198220, 37252, '<td valign="top">not sure what you were trying to focus on here. If it was the tiny hairs on the end of the nose above the bright area (right side) then I can see them but not close enough. If it were the inside of the nostrils, tilt the head back more.</td>', 'not sure what you were trying to focus on here. If it was the tiny hairs on the end of the nose above the bright area (right side) then I can see them but not close enough. If it were the inside of the nostrils, tilt the head back more.', '2005-07-10 21:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524076, 199314, 37252, '<td valign="top">very OOF, and backlighting does not work well for macros</td>', 'very OOF, and backlighting does not work well for macros', '2005-07-10 21:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524081, 199607, 37252, '<td valign="top">the baby is adorable - however not close enough to constitute MACRO or even near-Macro. The focus is way too soft in my opinion</td>', 'the baby is adorable - however not close enough to constitute MACRO or even near-Macro. The focus is way too soft in my opinion', '2005-07-10 21:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524083, 199317, 37252, '<td valign="top">upper corner is too bright - focus too soft</td>', 'upper corner is too bright - focus too soft', '2005-07-10 21:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524090, 198614, 37252, '<td valign="top">the subject, while plain, does make me wonder what is at the end of the rope, or what the rope is being used for. However, for a macro challenge you need to concentrate on an area of 1-2 inches - even without a true macro lens, you should be as close as you can to the subject and try for sharp detail of the most interesting part.</td>', 'the subject, while plain, does make me wonder what is at the end of the rope, or what the rope is being used for. However, for a macro challenge you need to concentrate on an area of 1-2 inches - even without a true macro lens, you should be as close as you can to the subject and try for sharp detail of the most interesting part.', '2005-07-10 21:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524148, 197333, 37252, '<td valign="top">the colors are  beautiful. I love the detail on the face - even the area between the eys where this fly looks to have been sutured together - lol<br/>Great shot     10</td>', 'the colors are  beautiful. I love the detail on the face - even the area between the eys where this fly looks to have been sutured together - lolGreat shot     10', '2005-07-10 22:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524151, 199447, 37252, '<td valign="top">what a cute little guy! Nice green and yellow tones - detail is pretty good. Too bad you could not get rid of the white specks on the eys though. Still - 10</td>', 'what a cute little guy! Nice green and yellow tones - detail is pretty good. Too bad you could not get rid of the white specks on the eys though. Still - 10', '2005-07-10 22:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524152, 198803, 37252, '<td valign="top">this is an awesome shot. Yours is one of three tens I have given out this challenge - wish I could give it an 11.</td>', 'this is an awesome shot. Yours is one of three tens I have given out this challenge - wish I could give it an 11.', '2005-07-10 22:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524154, 198113, 37252, '<td valign="top">needs the brightness on the cats face/chest toned down - perhaps by tweaking the WB on your camera. Not really a macro or near-macro as you did not zoom in to a specific feature of this feline.</td>', 'needs the brightness on the cats face/chest toned down - perhaps by tweaking the WB on your camera. Not really a macro or near-macro as you did not zoom in to a specific feature of this feline.', '2005-07-10 22:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524157, 199519, 37252, '<td valign="top">I dont find the subject very interesting - but then maybe it is only because I am not hungry at this time. I do like that you were creative and did not just shoot another bug. Nice detail to both the front end of the pork and the grill</td>', 'I dont find the subject very interesting - but then maybe it is only because I am not hungry at this time. I do like that you were creative and did not just shoot another bug. Nice detail to both the front end of the pork and the grill', '2005-07-10 22:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524165, 199612, 37252, '<td valign="top">something about the lighting seems wrong here. Not sure how you would have corrected it prior to the shot, but needs some work in editing to get rid of the glare.</td>', 'something about the lighting seems wrong here. Not sure how you would have corrected it prior to the shot, but needs some work in editing to get rid of the glare.', '2005-07-10 22:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524170, 198927, 37252, '<td valign="top">where is the focus here? If your goal was for soft focus, you did not achieve it as this simply looks blurry. Cute idea - only wish it were clearer - ansd maybe cropped in real tight to the baby''s feet.</td>', 'where is the focus here? If your goal was for soft focus, you did not achieve it as this simply looks blurry. Cute idea - only wish it were clearer - ansd maybe cropped in real tight to the baby''s feet.', '2005-07-10 22:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524173, 198278, 37252, '<td valign="top">Macro it is...just not very interesting.</td>', 'Macro it is...just not very interesting.', '2005-07-10 22:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524175, 198801, 37252, '<td valign="top">OOF on the majority of the image - not sure that having the type upside down was a good idea either</td>', 'OOF on the majority of the image - not sure that having the type upside down was a good idea either', '2005-07-10 22:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524178, 198071, 37252, '<td valign="top">the angle here is not helping to convey your message. My eye is drawn to the bright corner of the glass, not the peppers.</td>', 'the angle here is not helping to convey your message. My eye is drawn to the bright corner of the glass, not the peppers.', '2005-07-10 22:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
