(1524201, 199052, 37252, '<td valign="top">I really like snail shots - and yours is very good. The one thing I would have liked was to see a littel less empty space and more of the reflection of the snail. Shame it is cut off.  There is an area on the shell that has too much shine to it. With this being advanced editing you might have tried a little burn tool?  Giving this a 9</td>', 'I really like snail shots - and yours is very good. The one thing I would have liked was to see a littel less empty space and more of the reflection of the snail. Shame it is cut off.  There is an area on the shell that has too much shine to it. With this being advanced editing you might have tried a little burn tool?  Giving this a 9', '2005-07-10 22:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1524204, 197649, 37252, '<td valign="top">love it - now I have yiour thumb print in my database</td>', 'love it - now I have yiour thumb print in my database', '2005-07-10 22:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
