(1524726, 199036, 20375, '<td valign="top">This was taken with a 50 to 200mm zoom. The wind was blowing. The reed this guy was resting on was waving to and fro. I had to lean back and forth with it to keep it in the d.o.f. range. <br/>Considering that there was no macro equipment used, the circumstances were less than favourable...I''m delighted with the result. <br/>Had to make a lot of adjustments to pull the shot off.<br/> <br/>INCLUDING...Going back to the same place 3days in a row waiting for this guy to show up where I found he usually roosts<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-07-11 00:14:50.</i></td>', 'This was taken with a 50 to 200mm zoom. The wind was blowing. The reed this guy was resting on was waving to and fro. I had to lean back and forth with it to keep it in the d.o.f. range. Considering that there was no macro equipment used, the circumstances were less than favourable...I''m delighted with the result. Had to make a lot of adjustments to pull the shot off. INCLUDING...Going back to the same place 3days in a row waiting for this guy to show up where I found he usually roosts', '2005-07-11 01:08:17.000000', '2005-07-11 01:14:50.000000', 0),
