(1524789, 199291, 26756, '<td valign="top">I knew I should have shot a bug! Oh well, first time breaking a 7 which is great.  Thanks to all the people with no cameras that voted me a 5 lol.<br/> <br/>I got a lot of "look like pumpkins" comments so my next challenge is to take pumpkins and make them look as small as blueberries.</td>', 'I knew I should have shot a bug! Oh well, first time breaking a 7 which is great.  Thanks to all the people with no cameras that voted me a 5 lol. I got a lot of "look like pumpkins" comments so my next challenge is to take pumpkins and make them look as small as blueberries.', '2005-07-11 01:17:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524791, 199074, 11843, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 15. I gave you an 8 and only one 8 this challenge. Only one 9 and only one 10. Your details are spot on, as are your tones and light. The hot spot on the tongue is the only neg or nit pic I can see. Other than that, an AWESOME shot. Cheers....Martin</td>', 'Congrats on your top 15. I gave you an 8 and only one 8 this challenge. Only one 9 and only one 10. Your details are spot on, as are your tones and light. The hot spot on the tongue is the only neg or nit pic I can see. Other than that, an AWESOME shot. Cheers....Martin', '2005-07-11 01:18:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524796, 199289, 32767, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image Matt. I gave you a 9''er.</td>', 'Beautiful image Matt. I gave you a 9''er.', '2005-07-11 01:19:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524809, 198803, 25952, '<td valign="top">the water droplet makes this shot. nice man</td>', 'the water droplet makes this shot. nice man', '2005-07-11 01:21:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524810, 198803, 31409, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!!!</td>', 'Fantastic!!!', '2005-07-11 01:22:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524815, 199164, 11843, '<td valign="top">Superb shot! The black lines leading into this shot are perfect for drawing your attention into the softness of the center of this flower. Such a lovely color of salmon or pink. Then the details in the pistols of the flower bring you right back out and lead your eye out into the luscious blue of the flowers petals. I only gave one 8,9,10 and for you I gave a 9. Unbelievable it didn''t do better! Cheers....Martin</td>', 'Superb shot! The black lines leading into this shot are perfect for drawing your attention into the softness of the center of this flower. Such a lovely color of salmon or pink. Then the details in the pistols of the flower bring you right back out and lead your eye out into the luscious blue of the flowers petals. I only gave one 8,9,10 and for you I gave a 9. Unbelievable it didn''t do better! Cheers....Martin', '2005-07-11 01:22:27.000000', NULL, 0),
