(1524954, 199291, 22734, '<td valign="top">They look almost like basketballs. A great macro with good texture. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'They look almost like basketballs. A great macro with good texture. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.', '2005-07-11 01:44:42.000000', NULL, 0),
