(1524978, 198803, 714, '<td valign="top">This is the most creative shot I have seen in sometime.  Very well put together.  congrats!!!!!!</td>', 'This is the most creative shot I have seen in sometime.  Very well put together.  congrats!!!!!!', '2005-07-11 01:48:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524980, 198816, 22734, '<td valign="top">Inede: a masterful capture and caught at an angle to maximize the dof. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.</td>', 'Inede: a masterful capture and caught at an angle to maximize the dof. Congratulations on your top 10 finish.', '2005-07-11 01:48:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524985, 199586, 8891, '<td valign="top">Thanks Robert, Steve, Joey and Daniel! I appreciate it and all the great comments and votes. Didn''t ribbon but I got over a 7 for the first time. Guess I''ll have to reset my goals or get another camera or something.  What a week! I hope to have the pleasure again soon, but not next week...whew I am stinking in circles and family! LOL!  RoB</td>', 'Thanks Robert, Steve, Joey and Daniel! I appreciate it and all the great comments and votes. Didn''t ribbon but I got over a 7 for the first time. Guess I''ll have to reset my goals or get another camera or something.  What a week! I hope to have the pleasure again soon, but not next week...whew I am stinking in circles and family! LOL!  RoB', '2005-07-11 01:49:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1524987, 198655, 23456, '<td valign="top">In response to rscorp, this shot was not telephoto, I was up close and personal with this little one. It is a juvenile and so docile that I literally had the lens in its face and it didn''t mind. The parents have been coming around for some time and bring their babies every year !</td>', 'In response to rscorp, this shot was not telephoto, I was up close and personal with this little one. It is a juvenile and so docile that I literally had the lens in its face and it didn''t mind. The parents have been coming around for some time and bring their babies every year !', '2005-07-11 01:49:07.000000', NULL, 0),
