(1525485, 199631, 25433, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dwterry:</b></div><hr/><i> Looks like we were shooting the same type of cactus...  :-)<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=198761" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/354/thumb/198761.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/354/thumb/198761.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/354/thumb/198761.jpg"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hah! I actually have no idea what type of cactus it was, yours is somewhat more macro that mine..... you win :)</td>', 'Originally posted by dwterry: Looks like we were shooting the same type of cactus...  :-)    Hah! I actually have no idea what type of cactus it was, yours is somewhat more macro that mine..... you win :)', '2005-07-11 04:21:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(1525508, 197970, 25355, '<td valign="top">Yes, another dragonfly. Of course, I thought there''d be a lot of them in the challenge, but I also take a lot of photos of dragonflies as there are so many of them in Japan. I can''t quite identify this one from the pictures in my Japanese dragonfly book, but it''s pretty common in my area.<br/>   I had actually put this one in as a placeholder - my original idea was to take a macro of some new kitchen sponges I had bought, if only to get away from the bugs.<br/>   On Friday, the score was 6.995 or thereabouts, but it steadily declined over the weekend... and especially it dipped in the last few hours.</td>', 'Yes, another dragonfly. Of course, I thought there''d be a lot of them in the challenge, but I also take a lot of photos of dragonflies as there are so many of them in Japan. I can''t quite identify this one from the pictures in my Japanese dragonfly book, but it''s pretty common in my area.   I had actually put this one in as a placeholder - my original idea was to take a macro of some new kitchen sponges I had bought, if only to get away from the bugs.   On Friday, the score was 6.995 or thereabouts, but it steadily declined over the weekend... and especially it dipped in the last few hours.', '2005-07-11 04:34:08.000000', NULL, 0),
