(1526208, 197333, 20530, '<td valign="top">Not that macro? Are you kidding? Macro means life size or larger. If that''s not macro, I''d sure hate to meet your subject:)<br/> <br/>I didn''t get a chance to vote on the macro challenge, but I would have given this a 10. Great detail, color, DOF and composition. I absolutely love it; and it inspires me to keep on plugging along.</td>', 'Not that macro? Are you kidding? Macro means life size or larger. If that''s not macro, I''d sure hate to meet your subject:) I didn''t get a chance to vote on the macro challenge, but I would have given this a 10. Great detail, color, DOF and composition. I absolutely love it; and it inspires me to keep on plugging along.', '2005-07-11 10:50:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(1526213, 197333, 4226, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by greatandsmall:</b></div><hr/><i> Not that macro? Are you kidding? Macro means life size or larger. If that''s not macro, I''d sure hate to meet your subject:) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Oh yeah, its macro, but I was referring to the shot I took just two days before the challenge started, this one is not that magnified, but its look better :)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=195398" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/4226/thumb/195398.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/4226/thumb/195398.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/4226/thumb/195398.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by greatandsmall: Not that macro? Are you kidding? Macro means life size or larger. If that''s not macro, I''d sure hate to meet your subject:)  Oh yeah, its macro, but I was referring to the shot I took just two days before the challenge started, this one is not that magnified, but its look better :)', '2005-07-11 10:54:07.000000', NULL, 0),
