(1526942, 198656, 39221, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone here, this shot was taken hand held and was really just a test of the ol'' water droplet shots i''ve wanted to try, very happy with the 20th place the image achieved however - but knew it would always be beaten by some freaky up close bug shot :-)<br/> <br/>This is also uncropped - so bar some very very minor post processing, this is straight out of the camera!<br/> <br/>Glad you enjoyed it, and thanks for all the feedback! :-)</td>', 'Thanks to everyone here, this shot was taken hand held and was really just a test of the ol'' water droplet shots i''ve wanted to try, very happy with the 20th place the image achieved however - but knew it would always be beaten by some freaky up close bug shot :-) This is also uncropped - so bar some very very minor post processing, this is straight out of the camera! Glad you enjoyed it, and thanks for all the feedback! :-)', '2005-07-11 14:04:47.000000', NULL, 0),
