(1527648, 198763, 25397, '<td valign="top">Nice warm tones and definatly close up.<br/>And don''t worry about your Photographer''s Average<br/>Seriously, it''s one of the worst features here on this site.<br/>Everyone has to start somewhere and improve, ignore it.</td>', 'Nice warm tones and definatly close up.And don''t worry about your Photographer''s AverageSeriously, it''s one of the worst features here on this site.Everyone has to start somewhere and improve, ignore it.', '2005-07-11 17:50:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(1527658, 198763, 13026, '<td valign="top">Thanks Joey!  I liked this pic a lot...It got my PA up a teeny bit!  hehe  Yeah, I know everyone has to start somewhere--it''s just, why couldn''t I start at like 6.5 (like heida--jeez!) and then just go up from there?  :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks Joey!  I liked this pic a lot...It got my PA up a teeny bit!  hehe  Yeah, I know everyone has to start somewhere--it''s just, why couldn''t I start at like 6.5 (like heida--jeez!) and then just go up from there?  :) ', '2005-07-11 17:55:04.000000', NULL, 0),
