(1528454, 198803, 40526, '<td valign="top">great. Focus 10.</td>', 'great. Focus 10.', '2005-07-11 22:54:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1528536, 199650, 39850, '<td valign="top">I missed this somehow during my ''voting/comments''.  This is very nice.  No idea the name, I''m guessing you don''t either.  I like the colors.  For me, the only two things that would make this ''better'' would be a fine focus on the ''flowers'' (the middle ones) and perhaps a tighter crop or a nudge to the left, to bring the largest ''head'' to the right foreground, and keeping/accentuating that depth you already have.</td>', 'I missed this somehow during my ''voting/comments''.  This is very nice.  No idea the name, I''m guessing you don''t either.  I like the colors.  For me, the only two things that would make this ''better'' would be a fine focus on the ''flowers'' (the middle ones) and perhaps a tighter crop or a nudge to the left, to bring the largest ''head'' to the right foreground, and keeping/accentuating that depth you already have.', '2005-07-11 23:14:54.000000', NULL, 0),
