(1528675, 199074, 19708, '<td valign="top">Why do I have to overwhealming desire to reach out and pull that ring... <img alt="'' . substr(''//users.pandora.be/eforum/emoticons4u/happy/046.gif'', strrpos(''//users.pandora.be/eforum/emoticons4u/happy/046.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//users.pandora.be/eforum/emoticons4u/happy/046.gif"/> <br/> <br/>Great detail - right down to the texture on the tongue.<br/>Congrats on another top 20!<br/></td>', 'Why do I have to overwhealming desire to reach out and pull that ring...   Great detail - right down to the texture on the tongue.Congrats on another top 20!', '2005-07-11 23:56:16.000000', NULL, 0),
