(1528759, 199514, 2764, '<td valign="top">A technically perfect picture - but why?  As a macro there is no advice to give, your focus is incredible.  But other than that, what does it offer of interest?  I questioned the pink background, and the grey coin does look good on pink but I bet you could have improved your score half a point simply by putting it on a flag, or something with american colors.</td>', 'A technically perfect picture - but why?  As a macro there is no advice to give, your focus is incredible.  But other than that, what does it offer of interest?  I questioned the pink background, and the grey coin does look good on pink but I bet you could have improved your score half a point simply by putting it on a flag, or something with american colors.', '2005-07-12 00:18:18.000000', NULL, 0),
