(1530995, 198815, 37444, '<td valign="top">BW Club<br/> <br/>I like the contrasts here in the glass. The roofline bothers me and there is too much white outside. Cropping the top section off (the one with the circle) helps a bit. The fruit slices seem to dark and I would like to see more detail there. The reflections in the wine glass the bottom of the vase are the best parts of this photo.</td>', 'BW Club I like the contrasts here in the glass. The roofline bothers me and there is too much white outside. Cropping the top section off (the one with the circle) helps a bit. The fruit slices seem to dark and I would like to see more detail there. The reflections in the wine glass the bottom of the vase are the best parts of this photo.', '2005-07-12 21:08:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(1530997, 199052, 32767, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful. One of my faves and should have placed much higher.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful. One of my faves and should have placed much higher.', '2005-07-12 21:08:23.000000', NULL, 0),
