(1532644, 199337, 12253, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  This was way underrated.  Composition, colors, sharpness, all superb.  I am sure this looks even better in print.  And wonderfully different in this large group of macros.  <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comment on my shot--it reminded me to visit your portfolio, which is always a pleasure, you do such great work!</td>', 'Fantastic.  This was way underrated.  Composition, colors, sharpness, all superb.  I am sure this looks even better in print.  And wonderfully different in this large group of macros.   Thanks for your comment on my shot--it reminded me to visit your portfolio, which is always a pleasure, you do such great work!', '2005-07-13 11:46:52.000000', NULL, 0),
