(1534229, 198803, 20530, '<td valign="top">I love that you can win a blue with pure tongue-in-cheek. That''s my kind of humor. And if you''re going to be funny, you might as well make a great image too. Congratulations!<br/> <br/>I do have one nit-picky question...why the lint on the ladybug? Maybe I''m over-critical, but it keeps catching my eye.</td>', 'I love that you can win a blue with pure tongue-in-cheek. That''s my kind of humor. And if you''re going to be funny, you might as well make a great image too. Congratulations! I do have one nit-picky question...why the lint on the ladybug? Maybe I''m over-critical, but it keeps catching my eye.', '2005-07-13 22:48:23.000000', NULL, 0),
