(1536697, 199329, 37544, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>I think that this is great!! I wish that there was more focus on the texture of the match though. The wooden match is overexposed. I would have cropped the bottom off under the match. I think that with different cropping and lighting, this entry would have done much better. I hope this was helpful. I am really tired. Good luck in future challenges and God Bless.<br/> <br/>Mandy</td>', '*Critique Club* I think that this is great!! I wish that there was more focus on the texture of the match though. The wooden match is overexposed. I would have cropped the bottom off under the match. I think that with different cropping and lighting, this entry would have done much better. I hope this was helpful. I am really tired. Good luck in future challenges and God Bless. Mandy', '2005-07-15 00:22:33.000000', NULL, 0),
