(4186978, 197333, 82766, '<td valign="top">Hi,<br/>I have almost the same set up 30D + 100mm f/2.8 + 430ex speedlight.<br/>How do you get this magnification of the subject? At 1:1 manual focussing I am not able to see so clearly. Am I missing a point in this whole Macro thing...feeling retarded...</td>', 'Hi,I have almost the same set up 30D + 100mm f/2.8 + 430ex speedlight.How do you get this magnification of the subject? At 1:1 manual focussing I am not able to see so clearly. Am I missing a point in this whole Macro thing...feeling retarded...', '2007-10-22 10:16:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4230440, 199447, 43463, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful capture! Love the vivid and bold greens on the face of this dragonfly. But the most defining feature of this capture is the great level of details you show us in this insect! From the individual ''diamond'' shapes in the compound eyes to the hairs on the face you bring us up close and personal with this bug and show us every detail with sharp clarity.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful capture! Love the vivid and bold greens on the face of this dragonfly. But the most defining feature of this capture is the great level of details you show us in this insect! From the individual ''diamond'' shapes in the compound eyes to the hairs on the face you bring us up close and personal with this bug and show us every detail with sharp clarity.', '2007-11-07 22:45:50.000000', NULL, 0),
