(4656782, 199586, 8891, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by pattahlokkah:</b></div><hr/><i> why is there so many of these? i know it is beautiful but when its so repetitive its kind of weird. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>a) I have no imagination anymore<br/>b) They were shot with different cameras and it amuses me to see the difference in detail of the refractions from camera to camera.<br/>c) The set up is the same....the drop formations change and the backgrounds have changed. <br/>d) Thanks for asking.</td>', 'Originally posted by pattahlokkah: why is there so many of these? i know it is beautiful but when its so repetitive its kind of weird.   a) I have no imagination anymoreb) They were shot with different cameras and it amuses me to see the difference in detail of the refractions from camera to camera.c) The set up is the same....the drop formations change and the backgrounds have changed. d) Thanks for asking.', '2008-04-24 01:46:40.000000', NULL, 0),
